(1167151, 145619, 24925, '<td valign="top">Wow, I was just thinking about how all of these self portraits are much too serious and melodramatic...I mean, they''re good, but nobody seems to be lighthearted.  When I saw the title ''inner demons'' I thought "oh no, another one".  But this is different.  It looks real and genuine.  The composition is great.  The focus on the eyes is a bit too soft for my taste, but otherwise this is a fantastic photo that I fear might be underrated in the voting.  We''ll see...I know that I like it.</td>', 'Wow, I was just thinking about how all of these self portraits are much too serious and melodramatic...I mean, they''re good, but nobody seems to be lighthearted.  When I saw the title ''inner demons'' I thought "oh no, another one".  But this is different.  It looks real and genuine.  The composition is great.  The focus on the eyes is a bit too soft for my taste, but otherwise this is a fantastic photo that I fear might be underrated in the voting.  We''ll see...I know that I like it.', '2005-02-14 00:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
