(1167761, 146577, 28108, '<td valign="top">Wow! I absolutely love this... The negative space reveals a lot of soul. The light is fabulous, the bright spot behind your head is a very nice (noticed) touch. The model is wonderful ;-). Very nice. I''ve only seen a few so far, but yours already look like a ribbon. Good luck!</td>', 'Wow! I absolutely love this... The negative space reveals a lot of soul. The light is fabulous, the bright spot behind your head is a very nice (noticed) touch. The model is wonderful ;-). Very nice. I''ve only seen a few so far, but yours already look like a ribbon. Good luck!', '2005-02-14 03:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
