(1167856, 146162, 7263, '<td valign="top">what''s "Sky Entire"? Lol - you need to cut down on those lengthy titles.<br/>I think you know it''s going to come last so i shant even bother to say it.<br/>Nice to be creative but not good for DPC.</td>', 'what''s "Sky Entire"? Lol - you need to cut down on those lengthy titles.I think you know it''s going to come last so i shant even bother to say it.Nice to be creative but not good for DPC.', '2005-02-14 04:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167859, 146882, 8643, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and the alignment is excellent - I know it isn''t easy!</td>', 'Neat idea and the alignment is excellent - I know it isn''t easy!', '2005-02-14 04:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167862, 145438, 23251, '<td valign="top">Your background is all out of focus, you should have centred your model and a better looking model would have helped! ;)<br/>Seriously now.  Really nice Bokeh effect, I like the catch lights in your eyes and great clarity particularly in the eyes where it really counts for a portrait.  IMHO The red strip is a little distracting and the back of the neck where the collar sticks out a fraction.  Very nice photo!</td>', 'Your background is all out of focus, you should have centred your model and a better looking model would have helped! ;)Seriously now.  Really nice Bokeh effect, I like the catch lights in your eyes and great clarity particularly in the eyes where it really counts for a portrait.  IMHO The red strip is a little distracting and the back of the neck where the collar sticks out a fraction.  Very nice photo!', '2005-02-14 04:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167867, 146350, 8643, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  Maybe I would have ligtened it just a bit and cropped square? 8</td>', 'Nice portrait.  Maybe I would have ligtened it just a bit and cropped square? 8', '2005-02-14 04:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167869, 146843, 8643, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it was intended but maybe I would have preferred less blowout on the face.</td>', 'I''m sure it was intended but maybe I would have preferred less blowout on the face.', '2005-02-14 04:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167871, 146883, 8643, '<td valign="top">The hand dominates, is out of focus and therefore, maybe,becomes distracting?</td>', 'The hand dominates, is out of focus and therefore, maybe,becomes distracting?', '2005-02-14 04:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167874, 146162, 10170, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo for a completely different challenge I am sure.  In this challenge though it really has the "Hmmm, have this nice photo, how can I force it to fit, and then convince myself it is "thinking outside the box".  Not a self portrait in any REALISTIC sense.</td>', 'Lovely photo for a completely different challenge I am sure.  In this challenge though it really has the "Hmmm, have this nice photo, how can I force it to fit, and then convince myself it is "thinking outside the box".  Not a self portrait in any REALISTIC sense.', '2005-02-14 05:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167877, 146438, 8643, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2005-02-14 05:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
