(1167924, 146450, 23251, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, I just wish that I could have seen more of the baby as he/she is kinda tucked away in the corner.  Great lighting and natural feel to the whole photo.  Well done!</td>', 'Lovely photo, I just wish that I could have seen more of the baby as he/she is kinda tucked away in the corner.  Great lighting and natural feel to the whole photo.  Well done!', '2005-02-14 05:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
