(1167926, 146757, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny as always aren''t ya Arnit :))) This will do well (again!)</td>', 'Funny as always aren''t ya Arnit :))) This will do well (again!)', '2005-02-14 05:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167929, 146882, 5728, '<td valign="top">It fits perfectly, clever idea!</td>', 'It fits perfectly, clever idea!', '2005-02-14 05:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167930, 146858, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice, deep contrasty image. You have a very natural look on your face, I like this a lot.</td>', 'Nice, deep contrasty image. You have a very natural look on your face, I like this a lot.', '2005-02-14 05:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167933, 146587, 5728, '<td valign="top">Fantastic although I am not really too fond of the background you chose with the steel frame running through your head. Everything else is good though, super lighting and expression.</td>', 'Fantastic although I am not really too fond of the background you chose with the steel frame running through your head. Everything else is good though, super lighting and expression.', '2005-02-14 05:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167934, 146247, 8643, '<td valign="top">Neat idea but maybe over NeatImaged?</td>', 'Neat idea but maybe over NeatImaged?', '2005-02-14 05:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167937, 146563, 5728, '<td valign="top">Hey it''s you :)) Nice lighting and composition, the detail comes through very well... and man do you have white teeth :)</td>', 'Hey it''s you :)) Nice lighting and composition, the detail comes through very well... and man do you have white teeth :)', '2005-02-14 05:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167938, 146871, 8643, '<td valign="top">Made me stop and look - a very nice, strong portrait.  Maybe a slight rearrangement of the hair to cover the slight distraction of the background to the (viewers) right  of the neck but it is so difficult when you can''t see yourself!</td>', 'Made me stop and look - a very nice, strong portrait.  Maybe a slight rearrangement of the hair to cover the slight distraction of the background to the (viewers) right  of the neck but it is so difficult when you can''t see yourself!', '2005-02-14 05:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167940, 146864, 8643, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done - helps to have an attractive subject!</td>', 'Beautifully done - helps to have an attractive subject!', '2005-02-14 05:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167942, 146843, 5728, '<td valign="top">It''s your red hair that really boosts this image, especially in combination with the hard light. I like it :)</td>', 'It''s your red hair that really boosts this image, especially in combination with the hard light. I like it :)', '2005-02-14 05:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167944, 146459, 5728, '<td valign="top">Like something right out of an old fashioned commercial. It works for me :)</td>', 'Like something right out of an old fashioned commercial. It works for me :)', '2005-02-14 05:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167946, 146759, 5728, '<td valign="top">You''re pretty good at portraits aren''t ya JD, good detail!</td>', 'You''re pretty good at portraits aren''t ya JD, good detail!', '2005-02-14 05:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167953, 146483, 6999, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, but I have problems with the execution of it - primarily with you light: if you could have kept the clean focus on the ''picture'', and yet kept more definition and shape in the hands, background etc. I think the shot would have had more impact. It looks on-board flash-lit, and that rarely makes for a strong image.</td>', 'i like the idea, but I have problems with the execution of it - primarily with you light: if you could have kept the clean focus on the ''picture'', and yet kept more definition and shape in the hands, background etc. I think the shot would have had more impact. It looks on-board flash-lit, and that rarely makes for a strong image.', '2005-02-14 05:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167954, 146861, 15407, '<td valign="top">Hmmm light in the eyes confirms the title!</td>', 'Hmmm light in the eyes confirms the title!', '2005-02-14 05:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167955, 146250, 6999, '<td valign="top">On-board flash problems: makes the light very flat, and ends to over-expose things nearer to the camera, such as the near shoulder. You background is also very close, which in this case just serves to show a very strong and hard shadow, and the direct flash has caused unfortunate shiny areas on the face, and a lack of a sense of texture.</td>', 'On-board flash problems: makes the light very flat, and ends to over-expose things nearer to the camera, such as the near shoulder. You background is also very close, which in this case just serves to show a very strong and hard shadow, and the direct flash has caused unfortunate shiny areas on the face, and a lack of a sense of texture.', '2005-02-14 05:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167956, 145726, 15407, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and gave me a good laugh... good job of keeping the dome on top from reflecting a whole lotta light ! I like it !</td>', 'Great lighting and gave me a good laugh... good job of keeping the dome on top from reflecting a whole lotta light ! I like it !', '2005-02-14 05:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167957, 146230, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all, although i''d have worked on that shiny line down the nose - after a moment oor two it becomes a major distraction in the image for me. Light otherwise is excellent, and there''s a good sense of ''honesty'' about it, which i like.</td>', 'Not bad at all, although i''d have worked on that shiny line down the nose - after a moment oor two it becomes a major distraction in the image for me. Light otherwise is excellent, and there''s a good sense of ''honesty'' about it, which i like.', '2005-02-14 05:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167958, 146808, 15407, '<td valign="top">Very nice ... I would have liked it even more if you would have cloned out the light source from the whites of you eyes.</td>', 'Very nice ... I would have liked it even more if you would have cloned out the light source from the whites of you eyes.', '2005-02-14 05:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167960, 146420, 6999, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking.</td>', 'Breathtaking.', '2005-02-14 05:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167970, 145897, 15407, '<td valign="top">It looks light you may have fought a battle of noise with this shot... perhaps a bit too much of what I refer to as the neatimage effect.  All in all I like the effect of the lighting and setup ...</td>', 'It looks light you may have fought a battle of noise with this shot... perhaps a bit too much of what I refer to as the neatimage effect.  All in all I like the effect of the lighting and setup ...', '2005-02-14 06:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167980, 145395, 27503, '<td valign="top">Cool photo ... I like it a lot!</td>', 'Cool photo ... I like it a lot!', '2005-02-14 06:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167982, 146871, 15407, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I really like this portrait .... It has everything to do with the fact that your beautiful eyes, hair &amp; freckles remind me of the Celtic Princess I''ve been looking for all of my life.  Your beauty has taken my breath away... I hope that my comments are not out of line ,,,, The color of the background is also a prfect complioment to you coloring!  Even the lighting was done very well ... Neamhchoitianta  Ailleacht !!!</td>', 'Wow!  I really like this portrait .... It has everything to do with the fact that your beautiful eyes, hair & freckles remind me of the Celtic Princess I''ve been looking for all of my life.  Your beauty has taken my breath away... I hope that my comments are not out of line ,,,, The color of the background is also a prfect complioment to you coloring!  Even the lighting was done very well ... Neamhchoitianta  Ailleacht !!!', '2005-02-14 06:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167985, 146278, 15407, '<td valign="top">A very cleaver presentation and photo in the screen!</td>', 'A very cleaver presentation and photo in the screen!', '2005-02-14 06:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167995, 146435, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and angle.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and angle.', '2005-02-14 06:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1167999, 146555, 9581, '<td valign="top">I think this neat with the ghost like affect (thats what I call it) So I am giving you a 10 !</td>', 'I think this neat with the ghost like affect (thats what I call it) So I am giving you a 10 !', '2005-02-14 06:44:39.000000', NULL, 1);
