(1168371, 145269, 20204, '<td valign="top">The background trim piece''s intersection with the subject''s head is distracting.  I''m also not comfortable with the way the camera is cut off, and a partial finger is showing.  I think a different perspective and some cropping would go a long way.</td>', 'The background trim piece''s intersection with the subject''s head is distracting.  I''m also not comfortable with the way the camera is cut off, and a partial finger is showing.  I think a different perspective and some cropping would go a long way.', '2005-02-14 10:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168372, 145879, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and post processing - not too overdone, but has a very professional feel to it.</td>', 'Great lighting and post processing - not too overdone, but has a very professional feel to it.', '2005-02-14 10:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168374, 145577, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the natural feel to this exporession; It doesn''t have an artifical feel to it.  Also like your choice of lighting.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the natural feel to this exporession; It doesn''t have an artifical feel to it.  Also like your choice of lighting.  Nicely done.', '2005-02-14 10:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168376, 145571, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the expression very much, and the painter theme works well for me.  Unfortunately, the high key background is so brilliant that I feel it distracts from the subject.  An uncluttered natural backdrop would feel more at harmony in this image to me.</td>', 'I like the expression very much, and the painter theme works well for me.  Unfortunately, the high key background is so brilliant that I feel it distracts from the subject.  An uncluttered natural backdrop would feel more at harmony in this image to me.', '2005-02-14 10:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168379, 146715, 20204, '<td valign="top">There is a detached quality to this image, which I believe creates a barrier to the subject''s essence.  You have captured yourself with good technical detail, but there is an element of personality / emotion which fell short.  I think it might be improved with more eye contact, or at a minimum getting the leftmost eye unobstraucted by nose &amp; glasses frame.</td>', 'There is a detached quality to this image, which I believe creates a barrier to the subject''s essence.  You have captured yourself with good technical detail, but there is an element of personality / emotion which fell short.  I think it might be improved with more eye contact, or at a minimum getting the leftmost eye unobstraucted by nose & glasses frame.', '2005-02-14 10:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168384, 145219, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the expression and lighting.  The background  works nicely as well.  IO''m having a little trouble with the amount of cropping on the head in relation to the off-center composition.  I can''t explain it better than that unfortunately...  I like the image, but I feel like it needs a different balance.</td>', 'I love the expression and lighting.  The background  works nicely as well.  IO''m having a little trouble with the amount of cropping on the head in relation to the off-center composition.  I can''t explain it better than that unfortunately...  I like the image, but I feel like it needs a different balance.', '2005-02-14 10:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168386, 146882, 20204, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is extremely creative.  It feels a bit out of focus in the "exposed" area, or perhaps slightly overexposed,  Also, excellent use of the frame - no dead space; It''s all put to good use and very well balanced.  I''d like to see a bit more contrast, but have to give you two thumbs up for a GREAT idea which was executed wonderfully!</td>', 'Wow!  This is extremely creative.  It feels a bit out of focus in the "exposed" area, or perhaps slightly overexposed,  Also, excellent use of the frame - no dead space; It''s all put to good use and very well balanced.  I''d like to see a bit more contrast, but have to give you two thumbs up for a GREAT idea which was executed wonderfully!', '2005-02-14 10:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168389, 145220, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very unique toning on this image...  Kind of a vampire-esque look to it...  I like that your background has things in it, but they are very well managed so as not to be a distraction.  Interesting when such a dominant foreground subject isn''t necessarily 100% of the shot, the background really feel like a significant part of the feel of this shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very unique toning on this image...  Kind of a vampire-esque look to it...  I like that your background has things in it, but they are very well managed so as not to be a distraction.  Interesting when such a dominant foreground subject isn''t necessarily 100% of the shot, the background really feel like a significant part of the feel of this shot.  Nice work.', '2005-02-14 10:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168393, 146162, 20204, '<td valign="top">Although this image has good qualities, I''m having trouble with this as a work of self portraiture entry.  You could have tried to get some kind of a reflection of yourself into that droplet, and you''d have a much higher scoring entry.</td>', 'Although this image has good qualities, I''m having trouble with this as a work of self portraiture entry.  You could have tried to get some kind of a reflection of yourself into that droplet, and you''d have a much higher scoring entry.', '2005-02-14 10:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168394, 145571, 16230, '<td valign="top">One of the things I love about Norman Rockwell''s illustrations was his use of color, and rich (even over-saturated) colors might have made this fine image even better. The composition and other technical aspects are just wonderful. One of my top picks. Well done!</td>', 'One of the things I love about Norman Rockwell''s illustrations was his use of color, and rich (even over-saturated) colors might have made this fine image even better. The composition and other technical aspects are just wonderful. One of my top picks. Well done!', '2005-02-14 10:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168396, 146859, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  Overall the image feels like it needs some sharpening, but I love the concept!</td>', 'Very creative!  Overall the image feels like it needs some sharpening, but I love the concept!', '2005-02-14 10:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
