(1168415, 145571, 15497, '<td valign="top">The artist :D</td>', 'The artist :D', '2005-02-14 10:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168416, 146357, 20204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes, and the hair is nicely arranged.  You have a bright, wide smile, but I think you weren''t relaxed enough in this one - it feels a bit forced.  The pose in general is flattering though, so you chose well.  It looks like you may have not had the camera on a steady mount, or possibly the focus wasn''t set quite right as this image is very soft; it seems that texture is nearly lost in some of the shirt.  You might try this shot with sidelighting from a hardware store work light - nothing fancy.  Just something to bring out your features more.  It may also work well from behind by illuminating your har to create contrast from the background.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes, and the hair is nicely arranged.  You have a bright, wide smile, but I think you weren''t relaxed enough in this one - it feels a bit forced.  The pose in general is flattering though, so you chose well.  It looks like you may have not had the camera on a steady mount, or possibly the focus wasn''t set quite right as this image is very soft; it seems that texture is nearly lost in some of the shirt.  You might try this shot with sidelighting from a hardware store work light - nothing fancy.  Just something to bring out your features more.  It may also work well from behind by illuminating your har to create contrast from the background.', '2005-02-14 10:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168417, 146507, 15497, '<td valign="top">finally a creative shot!! 9 good luck!!</td>', 'finally a creative shot!! 9 good luck!!', '2005-02-14 10:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168421, 146211, 15497, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I wish I could have seen more of your face, the skin tone is a tad redish also. but very creative. 8</td>', 'Interesting shot. I wish I could have seen more of your face, the skin tone is a tad redish also. but very creative. 8', '2005-02-14 10:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168422, 145749, 16230, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo of a beautiful woman. One of my favorite images in this challenge. Well done!<br/></td>', 'A beautiful photo of a beautiful woman. One of my favorite images in this challenge. Well done!', '2005-02-14 10:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168423, 146592, 15497, '<td valign="top">The grain here actually work quite well. I love the composition too. It''s clean &amp; simple, yet very interesting. Great textures too. I would want it to be more sharp though. but it''s top10 here. 9</td>', 'The grain here actually work quite well. I love the composition too. It''s clean & simple, yet very interesting. Great textures too. I would want it to be more sharp though. but it''s top10 here. 9', '2005-02-14 10:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168426, 145078, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great pose, and a very natural look.  You''ve captured emotion in this shot, which is commendable.  I think the high-key ecceft might be a touch overdone as your cheek and hair are completely blown out on the left.  A subtle photoshop edit and this would be an amazing shot.</td>', 'Great pose, and a very natural look.  You''ve captured emotion in this shot, which is commendable.  I think the high-key ecceft might be a touch overdone as your cheek and hair are completely blown out on the left.  A subtle photoshop edit and this would be an amazing shot.', '2005-02-14 10:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168430, 146760, 20204, '<td valign="top">The background really overpowers the subject in this image...  Doesn''t feel like it''s giving me insight into the subject''s essence.</td>', 'The background really overpowers the subject in this image...  Doesn''t feel like it''s giving me insight into the subject''s essence.', '2005-02-14 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168431, 144823, 2223, '<td valign="top">Hi Jacko!! Little Stephanie looks more pink now, thats good. Congrats again!!</td>', 'Hi Jacko!! Little Stephanie looks more pink now, thats good. Congrats again!!', '2005-02-14 10:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168434, 146596, 20204, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is absolutley beautiful.  It captures light and emotion.  Well done!</td>', 'Wow!  This is absolutley beautiful.  It captures light and emotion.  Well done!', '2005-02-14 10:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168435, 146450, 16230, '<td valign="top">Well, there goes any chance for a blue ribbon on my photo. This is a ribbon winner for sure. Well done!<br/></td>', 'Well, there goes any chance for a blue ribbon on my photo. This is a ribbon winner for sure. Well done!', '2005-02-14 10:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168439, 144919, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the grain and high key effect - cretes a unique mood to the image.  Your expression is intriguing as well.  This is excellent.</td>', 'I like the grain and high key effect - cretes a unique mood to the image.  Your expression is intriguing as well.  This is excellent.', '2005-02-14 10:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168440, 146302, 19010, '<td valign="top">having trouble loading your shot. I can only see the top 3/4 of the photo. So to be as fair as possible. I''ll asume your better than average and give you a 6. Sorry this might have been a 10 or a 2 not sure. please contact the sc. I tried loading this 5 times and your shot freezes every time.</td>', 'having trouble loading your shot. I can only see the top 3/4 of the photo. So to be as fair as possible. I''ll asume your better than average and give you a 6. Sorry this might have been a 10 or a 2 not sure. please contact the sc. I tried loading this 5 times and your shot freezes every time.', '2005-02-14 10:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168442, 146246, 15497, '<td valign="top">straight forward, crisp and clean, skin tone is also ok, I would have wanted more contrast, but then again it''s not my photo. :) did you use shadow highlight here? anyway good capture. 7</td>', 'straight forward, crisp and clean, skin tone is also ok, I would have wanted more contrast, but then again it''s not my photo. :) did you use shadow highlight here? anyway good capture. 7', '2005-02-14 10:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168444, 144824, 15497, '<td valign="top">yeah, creative and cool. nice use of colors, and interesting look (though not 100% belivable :) yet with you top20, 8</td>', 'yeah, creative and cool. nice use of colors, and interesting look (though not 100% belivable :) yet with you top20, 8', '2005-02-14 10:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168445, 146577, 20204, '<td valign="top">Hard to be anonymous in a self portrait.  As usual, very creative technically excellent work.  How long until you put out your first book?  Seriously though, this is one of the first portraits I critiqued that uses a lot of negative space, but does so in harmony with the subject.  Your exporession is perfect for the vast frame, and subtle shading in the backdrop.  I expect to see this near the top.</td>', 'Hard to be anonymous in a self portrait.  As usual, very creative technically excellent work.  How long until you put out your first book?  Seriously though, this is one of the first portraits I critiqued that uses a lot of negative space, but does so in harmony with the subject.  Your exporession is perfect for the vast frame, and subtle shading in the backdrop.  I expect to see this near the top.', '2005-02-14 10:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168447, 144809, 15497, '<td valign="top">great concept, however I find it a little too harsh on the lightning, also a little under exposed for my taste. but it''s 100% honest and that counts a lot. well done 8</td>', 'great concept, however I find it a little too harsh on the lightning, also a little under exposed for my taste. but it''s 100% honest and that counts a lot. well done 8', '2005-02-14 10:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168449, 146882, 15497, '<td valign="top">if this was black &amp; white it would be a 8 here, but the colors totally ruins it for me. 5</td>', 'if this was black & white it would be a 8 here, but the colors totally ruins it for me. 5', '2005-02-14 10:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168450, 146008, 20204, '<td valign="top">Highlights are overblown for my tsates; all texture is lost on the neck area.  Needs a bit more balance between the top and bottom.</td>', 'Highlights are overblown for my tsates; all texture is lost on the neck area.  Needs a bit more balance between the top and bottom.', '2005-02-14 10:44:30.000000', NULL, 1);
