(1168451, 146878, 15497, '<td valign="top">creative, well done and interesting choice of composition. getting a 8 here gl</td>', 'creative, well done and interesting choice of composition. getting a 8 here gl', '2005-02-14 10:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168456, 146836, 15497, '<td valign="top">wtf? what kind of mobile is that? 1980 something? :) Creative and interesting, makes me think of my stressfull day. 8</td>', 'wtf? what kind of mobile is that? 1980 something? :) Creative and interesting, makes me think of my stressfull day. 8', '2005-02-14 10:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168457, 146370, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, and great use of shadows to create a mood.   I''d almost like to see your head tilted a bit to the side, or perhaps down rather then straight on...  Just a thought.</td>', 'Nice lighting, and great use of shadows to create a mood.   I''d almost like to see your head tilted a bit to the side, or perhaps down rather then straight on...  Just a thought.', '2005-02-14 10:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168460, 146875, 20204, '<td valign="top">The colors feel a bit awkward to me...  Very natural expression though - nice job!</td>', 'The colors feel a bit awkward to me...  Very natural expression though - nice job!', '2005-02-14 10:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168462, 145742, 15497, '<td valign="top">brown ribbon it is..</td>', 'brown ribbon it is..', '2005-02-14 10:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168464, 146577, 15497, '<td valign="top">he darling! once again you deliver a fantastic image with perfect lighting &amp; simplicity. Wish you all the best, and a ribbon for sure. :) 10</td>', 'he darling! once again you deliver a fantastic image with perfect lighting & simplicity. Wish you all the best, and a ribbon for sure. :) 10', '2005-02-14 10:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168465, 146864, 16230, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I really like the high-key look here. I might have left those pretty eyes as they were though.</td>', 'Beautiful! I really like the high-key look here. I might have left those pretty eyes as they were though.', '2005-02-14 10:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168466, 145281, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great composition...  The eyes are justifiably the best detail to draw attention to, but the partially cropped nose ring is distracting; in this shot is doesn''t seem to contribute to who you are, it just draws my eyes away from your eyes, which seem to be the real subject.</td>', 'Great composition...  The eyes are justifiably the best detail to draw attention to, but the partially cropped nose ring is distracting; in this shot is doesn''t seem to contribute to who you are, it just draws my eyes away from your eyes, which seem to be the real subject.', '2005-02-14 10:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168467, 146349, 15497, '<td valign="top">You got my vote man! Very well done, classic and proves a good technique. lots of detail to look at, yet a decent composition. top10 9</td>', 'You got my vote man! Very well done, classic and proves a good technique. lots of detail to look at, yet a decent composition. top10 9', '2005-02-14 10:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168468, 146567, 15497, '<td valign="top">I believe it. Honest look, nice colors/contrast. 8</td>', 'I believe it. Honest look, nice colors/contrast. 8', '2005-02-14 10:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168469, 146742, 18349, '<td valign="top">Such a cute idea for a portrait!  Great desat as well.  :o)</td>', 'Such a cute idea for a portrait!  Great desat as well.  :o)', '2005-02-14 10:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168470, 146881, 15497, '<td valign="top">a little unsharp/soft, but extra points ++ for creativety! well done 7</td>', 'a little unsharp/soft, but extra points ++ for creativety! well done 7', '2005-02-14 10:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168472, 146563, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative framing, great lighting, great expression...  This is just excellent in every way!</td>', 'Creative framing, great lighting, great expression...  This is just excellent in every way!', '2005-02-14 10:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168473, 146624, 20204, '<td valign="top">Seems to be either focus or motion blur issues in this image...  I''m also picking up a green color cast which feels abnormal.</td>', 'Seems to be either focus or motion blur issues in this image...  I''m also picking up a green color cast which feels abnormal.', '2005-02-14 10:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168475, 146714, 15497, '<td valign="top">wouldn''t it be cool if you head pop''d up and away from the camera?</td>', 'wouldn''t it be cool if you head pop''d up and away from the camera?', '2005-02-14 10:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168476, 145799, 15497, '<td valign="top">interesting, fun crop and nice composition, colors are too yellowish for my taste, but ++ on creativety</td>', 'interesting, fun crop and nice composition, colors are too yellowish for my taste, but ++ on creativety', '2005-02-14 10:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168477, 146813, 20204, '<td valign="top">The chin cropping is so subtle, I think I''d have backed up a bit more so it stayed in frame.  Otherwise, nice composition.</td>', 'The chin cropping is so subtle, I think I''d have backed up a bit more so it stayed in frame.  Otherwise, nice composition.', '2005-02-14 10:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168478, 146535, 15497, '<td valign="top">like usm and neatimage? :D</td>', 'like usm and neatimage? :D', '2005-02-14 10:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168484, 146841, 15497, '<td valign="top">nice colors, nice lightning and enough sharpness :) 8</td>', 'nice colors, nice lightning and enough sharpness :) 8', '2005-02-14 10:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168485, 145611, 20204, '<td valign="top">Extremely creative postprocessing, and excellent composition.  Great work!</td>', 'Extremely creative postprocessing, and excellent composition.  Great work!', '2005-02-14 10:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168489, 145749, 20204, '<td valign="top">To me, this image screams to be reinterpreted in a duotone...  The forms and lines are so crisp that the colors almost distract from the stronger qualities of this image.</td>', 'To me, this image screams to be reinterpreted in a duotone...  The forms and lines are so crisp that the colors almost distract from the stronger qualities of this image.', '2005-02-14 10:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168490, 146450, 25232, '<td valign="top">Warm</td>', 'Warm', '2005-02-14 10:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168491, 145121, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very unique perspective, love the range of tonality and the interest the glass gives the shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Very unique perspective, love the range of tonality and the interest the glass gives the shot.  Well done.', '2005-02-14 10:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168493, 146250, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that the negative space is helping...  You''ve a great pose and expression, but I think a portrait cropping would draw more attention to the subject.</td>', 'I''m not sure that the negative space is helping...  You''ve a great pose and expression, but I think a portrait cropping would draw more attention to the subject.', '2005-02-14 10:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168495, 146864, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot!  I love the high key lighting and the expression is wonderful.  Very well composed also!  :o)</td>', 'What a beautiful shot!  I love the high key lighting and the expression is wonderful.  Very well composed also!  :o)', '2005-02-14 10:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168497, 145988, 16230, '<td valign="top">While the technical aspects are quite good, the bag over the head makes this more of a humor shot than a self-portrait.</td>', 'While the technical aspects are quite good, the bag over the head makes this more of a humor shot than a self-portrait.', '2005-02-14 10:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168498, 145726, 2223, '<td valign="top">LOL! too funny.7</td>', 'LOL! too funny.7', '2005-02-14 10:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168503, 146760, 16829, '<td valign="top">good shot. Unfortuneately, the busy background detracts from the visual impact of the face painting.</td>', 'good shot. Unfortuneately, the busy background detracts from the visual impact of the face painting.', '2005-02-14 11:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
