(1168529, 146876, 2223, '<td valign="top">BradP!!!!</td>', 'BradP!!!!', '2005-02-14 11:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168530, 145395, 20204, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This image is fantastic.  The reflections in the glasses really add a unique feel.  Exposure and detail is excellent as well.  I hope you place well!</td>', 'Wow!  This image is fantastic.  The reflections in the glasses really add a unique feel.  Exposure and detail is excellent as well.  I hope you place well!', '2005-02-14 11:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168532, 146575, 20204, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition, but the image feels a bit soft to me...  With some more sharpness I think it would be incredible.  Possible some fill lighting from the lower left as well.</td>', 'Awesome composition, but the image feels a bit soft to me...  With some more sharpness I think it would be incredible.  Possible some fill lighting from the lower left as well.', '2005-02-14 11:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168534, 146461, 25232, '<td valign="top">I like this. Nice self portrait. <br/> <br/>Bump.</td>', 'I like this. Nice self portrait.  Bump.', '2005-02-14 11:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168537, 146864, 20204, '<td valign="top">High key done right...  Perfect expression, great pose, and the high key really compliments your look in this shot.  Very well done!</td>', 'High key done right...  Perfect expression, great pose, and the high key really compliments your look in this shot.  Very well done!', '2005-02-14 11:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168539, 145604, 25232, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.</td>', 'I like the composition.', '2005-02-14 11:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168540, 146420, 20204, '<td valign="top">In my time on DPC I have given very few 10s...  This is one of them.  This image is amazing.  I don''t know if it''s who you are, but I have rarely seen such synergy from every discernable element of an image.</td>', 'In my time on DPC I have given very few 10s...  This is one of them.  This image is amazing.  I don''t know if it''s who you are, but I have rarely seen such synergy from every discernable element of an image.', '2005-02-14 11:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168548, 146036, 6008, '<td valign="top">You look like a conehead in the reflection! Hrm, I realise the crop and position was done to get the best reflection in the bottle but the cropped background head just looks a little odd. It all seems so squashed and forced. The idea is great and I''m sure it was difficult to get what you achieved, but something seems to be missing.</td>', 'You look like a conehead in the reflection! Hrm, I realise the crop and position was done to get the best reflection in the bottle but the cropped background head just looks a little odd. It all seems so squashed and forced. The idea is great and I''m sure it was difficult to get what you achieved, but something seems to be missing.', '2005-02-14 11:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168549, 146873, 17203, '<td valign="top">Pretty daring, Neil. You''ll get killed on the grain, but the idea is very cool. The strong face-on image makes the profile hard to see, but I do see it. Kudos for thinking outside the cube. 8</td>', 'Pretty daring, Neil. You''ll get killed on the grain, but the idea is very cool. The strong face-on image makes the profile hard to see, but I do see it. Kudos for thinking outside the cube. 8', '2005-02-14 11:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168555, 145078, 6008, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little harsh from the left. I realise you''re going for the high-key look but you have the wrap with details on the right and it disappears into the background on the left, which seems a little odd to me. The left side of your face is also a little too bright from the light also. I like the tilt coming in from the corner.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little harsh from the left. I realise you''re going for the high-key look but you have the wrap with details on the right and it disappears into the background on the left, which seems a little odd to me. The left side of your face is also a little too bright from the light also. I like the tilt coming in from the corner.', '2005-02-14 11:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168567, 146762, 6008, '<td valign="top">The one long water streak almost makes it look like you''re crying. I like the shadowy light, gives it a nice broody feel and drama that compliments the harsh head pose and look. The eye is not completely ''dead'' but I think I would have preferred to see it a little wider and/or with a little more light on it to show the eye more.</td>', 'The one long water streak almost makes it look like you''re crying. I like the shadowy light, gives it a nice broody feel and drama that compliments the harsh head pose and look. The eye is not completely ''dead'' but I think I would have preferred to see it a little wider and/or with a little more light on it to show the eye more.', '2005-02-14 11:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168571, 146652, 33520, '<td valign="top">wow i really like it.great</td>', 'wow i really like it.great', '2005-02-14 11:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
