(1168581, 145988, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is great! Not only is it funny but it''s a good portrait too. The lighting is good, even with the shadows, the pose, the grey suit and walls compliment each other and the chair adds a splash of color contrast. The only thing I would have liked to have seen is a fuller shot without the legs cropped out.</td>', 'This is great! Not only is it funny but it''s a good portrait too. The lighting is good, even with the shadows, the pose, the grey suit and walls compliment each other and the chair adds a splash of color contrast. The only thing I would have liked to have seen is a fuller shot without the legs cropped out.', '2005-02-14 11:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
