(1168920, 146728, 31133, '<td valign="top">Haha, this is perfect! You''ve even got the background just right for your eyes. I love the precise, right-down-the-middle crop of your face. 10!</td>', 'Haha, this is perfect! You''ve even got the background just right for your eyes. I love the precise, right-down-the-middle crop of your face. 10!', '2005-02-14 14:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
