(1168923, 146577, 3032, '<td valign="top">Down there, but a the top of the scoring list is my guess. :)<br/>Very interesting how all that space ''works''.</td>', 'Down there, but a the top of the scoring list is my guess. :)Very interesting how all that space ''works''.', '2005-02-14 14:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
