(1168926, 145571, 31133, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I wonder if this is Ubique? Nice shot, whoever you are! I Iike the sepia tone and the pose. It''s possible you could''ve done without the watch, but that''s just pickiness.  Very sharp and clear - the eye is drawn straight to you. The off-centered easel adds a relaxed feeling to the image.</td>', 'Hmmm, I wonder if this is Ubique? Nice shot, whoever you are! I Iike the sepia tone and the pose. It''s possible you could''ve done without the watch, but that''s just pickiness.  Very sharp and clear - the eye is drawn straight to you. The off-centered easel adds a relaxed feeling to the image.', '2005-02-14 14:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168927, 145789, 31133, '<td valign="top">Can''t say more than 9. This is a fantastic studio set-up and your pose is great.</td>', 'Can''t say more than 9. This is a fantastic studio set-up and your pose is great.', '2005-02-14 14:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
