(1168939, 144813, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ha! I just made a comment on another portrait that I wish they hadn''t cropped their chin. But in your shot, I love the crop!  Beautiful portrait you''ve taken here. I''d like to see the the highlights in your face a little less white, though. Besides the crop and pose, the parts of this shot I like best are your eyes and hair. Nice work.</td>', 'Ha! I just made a comment on another portrait that I wish they hadn''t cropped their chin. But in your shot, I love the crop!  Beautiful portrait you''ve taken here. I''d like to see the the highlights in your face a little less white, though. Besides the crop and pose, the parts of this shot I like best are your eyes and hair. Nice work.', '2005-02-14 14:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168945, 146211, 31133, '<td valign="top">Hey, you look like Anthony Hopkins. I like these shots, but might prefer to just have one shot instead of many. That eye through the lens is fantastic!</td>', 'Hey, you look like Anthony Hopkins. I like these shots, but might prefer to just have one shot instead of many. That eye through the lens is fantastic!', '2005-02-14 14:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
