(1168995, 145653, 31133, '<td valign="top">The picture and pose are good, but the black frame is way too thick for my taste. Good job on the self-portrait, though!</td>', 'The picture and pose are good, but the black frame is way too thick for my taste. Good job on the self-portrait, though!', '2005-02-14 15:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168996, 146394, 27375, '<td valign="top">Hello blue ribbon 10</td>', 'Hello blue ribbon 10', '2005-02-14 15:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1168998, 144943, 17507, '<td valign="top">You look happy to be in the shed :)<br/>Nice use of framing, and the expression on your face is quite pleasing.</td>', 'You look happy to be in the shed :)Nice use of framing, and the expression on your face is quite pleasing.', '2005-02-14 15:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169000, 146843, 3102, '<td valign="top">A score in a self-portrait challenge can always be helped by being a hot babe in the first place :)  I might have tried to match the tones in the face a little more with the shoulders (in other words, blow out the upper body similar to the face, or tone the face like the shoulders)... but otherwise I like it a lot!  Good luck!</td>', 'A score in a self-portrait challenge can always be helped by being a hot babe in the first place :)  I might have tried to match the tones in the face a little more with the shoulders (in other words, blow out the upper body similar to the face, or tone the face like the shoulders)... but otherwise I like it a lot!  Good luck!', '2005-02-14 15:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169001, 146808, 17507, '<td valign="top">Hm, this looks familiar. Didn''t you enter a similar picture for a recent challenge?<br/>--I like this one better, though. Great lighting.</td>', 'Hm, this looks familiar. Didn''t you enter a similar picture for a recent challenge?--I like this one better, though. Great lighting.', '2005-02-14 15:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
