(1169011, 145395, 17507, '<td valign="top">killer shades.<br/>i strongly suggest you grab the nearest wooden bat and make tracks to enforce some vigilante justice</td>', 'killer shades.i strongly suggest you grab the nearest wooden bat and make tracks to enforce some vigilante justice', '2005-02-14 15:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169012, 146349, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like the tilted composition of the photo.  Very good lighting and dof.  The hat and your beard works very well in b/w.</td>', 'I like the tilted composition of the photo.  Very good lighting and dof.  The hat and your beard works very well in b/w.', '2005-02-14 15:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169013, 146881, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ha -- love it!</td>', 'Ha -- love it!', '2005-02-14 15:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169015, 146357, 17507, '<td valign="top">mmm... you have very pretty eyes, but the over-wide forced grin draws attention from them. remember you don''t always have to smile :)</td>', 'mmm... you have very pretty eyes, but the over-wide forced grin draws attention from them. remember you don''t always have to smile :)', '2005-02-14 15:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169017, 145571, 17507, '<td valign="top">great sepia tone. very appealing shot.</td>', 'great sepia tone. very appealing shot.', '2005-02-14 15:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169020, 145599, 24642, '<td valign="top">A good idea.  I think that a tighter crop without the snow would have increased the impact.  Snow can be very dificault to deal with in photographs and in this photograph it distracts from the main subject.</td>', 'A good idea.  I think that a tighter crop without the snow would have increased the impact.  Snow can be very dificault to deal with in photographs and in this photograph it distracts from the main subject.', '2005-02-14 15:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169026, 146882, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice work. I take it you liked e301''s "What is the Matrix?" entry :)</td>', 'Nice work. I take it you liked e301''s "What is the Matrix?" entry :)', '2005-02-14 15:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
