(1169379, 145335, 14620, '<td valign="top">I''ve said it before and I''ll say it again... This is a top-notch professional looking shot.  I don''t think it could be done any better.  Absolutely love the eyes!!  Fantastic job.  10</td>', 'I''ve said it before and I''ll say it again... This is a top-notch professional looking shot.  I don''t think it could be done any better.  Absolutely love the eyes!!  Fantastic job.  10', '2005-02-14 18:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
