(1169479, 145604, 29009, '<td valign="top">Title fits the shot.  Unfortunately, the background is not as visually interesting as you might have hoped.  There is so little detail in the foreground that overall, this just doesn''t work as well as the other submissions.</td>', 'Title fits the shot.  Unfortunately, the background is not as visually interesting as you might have hoped.  There is so little detail in the foreground that overall, this just doesn''t work as well as the other submissions.', '2005-02-14 19:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
