(1169512, 146570, 31637, '<td valign="top">thats a real interesting picture. I like this</td>', 'thats a real interesting picture. I like this', '2005-02-14 19:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169515, 145255, 31637, '<td valign="top">that is creative...very nicely done here....the background is a nice neat black and this should score high</td>', 'that is creative...very nicely done here....the background is a nice neat black and this should score high', '2005-02-14 19:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169517, 145988, 15497, '<td valign="top">both hands are overexposed, the image seems to lack "black", and too little contrast for my taste. <br/> <br/>but<br/> <br/>It is very funny, and sharp/detailed. Normally I would reduce your score because you''re hidding your face, but since this is so incredibly funny, I will actually bump up a little.  7 good luck</td>', 'both hands are overexposed, the image seems to lack "black", and too little contrast for my taste.  but It is very funny, and sharp/detailed. Normally I would reduce your score because you''re hidding your face, but since this is so incredibly funny, I will actually bump up a little.  7 good luck', '2005-02-14 19:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169518, 146577, 25232, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>(The pretty face doesn''t hurt the image either.)</td>', 'Nice composition.   (The pretty face doesn''t hurt the image either.)', '2005-02-14 19:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169519, 146516, 17507, '<td valign="top">Returning to bump from 8 to 9.<br/>Wouldn''t be surprised to see this on the front page next week.<br/>Good luck in the ratings.<br/> <br/>Dear cripes, I keep coming back to this picture and liking it more and more. After thinking about it further, I''m not sure I could guess the reception of this image by voters, as the "you" part is rather small. You are an important part of the composition, but in some respects, it could be anyone, and is definitely more anonymous than many. NONETHELESS --! I return for the final bump to 10.<br/> <br/>I think that is one of about five tens I''ve given out among the 3,500+ votes I''ve cast on DPC.</td>', 'Returning to bump from 8 to 9.Wouldn''t be surprised to see this on the front page next week.Good luck in the ratings. Dear cripes, I keep coming back to this picture and liking it more and more. After thinking about it further, I''m not sure I could guess the reception of this image by voters, as the "you" part is rather small. You are an important part of the composition, but in some respects, it could be anyone, and is definitely more anonymous than many. NONETHELESS --! I return for the final bump to 10. I think that is one of about five tens I''ve given out among the 3,500+ votes I''ve cast on DPC.', '2005-02-14 19:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169522, 146511, 31637, '<td valign="top">hey good idea...kind of like my submission</td>', 'hey good idea...kind of like my submission', '2005-02-14 19:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169523, 146725, 15497, '<td valign="top">Am I looking at a thumbnail or what? You need to use higher resolution for your entries, that will result in a better score.</td>', 'Am I looking at a thumbnail or what? You need to use higher resolution for your entries, that will result in a better score.', '2005-02-14 19:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169524, 146030, 11518, '<td valign="top">Cute!  LOL</td>', 'Cute!  LOL', '2005-02-14 19:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169525, 146450, 17507, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. The title and your face go together wonderfully.</td>', 'Lovely picture. The title and your face go together wonderfully.', '2005-02-14 19:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169526, 146653, 29009, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you were going for here creatively.  Obviously a reflection, there is a distracting line through the center of the shot.  Most of the other submissions featured a facial expression that was definitely a smile, or definitely not a smile and that approach might have helped improve this image.  Including the camera in the final product gives this shot more of a "snapshot" feel and will not help the final score.  The background is visually uninteresting and the clothing sort of blends in with it.  It was great that you actually included your face.  Unfortunately, I just wasn''t able to give this a very good score.</td>', 'Not sure what you were going for here creatively.  Obviously a reflection, there is a distracting line through the center of the shot.  Most of the other submissions featured a facial expression that was definitely a smile, or definitely not a smile and that approach might have helped improve this image.  Including the camera in the final product gives this shot more of a "snapshot" feel and will not help the final score.  The background is visually uninteresting and the clothing sort of blends in with it.  It was great that you actually included your face.  Unfortunately, I just wasn''t able to give this a very good score.', '2005-02-14 19:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169527, 146882, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice border...good color technique...I like this</td>', 'nice border...good color technique...I like this', '2005-02-14 19:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169529, 146846, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice work here....very original</td>', 'nice work here....very original', '2005-02-14 19:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169533, 146215, 15497, '<td valign="top">Where to start... 1.) Skin color is totally fake. 2.) Eyes are overly blue 3.) It''s not in focus, or you have a poor quality lens, still you can''t "compensate" with sharpening for that. Well That''s about it. Don''t be offended, trying to give advice. 4</td>', 'Where to start... 1.) Skin color is totally fake. 2.) Eyes are overly blue 3.) It''s not in focus, or you have a poor quality lens, still you can''t "compensate" with sharpening for that. Well That''s about it. Don''t be offended, trying to give advice. 4', '2005-02-14 19:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169535, 146647, 15497, '<td valign="top">Not showing your face breaks this image for me, sorry. 4</td>', 'Not showing your face breaks this image for me, sorry. 4', '2005-02-14 19:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169537, 146196, 31637, '<td valign="top">very pretty...good use of lighting !</td>', 'very pretty...good use of lighting !', '2005-02-14 19:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169538, 146878, 31637, '<td valign="top">funny one...pts for laughter</td>', 'funny one...pts for laughter', '2005-02-14 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169541, 145269, 15497, '<td valign="top">Is that mirror dirty? seems to take away some sharpness, or maybe it''s not entirely in focus. anyhow, nice use of contrast, composition is a little boring for me, can''t give this more then a 5.</td>', 'Is that mirror dirty? seems to take away some sharpness, or maybe it''s not entirely in focus. anyhow, nice use of contrast, composition is a little boring for me, can''t give this more then a 5.', '2005-02-14 19:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169542, 144943, 31637, '<td valign="top">I sit in mine for an hour a day ! at least...good place to write poetry and think</td>', 'I sit in mine for an hour a day ! at least...good place to write poetry and think', '2005-02-14 19:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169544, 145749, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice portrait</td>', 'nice portrait', '2005-02-14 19:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169546, 146875, 15497, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, subject seems to be sincerly happy. That''s a moment, a capture. I would want it more detailed/sharp, and the yellow/brown color actually works for me (something it rarely do). So I''m giving you a 7, good luck.</td>', 'Nice composition, subject seems to be sincerly happy. That''s a moment, a capture. I would want it more detailed/sharp, and the yellow/brown color actually works for me (something it rarely do). So I''m giving you a 7, good luck.', '2005-02-14 19:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169549, 146302, 15497, '<td valign="top">Did you try to get the brown ribbon? If so you may succeed! This isn''t art in my eyes, it''s not even worth the Kilo bytes. Poor composition, extremly overexposed, and the effect doesn''t even work. and the blue color is just harsh to my eyes. Gotta move on now, if you really thought this would score well, send me an e-mail, and I''ll give you some tips that I think may help. 2<br/></td>', 'Did you try to get the brown ribbon? If so you may succeed! This isn''t art in my eyes, it''s not even worth the Kilo bytes. Poor composition, extremly overexposed, and the effect doesn''t even work. and the blue color is just harsh to my eyes. Gotta move on now, if you really thought this would score well, send me an e-mail, and I''ll give you some tips that I think may help. 2', '2005-02-14 19:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169550, 146563, 15497, '<td valign="top">Great lightning! Lovely tones. Sharp and full of detail, interesting composition, really eye-candy. I''d say minimum top10. 9 Good luck!<br/></td>', 'Great lightning! Lovely tones. Sharp and full of detail, interesting composition, really eye-candy. I''d say minimum top10. 9 Good luck!', '2005-02-14 19:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169552, 145879, 15497, '<td valign="top">Skin tone isn''t completely "spot on", but you''ve made an effort with lightning. I would try to use curvers, and lower the red channel a bit, and bump the blue channel. See if that makes your skin seem more natrual. sharpness is OK. 5</td>', 'Skin tone isn''t completely "spot on", but you''ve made an effort with lightning. I would try to use curvers, and lower the red channel a bit, and bump the blue channel. See if that makes your skin seem more natrual. sharpness is OK. 5', '2005-02-14 19:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169555, 146866, 15497, '<td valign="top">unsharp, almost blurry. The microsoft mouse is distracting my eyes. Color wise, that green with that harsh red makes me wanna turn off my monitor :) I see you obviously didn''t spend 3min setting up this shot, I guess you surfed by dpc and saw the challenge, and just pressed the shutter and uploaded the image to submit, am I right? 3</td>', 'unsharp, almost blurry. The microsoft mouse is distracting my eyes. Color wise, that green with that harsh red makes me wanna turn off my monitor :) I see you obviously didn''t spend 3min setting up this shot, I guess you surfed by dpc and saw the challenge, and just pressed the shutter and uploaded the image to submit, am I right? 3', '2005-02-14 19:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169556, 146008, 15497, '<td valign="top">seems to be a little over neatimaged and not entirely in focus/sharp, but interesting idea, and cool composition. 5</td>', 'seems to be a little over neatimaged and not entirely in focus/sharp, but interesting idea, and cool composition. 5', '2005-02-14 19:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
