(1169638, 146587, 24846, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of the wrought iron. It accents the graceful facial curves of your profile. Nice use of b/w and crop. Good luck on this well executed portrait...</td>', 'I like your choice of the wrought iron. It accents the graceful facial curves of your profile. Nice use of b/w and crop. Good luck on this well executed portrait...', '2005-02-14 19:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169640, 146394, 18191, '<td valign="top">This is, by far, the best of the challenge. This receives my highest marks in everything. The body paint is a great texture and the tone compliments the mood perfectly. The lighting is great as I can see it was probably done with a large softbox judging by the catchlights in your eye. The DOF is really striking and makes the shot nearly three dimensional in relationship to the angle at which it was taken. This is a WOW in my book and an immediate favorite. I am at a little bit of a loss for words because I really think that this is a superb photograph. Congratulations on a fine job --- you are inspiring... :::(rolls tongue back into mouth):::</td>', 'This is, by far, the best of the challenge. This receives my highest marks in everything. The body paint is a great texture and the tone compliments the mood perfectly. The lighting is great as I can see it was probably done with a large softbox judging by the catchlights in your eye. The DOF is really striking and makes the shot nearly three dimensional in relationship to the angle at which it was taken. This is a WOW in my book and an immediate favorite. I am at a little bit of a loss for words because I really think that this is a superb photograph. Congratulations on a fine job --- you are inspiring... :::(rolls tongue back into mouth):::', '2005-02-14 20:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1169641, 145255, 7810, '<td valign="top">very creative take on the challenge ...well done</td>', 'very creative take on the challenge ...well done', '2005-02-14 20:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
