(1169649, 145749, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait.  Wonderful pose; using the window not just for its light, but also as a prop and as a graphic device in this very skilful composition.  Camera work excellent &amp; processing (if any) unobtrusive.  Intelligent and mature photography.  9.</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait.  Wonderful pose; using the window not just for its light, but also as a prop and as a graphic device in this very skilful composition.  Camera work excellent & processing (if any) unobtrusive.  Intelligent and mature photography.  9.', '2005-02-14 20:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
