(1170003, 146535, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, you strike me as a friendly trusting soul (although somewhat mischievous).  The whole photo has a softness (a bit of a washed out look) about it, which is ok, but the colar/throat area seems sharper than the balance of the photo, and thus draws undue attention.  Great work except for that.</td>', 'Nice portrait, you strike me as a friendly trusting soul (although somewhat mischievous).  The whole photo has a softness (a bit of a washed out look) about it, which is ok, but the colar/throat area seems sharper than the balance of the photo, and thus draws undue attention.  Great work except for that.', '2005-02-14 22:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170010, 145743, 29009, '<td valign="top">Kudos for taking the risk.  Make-up job is too messy to be visually appealing, but don''t let my opinion stop you!</td>', 'Kudos for taking the risk.  Make-up job is too messy to be visually appealing, but don''t let my opinion stop you!', '2005-02-14 22:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170012, 146828, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  A bit too abstract for my personal taste, but I like that you thought creatively.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  A bit too abstract for my personal taste, but I like that you thought creatively.', '2005-02-14 22:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170013, 146484, 6600, '<td valign="top">Overall a bit dark, but seems to fit you.  Real nice composition, great eyes.  Great effort.</td>', 'Overall a bit dark, but seems to fit you.  Real nice composition, great eyes.  Great effort.', '2005-02-14 22:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170018, 146842, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  You had a good idea, but overall this image is just not at visually appealing as some of the other submissions to my eye.  I can see...something, just not sure what.  On the plus side - you took a risk and that''s great!</td>', 'Returning for comment.  You had a good idea, but overall this image is just not at visually appealing as some of the other submissions to my eye.  I can see...something, just not sure what.  On the plus side - you took a risk and that''s great!', '2005-02-14 22:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170019, 145219, 28695, '<td valign="top">It seems to have gone a little too much to green, especially around the eye.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'It seems to have gone a little too much to green, especially around the eye.  Nice shot though.', '2005-02-14 22:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170024, 146633, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  I''m not sure what you are leaning against...am finding it distracting.  Good capture of facial expression.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  I''m not sure what you are leaning against...am finding it distracting.  Good capture of facial expression.', '2005-02-14 22:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170031, 146162, 23614, '<td valign="top">Awsome picture, but even with the title, I don''t think it belongs to this challenge.</td>', 'Awsome picture, but even with the title, I don''t think it belongs to this challenge.', '2005-02-14 22:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170033, 146841, 29009, '<td valign="top">Hey - is this Pedro?  Ha!  I''m giving you a 10 despite your shameless self-promotion.  Good lighting, interesting composition, visually appealing facial expression, and humorous to boot.  I''m hooked, you win, good job!</td>', 'Hey - is this Pedro?  Ha!  I''m giving you a 10 despite your shameless self-promotion.  Good lighting, interesting composition, visually appealing facial expression, and humorous to boot.  I''m hooked, you win, good job!', '2005-02-14 22:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170049, 146859, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is not only a very clever idea, it''s very well done.  I''m not really a fan of what I usually (and probably unfairly) regard as "gimmicky" shots, but this one really does work.  Maybe it''s the alarming lower torso amputation, but it''s also the fact that the actual portrait shot is very good; at least a 6 on its own.  Add 1 for the idea + 1 for the execution = 8.</td>', 'This is not only a very clever idea, it''s very well done.  I''m not really a fan of what I usually (and probably unfairly) regard as "gimmicky" shots, but this one really does work.  Maybe it''s the alarming lower torso amputation, but it''s also the fact that the actual portrait shot is very good; at least a 6 on its own.  Add 1 for the idea + 1 for the execution = 8.', '2005-02-14 22:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170052, 146444, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Interesting idea.  It seems your intent was to disguise your face; perhaps using different lighting and a tighter crop would have helped.  You should feel good about taking a risk.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Interesting idea.  It seems your intent was to disguise your face; perhaps using different lighting and a tighter crop would have helped.  You should feel good about taking a risk.', '2005-02-14 22:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170058, 146733, 5475, '<td valign="top">So far, this is my only 10!  This is way too cool.  I was going through all the moody, angry, shy, and snap-shot self portraits, and then I saw your shot!  Congrats on a highly creative and interesting shot.  I hope to see it do well.<br/>JD</td>', 'So far, this is my only 10!  This is way too cool.  I was going through all the moody, angry, shy, and snap-shot self portraits, and then I saw your shot!  Congrats on a highly creative and interesting shot.  I hope to see it do well.JD', '2005-02-14 23:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170059, 146394, 30364, '<td valign="top">Such clear eyes ... don''t you ever drink?  Great idea &amp; clearly the most visually startling image of the challenge.  8.</td>', 'Such clear eyes ... don''t you ever drink?  Great idea & clearly the most visually startling image of the challenge.  8.', '2005-02-14 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170060, 146652, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  A unique take - I like how you''ve gone with three different facial expressions.  Unfortunately, one of the fades left too much ear on the main pose which distracts and detracts.  Overall, a nice shot.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  A unique take - I like how you''ve gone with three different facial expressions.  Unfortunately, one of the fades left too much ear on the main pose which distracts and detracts.  Overall, a nice shot.', '2005-02-14 23:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170061, 146730, 6600, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail, nice duotone, composition ok.  I might have simply titled it ''Pinnacle''</td>', 'Excellent detail, nice duotone, composition ok.  I might have simply titled it ''Pinnacle''', '2005-02-14 23:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170064, 146029, 5475, '<td valign="top">First of all, my condolances about your father.  Your shot perfectly ties into your title.  Very creative, and well executed. I hope to see your shot do well in the challenge.  10 from me!</td>', 'First of all, my condolances about your father.  Your shot perfectly ties into your title.  Very creative, and well executed. I hope to see your shot do well in the challenge.  10 from me!', '2005-02-14 23:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170065, 145796, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  You''ve got a great idea here, and compositionally your lines are good.  The sky looks a little blown out.  Overall, a good concept.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  You''ve got a great idea here, and compositionally your lines are good.  The sky looks a little blown out.  Overall, a good concept.', '2005-02-14 23:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170067, 145397, 28695, '<td valign="top">OK. This one looks kinda creepy.  I bet it was fun to do.</td>', 'OK. This one looks kinda creepy.  I bet it was fun to do.', '2005-02-14 23:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170069, 146507, 5475, '<td valign="top">Wow, that does look cold!  I usually don''t like symetrical shots like this, but I do in this case.  The dark sky and the frosted road create a very moody image.  Your pose and expression are perfect.  A smile just wouldn''t work as well.  Nicely done.<br/>JD</td>', 'Wow, that does look cold!  I usually don''t like symetrical shots like this, but I do in this case.  The dark sky and the frosted road create a very moody image.  Your pose and expression are perfect.  A smile just wouldn''t work as well.  Nicely done.JD', '2005-02-14 23:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170070, 146875, 28695, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, but the colors seems a bit too muted.</td>', 'Nice contrast, but the colors seems a bit too muted.', '2005-02-14 23:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170071, 146563, 5475, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  There are lots of moody, shy, angry, and snap-shotty images in this challenge.  Your SP is just plain fun.  Very nice!<br/>JD</td>', 'Great shot!  There are lots of moody, shy, angry, and snap-shotty images in this challenge.  Your SP is just plain fun.  Very nice!JD', '2005-02-14 23:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170073, 146357, 28695, '<td valign="top">Just a bit more focus.  I know, hard to do considering the challenge.  NIce smile.</td>', 'Just a bit more focus.  I know, hard to do considering the challenge.  NIce smile.', '2005-02-14 23:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170075, 146871, 30364, '<td valign="top">I love this, and not just because you look like Kathryn Hepburn (well, like she did in about the 1930''s).   Both the pose and the photographic treatment seem exactly right for your subject.  8.</td>', 'I love this, and not just because you look like Kathryn Hepburn (well, like she did in about the 1930''s).   Both the pose and the photographic treatment seem exactly right for your subject.  8.', '2005-02-14 23:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170078, 146425, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Why not titled?  Good capture of facial expression.  Use of selective saturation seems random and might not add as much to the shot as you intended.  With regard to composition, you might try leaving less negative space on top, so that your eyes are in the top third of the frame.  Lighting is good.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Why not titled?  Good capture of facial expression.  Use of selective saturation seems random and might not add as much to the shot as you intended.  With regard to composition, you might try leaving less negative space on top, so that your eyes are in the top third of the frame.  Lighting is good.', '2005-02-14 23:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170080, 146603, 6600, '<td valign="top">Good tones, lighting, color (lipstick?), nice composition.  Great job.</td>', 'Good tones, lighting, color (lipstick?), nice composition.  Great job.', '2005-02-14 23:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170082, 146648, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  My personal taste does not lean towards high-key, but you''ve almost convinced me here.  Composition is good, expression is good, use of negative space is good.  At second look, bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  My personal taste does not lean towards high-key, but you''ve almost convinced me here.  Composition is good, expression is good, use of negative space is good.  At second look, bumping up.', '2005-02-14 23:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170083, 145836, 28695, '<td valign="top">Chris, nice shot.  I like the intensity and the shadows.  It''s a very striking picture.  (Of course, I have to laugh, because I''ve never seen you look this way in real life.)</td>', 'Chris, nice shot.  I like the intensity and the shadows.  It''s a very striking picture.  (Of course, I have to laugh, because I''ve never seen you look this way in real life.)', '2005-02-14 23:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170084, 144813, 6600, '<td valign="top">Unique crop, interesting composition.  A bit contrasty, but works for me (appears deliberate).  Great job.</td>', 'Unique crop, interesting composition.  A bit contrasty, but works for me (appears deliberate).  Great job.', '2005-02-14 23:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170089, 144872, 28695, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see the face just a lit bit brighter.  I want to see more of the expression.</td>', 'I wish I could see the face just a lit bit brighter.  I want to see more of the expression.', '2005-02-14 23:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170090, 145734, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Good capture of facial expression.  Lighting is not to my personal taste - looks a bit blown out to me as you''ve lost one of the arms to the window.  There doesn''t seem to be a clear definition between the earrings and the necklace.  Well titled and composed.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Good capture of facial expression.  Lighting is not to my personal taste - looks a bit blown out to me as you''ve lost one of the arms to the window.  There doesn''t seem to be a clear definition between the earrings and the necklace.  Well titled and composed.', '2005-02-14 23:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170091, 144823, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific idea, masterfully executed as usual.  (I mean the photo, although it looks pretty certain that your beautiful new baby was equally well conceived, captured and processed).  Congratulations on both counts.  8.</td>', 'Terrific idea, masterfully executed as usual.  (I mean the photo, although it looks pretty certain that your beautiful new baby was equally well conceived, captured and processed).  Congratulations on both counts.  8.', '2005-02-14 23:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170092, 145749, 28695, '<td valign="top">Your face is nicely lit.  It''s a pleasing picture, but the left side is just too bright.  It kept distracting me.</td>', 'Your face is nicely lit.  It''s a pleasing picture, but the left side is just too bright.  It kept distracting me.', '2005-02-14 23:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170094, 146030, 30364, '<td valign="top">Ghastly pun, but excellent photo.  7</td>', 'Ghastly pun, but excellent photo.  7', '2005-02-14 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170097, 145676, 6600, '<td valign="top">Pulling that sassy look, nice colors and exposure.  Composition works.  Great job.</td>', 'Pulling that sassy look, nice colors and exposure.  Composition works.  Great job.', '2005-02-14 23:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170099, 144969, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Sorry - it took me three looks and over 5 minutes to figure out that this was a mirror!  OK, I get it now.  With regard to composition, it''s just a bit too cluttered with competing subjects to be a winner.  You had a great idea, and you''ve mastered the long shutter aspect.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Sorry - it took me three looks and over 5 minutes to figure out that this was a mirror!  OK, I get it now.  With regard to composition, it''s just a bit too cluttered with competing subjects to be a winner.  You had a great idea, and you''ve mastered the long shutter aspect.', '2005-02-14 23:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170104, 146420, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  I can''t vote in this challenge, but if I could, this would be a 10.</td>', 'Awesome.  I can''t vote in this challenge, but if I could, this would be a 10.', '2005-02-14 23:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170108, 146349, 6600, '<td valign="top">Well.... if your a fun loving, friendly, easy going guy..... you captured your element perfectly.  Real nice composition, grayscale tones.  Super job!</td>', 'Well.... if your a fun loving, friendly, easy going guy..... you captured your element perfectly.  Real nice composition, grayscale tones.  Super job!', '2005-02-14 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170110, 146726, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Interesting composition - you''ve filled the frame well.  This shot might have been stronger if one element had been kept in focus, particularly the eye.  Perhaps some light bounced up from below the chin would have helped with the shadows cast by the bangs.  The expression in the eye is good.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Interesting composition - you''ve filled the frame well.  This shot might have been stronger if one element had been kept in focus, particularly the eye.  Perhaps some light bounced up from below the chin would have helped with the shadows cast by the bangs.  The expression in the eye is good.', '2005-02-14 23:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170111, 146349, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean and crisp.  Nice work!</td>', 'Simple, clean and crisp.  Nice work!', '2005-02-14 23:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170112, 145582, 6600, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition / crop, decent lighting, good capture.  Great job.</td>', 'Interesting composition / crop, decent lighting, good capture.  Great job.', '2005-02-14 23:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170115, 145695, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Excellent character shot.  Overall, a little too dark for my personal taste, but at second look am bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Excellent character shot.  Overall, a little too dark for my personal taste, but at second look am bumping up.', '2005-02-14 23:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170117, 146825, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fun and engaging - nicely done.</td>', 'Fun and engaging - nicely done.', '2005-02-14 23:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170118, 145619, 30364, '<td valign="top">I wish you hadn''t called it "Inner demons", because I keep sneaking back for another look, wondering what they are.  None of my business, is what they are.  Anyway, it is a very compelling portrait with a really effective composition.  It has a rather stark feeling to it, but with that title I guess it was meant to.  7.</td>', 'I wish you hadn''t called it "Inner demons", because I keep sneaking back for another look, wondering what they are.  None of my business, is what they are.  Anyway, it is a very compelling portrait with a really effective composition.  It has a rather stark feeling to it, but with that title I guess it was meant to.  7.', '2005-02-14 23:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170121, 146725, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Image is a little small for evaluation.  This was a creative idea.  From what I can see, backgound appears a little cluttered and more snow on the ground would have helped.  Overall, a unique take on the challenge.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Image is a little small for evaluation.  This was a creative idea.  From what I can see, backgound appears a little cluttered and more snow on the ground would have helped.  Overall, a unique take on the challenge.', '2005-02-14 23:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170123, 145749, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple elegance.  The lighting is very nice as well!</td>', 'Simple elegance.  The lighting is very nice as well!', '2005-02-14 23:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170125, 146825, 6600, '<td valign="top">Well exposed, composed.  Good job.</td>', 'Well exposed, composed.  Good job.', '2005-02-14 23:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170126, 146819, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2005-02-14 23:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170128, 145914, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  You got a good idea here.  This shot is not in as sharp focus as it could be.  The white balance appears to be a little off as well.  With regard to composition, there doesn''t appear to be a main focal point - my eye kind of keeps wandering around for a place to land.  Overall, this was a decent attempt at something creative.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  You got a good idea here.  This shot is not in as sharp focus as it could be.  The white balance appears to be a little off as well.  With regard to composition, there doesn''t appear to be a main focal point - my eye kind of keeps wandering around for a place to land.  Overall, this was a decent attempt at something creative.', '2005-02-14 23:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170134, 144801, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is obviously an appropriate use of this photographic technique.  It''s also extremely well done on the part of both the photographer and the subject.  7.</td>', 'This is obviously an appropriate use of this photographic technique.  It''s also extremely well done on the part of both the photographer and the subject.  7.', '2005-02-14 23:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170135, 146885, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Great capture of facial expression.  Focus is a little soft,  and this has a snapshot feel to it.  Overall, the shot communicates happiness well.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Great capture of facial expression.  Focus is a little soft,  and this has a snapshot feel to it.  Overall, the shot communicates happiness well.', '2005-02-14 23:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170140, 144810, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  A good idea.  With regard to composition, you might consider cropping out more of the space above the head, so that it appears in the top third of the frame rather than dead center.  Overall, stronger than many of the other submissions.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  A good idea.  With regard to composition, you might consider cropping out more of the space above the head, so that it appears in the top third of the frame rather than dead center.  Overall, stronger than many of the other submissions.', '2005-02-14 23:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170143, 146648, 33506, '<td valign="top">nice image</td>', 'nice image', '2005-02-14 23:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170144, 146420, 30364, '<td valign="top">Good idea, flawlessly executed.  The subject''s pose, examining the spectacles, is equally thoughtful, not just for its originality but also because it creates the opportunity to feature the hands as well as the head.  Maybe the "frame" and it''s associated foreground props is just a bit too dominant or too busy?  7.</td>', 'Good idea, flawlessly executed.  The subject''s pose, examining the spectacles, is equally thoughtful, not just for its originality but also because it creates the opportunity to feature the hands as well as the head.  Maybe the "frame" and it''s associated foreground props is just a bit too dominant or too busy?  7.', '2005-02-14 23:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170148, 146435, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition.  Conveys confidence, yet uncertainty for some reason.  Good job!</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition.  Conveys confidence, yet uncertainty for some reason.  Good job!', '2005-02-14 23:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170151, 145726, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Good use of negative space.  I love how the grin is giant.  Very creative idea!  On second look, am bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Good use of negative space.  I love how the grin is giant.  Very creative idea!  On second look, am bumping up.', '2005-02-14 23:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170152, 146710, 6600, '<td valign="top">Well exposed, nice detail, rather ensconced.  Good job.</td>', 'Well exposed, nice detail, rather ensconced.  Good job.', '2005-02-14 23:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170155, 145842, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is bold, and it works for me.  One of the few "obscured face" images that I really like (don''t take that the wrong way; I''m sure your face is perfectly lovely).  What I mean is this idea works because it''s an artistic statement and not just a disguise.  7.</td>', 'This is bold, and it works for me.  One of the few "obscured face" images that I really like (don''t take that the wrong way; I''m sure your face is perfectly lovely).  What I mean is this idea works because it''s an artistic statement and not just a disguise.  7.', '2005-02-14 23:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170158, 146563, 25787, '<td valign="top">Nice teeth.</td>', 'Nice teeth.', '2005-02-14 23:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170160, 146858, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a very appealing portrait.  Good composition, relaxed &amp; natural pose, and nice lighting.  Is it a bit over-sharp?  Nah ... the treatment seems just right to me.  7</td>', 'This is a very appealing portrait.  Good composition, relaxed & natural pose, and nice lighting.  Is it a bit over-sharp?  Nah ... the treatment seems just right to me.  7', '2005-02-14 23:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170161, 146370, 6600, '<td valign="top">You dirty rat, you look much like Jame Cagney (were you going for that?).  The question is, who are YOU?  Good portrait, nice composition, back-lighting could have been a touch softer.  Great job.</td>', 'You dirty rat, you look much like Jame Cagney (were you going for that?).  The question is, who are YOU?  Good portrait, nice composition, back-lighting could have been a touch softer.  Great job.', '2005-02-14 23:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170164, 146848, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s a great idea (which I can also relate to), and a very appealing portrait.  Well executed in the brain, the camera and even the computer!  7.</td>', 'That''s a great idea (which I can also relate to), and a very appealing portrait.  Well executed in the brain, the camera and even the computer!  7.', '2005-02-14 23:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170166, 145879, 6600, '<td valign="top">A tad dark perhaps, this shot is ambiguous to me, puzzled.  Good job.</td>', 'A tad dark perhaps, this shot is ambiguous to me, puzzled.  Good job.', '2005-02-14 23:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170167, 145571, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very nice, Rockwell-like image.  Good composition, good light, good camera, subtle (if any) processing.  7.</td>', 'A very nice, Rockwell-like image.  Good composition, good light, good camera, subtle (if any) processing.  7.', '2005-02-15 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170170, 146420, 24951, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2005-02-15 00:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170173, 145255, 30364, '<td valign="top">Have to give you good marks for originality, and also for executing it so well.  7.</td>', 'Have to give you good marks for originality, and also for executing it so well.  7.', '2005-02-15 00:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170174, 145335, 6600, '<td valign="top">High key?  Very serious or tense mood to this shot, guarded, not appearing comfortable, but yet confident.  Nice portrait.</td>', 'High key?  Very serious or tense mood to this shot, guarded, not appearing comfortable, but yet confident.  Nice portrait.', '2005-02-15 00:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170179, 145335, 14735, '<td valign="top">I love the picture of your camera.............case.  Very well done photo.   5+5=10</td>', 'I love the picture of your camera.............case.  Very well done photo.   5+5=10', '2005-02-15 00:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170180, 146841, 6600, '<td valign="top">Well exposed, composition good, nice job!  (Confident, brash, a tad reckless perhaps.  Close?)</td>', 'Well exposed, composition good, nice job!  (Confident, brash, a tad reckless perhaps.  Close?)', '2005-02-15 00:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170181, 146420, 14735, '<td valign="top">I love the framing and that you are the only thing you can see in the widow.</td>', 'I love the framing and that you are the only thing you can see in the widow.', '2005-02-15 00:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170183, 145789, 6600, '<td valign="top">Hope your really not this empty.  Wish I had a room I could pull this shot off in (no fair).  Nicely exposed and composed.  Great job.</td>', 'Hope your really not this empty.  Wish I had a room I could pull this shot off in (no fair).  Nicely exposed and composed.  Great job.', '2005-02-15 00:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170184, 145571, 14735, '<td valign="top">I really like the view as you peek out from behind your painting. Great job</td>', 'I really like the view as you peek out from behind your painting. Great job', '2005-02-15 00:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170185, 146511, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  You got a great idea here and have mastered the long shutter element.  Unfortunately, the shelves in the background are distracting from the overall effect.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  You got a great idea here and have mastered the long shutter element.  Unfortunately, the shelves in the background are distracting from the overall effect.  Nice capture.', '2005-02-15 00:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170189, 145948, 32449, '<td valign="top">Might be better if the focus was on your face with the book slightly blurred, rather than the other way around.  It''s a nicely composed shot, though, and a good idea.</td>', 'Might be better if the focus was on your face with the book slightly blurred, rather than the other way around.  It''s a nicely composed shot, though, and a good idea.', '2005-02-15 00:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
