(1170212, 146757, 5475, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in the challenge!  The image is quirky enough, but the title is like a cherry on top for the humor!  It makes me laugh out loud!  Your expression is great, and the shallow depth of field works well here (I usually don''t like it this narrow for a portrait).  Your lighting is perfect as well.  Bumping this up to a 10.  Good Luck.  By the way, my first thought was that Clay Aiken was participating this week!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in the challenge!  The image is quirky enough, but the title is like a cherry on top for the humor!  It makes me laugh out loud!  Your expression is great, and the shallow depth of field works well here (I usually don''t like it this narrow for a portrait).  Your lighting is perfect as well.  Bumping this up to a 10.  Good Luck.  By the way, my first thought was that Clay Aiken was participating this week!', '2005-02-15 00:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
