(1170221, 146450, 5475, '<td valign="top">I love the crop on this one.  In the thumbnail, it just looks like a girl without a shirt.  Viewed at full size and seeing the baby in the lower right corner explains your wonderful smile, and makes the image magical  in a way.  I have three boys, and I had considered doing a group shot of them as my ''indirect'' self portrait.  It was my first and favorite idea, but I didn''t think it would go over well with the voters.  I''m glad to see someone included their child in their shot.  That sort of makes it a Self Portrait and a Half.  Congrats on a wonderful image.<br/>JD</td>', 'I love the crop on this one.  In the thumbnail, it just looks like a girl without a shirt.  Viewed at full size and seeing the baby in the lower right corner explains your wonderful smile, and makes the image magical  in a way.  I have three boys, and I had considered doing a group shot of them as my ''indirect'' self portrait.  It was my first and favorite idea, but I didn''t think it would go over well with the voters.  I''m glad to see someone included their child in their shot.  That sort of makes it a Self Portrait and a Half.  Congrats on a wonderful image.JD', '2005-02-15 00:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
