(1170486, 146828, 8682, '<td valign="top">Uff... just a very weird image. But, by the other side, I usually appreciate images which are different. Did you use "painting with light" in this image? 7</td>', 'Uff... just a very weird image. But, by the other side, I usually appreciate images which are different. Did you use "painting with light" in this image? 7', '2005-02-15 06:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
