(1170538, 146420, 11068, '<td valign="top">Great picture, one of my favorites</td>', 'Great picture, one of my favorites', '2005-02-15 08:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170539, 146762, 11068, '<td valign="top">nice picture, I like the black and white, it looks if there is a tear on your face.</td>', 'nice picture, I like the black and white, it looks if there is a tear on your face.', '2005-02-15 08:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170542, 146647, 11068, '<td valign="top">I like the subject but I think your face is to dark compared whit the rest of your body.</td>', 'I like the subject but I think your face is to dark compared whit the rest of your body.', '2005-02-15 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170543, 146830, 23478, '<td valign="top">The background it great!</td>', 'The background it great!', '2005-02-15 08:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170545, 146825, 23478, '<td valign="top">What a fun photo, great shot.</td>', 'What a fun photo, great shot.', '2005-02-15 08:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170547, 146166, 21101, '<td valign="top">Killer!!!</td>', 'Killer!!!', '2005-02-15 08:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170568, 146859, 31203, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea...extremely creative.</td>', 'Excellent idea...extremely creative.', '2005-02-15 08:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170577, 146571, 31512, '<td valign="top">If I could only vote once - this would be the one photo I''d vote for!  It just stands out.</td>', 'If I could only vote once - this would be the one photo I''d vote for!  It just stands out.', '2005-02-15 08:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170579, 146601, 33591, '<td valign="top">Love the comnposition - Very interesting. This gets my vote as a winner</td>', 'Love the comnposition - Very interesting. This gets my vote as a winner', '2005-02-15 08:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170580, 146162, 19978, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2005-02-15 08:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170611, 145121, 33520, '<td valign="top">one of my favourites,great</td>', 'one of my favourites,great', '2005-02-15 09:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170617, 146513, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments: Quite a moving image of a 3/4 pose. The detail is just right for the mood but it is the color that carries the strength. Very impressive.</td>', 'Returning for comments: Quite a moving image of a 3/4 pose. The detail is just right for the mood but it is the color that carries the strength. Very impressive.', '2005-02-15 09:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170622, 145691, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment: Good delivery to meet the challenge. The half moon lighting here works well to delineate form and mood.</td>', 'Returning for comment: Good delivery to meet the challenge. The half moon lighting here works well to delineate form and mood.', '2005-02-15 09:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170625, 145604, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment: This image invites the bell curve, however, consider my vote on the higher end. The image is not meant as a portrait but rather a semi graphical mood effect. I accept it in that mood.</td>', 'Returning for comment: This image invites the bell curve, however, consider my vote on the higher end. The image is not meant as a portrait but rather a semi graphical mood effect. I accept it in that mood.', '2005-02-15 09:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170632, 146588, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment:<br/>A good casual pose but the lighting leaves a little to be desired. My criticism is not with the low key lighting of the face but rather the disparity created by comparing the light on the arm against the shadow and then this against the face. Outside of this I like the composition. Bumping to 6.</td>', 'Returning for comment:A good casual pose but the lighting leaves a little to be desired. My criticism is not with the low key lighting of the face but rather the disparity created by comparing the light on the arm against the shadow and then this against the face. Outside of this I like the composition. Bumping to 6.', '2005-02-15 09:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170641, 146278, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment:<br/>A creative attempt that summons the infamous bell curve. The shot is well executed but while the effect is good it fails to deliver the premise of the challenge. Since I encourage creativity I am bumping it to 6</td>', 'Returning for comment:A creative attempt that summons the infamous bell curve. The shot is well executed but while the effect is good it fails to deliver the premise of the challenge. Since I encourage creativity I am bumping it to 6', '2005-02-15 09:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170642, 146859, 24995, '<td valign="top">First one I stopped to make a comment on. That has to mean something. Exellent.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'First one I stopped to make a comment on. That has to mean something. Exellent.Good luck', '2005-02-15 09:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170643, 145338, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment:<br/>When we think of portraits we think eyes. However, all rules are meant to be broken. The face angle here works very well and the shades allude to the mystery. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comment:When we think of portraits we think eyes. However, all rules are meant to be broken. The face angle here works very well and the shades allude to the mystery. Bumping up.', '2005-02-15 09:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170645, 146673, 24995, '<td valign="top">Love it. Excellent Composition. Good luck</td>', 'Love it. Excellent Composition. Good luck', '2005-02-15 09:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170646, 146253, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good 3/4 face study and the sepia supports the charcter essence. There is one minor observation by means of an exploration of a slight lower angle to help clear the frame of the eye glasses and the pupil. However, the facial expression has enough interest along with the very good lighting. Bumping up</td>', 'A very good 3/4 face study and the sepia supports the charcter essence. There is one minor observation by means of an exploration of a slight lower angle to help clear the frame of the eye glasses and the pupil. However, the facial expression has enough interest along with the very good lighting. Bumping up', '2005-02-15 09:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170647, 146564, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment:<br/>A slighly flat look but the detail is all there to entertain a full observation. The pose is great, the gaze with the double catchlights adds a truly liquid look which enhances. The mouth position, while requiring just a bit more tinal value is nevertheless well accented. The entire image evokes the sensation of the examination of the self and this is where this image excells and yes, the hand positions supports the general effect. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comment:A slighly flat look but the detail is all there to entertain a full observation. The pose is great, the gaze with the double catchlights adds a truly liquid look which enhances. The mouth position, while requiring just a bit more tinal value is nevertheless well accented. The entire image evokes the sensation of the examination of the self and this is where this image excells and yes, the hand positions supports the general effect. Bumping up.', '2005-02-15 09:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170650, 145695, 8682, '<td valign="top">Great picture! I really like it! 8</td>', 'Great picture! I really like it! 8', '2005-02-15 09:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170653, 146393, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment:<br/>While not 100 percent in the portrait genre, the image is much more emotive and the lighting accomplishes and aids to deliver the mood. Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comment:While not 100 percent in the portrait genre, the image is much more emotive and the lighting accomplishes and aids to deliver the mood. Bumping up.', '2005-02-15 09:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170654, 146757, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great shot. This is a comical profile pic you can truely be proud of. I feel that you used the shallow DOF very well in this shot. The lighting is good and the pose is priceless. One of my top 3 pics of the challenge.</td>', 'Great shot. This is a comical profile pic you can truely be proud of. I feel that you used the shallow DOF very well in this shot. The lighting is good and the pose is priceless. One of my top 3 pics of the challenge.', '2005-02-15 09:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170656, 145758, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image will invite the bell curve, however, my vote will be on the higher end. It is very creative with the subdued reflection where the viewer gains a slight hint of the features. Bumping up.</td>', 'This image will invite the bell curve, however, my vote will be on the higher end. It is very creative with the subdued reflection where the viewer gains a slight hint of the features. Bumping up.', '2005-02-15 09:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
