(1170930, 146855, 2490, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject focus, but the wall color bothers me.  Don''t mean to insult your walls.  Somehow it just pulls my eye away from you.  7</td>', 'Excellent subject focus, but the wall color bothers me.  Don''t mean to insult your walls.  Somehow it just pulls my eye away from you.  7', '2005-02-15 12:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
