(1170936, 146444, 2490, '<td valign="top">Definitely different.  I do think a shirt version would have impressed me more - no insult intended, it just seems that the subject of the shot is the chest, and I don''t think that''s what you meant.  The camera just hides the face enough to make it confusing, which leaves the chest and arms as the easiest thing to look at.  I mean all this constructively; hope I''m not insulting.</td>', 'Definitely different.  I do think a shirt version would have impressed me more - no insult intended, it just seems that the subject of the shot is the chest, and I don''t think that''s what you meant.  The camera just hides the face enough to make it confusing, which leaves the chest and arms as the easiest thing to look at.  I mean all this constructively; hope I''m not insulting.', '2005-02-15 12:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170937, 146394, 2490, '<td valign="top">I hope this didn''t hurt as much as it looks like it did.... 8</td>', 'I hope this didn''t hurt as much as it looks like it did.... 8', '2005-02-15 12:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170939, 146881, 15274, '<td valign="top">i like it, but i would have liked it better if your forehead was labeled with your last name, and your eyes were closed. 7</td>', 'i like it, but i would have liked it better if your forehead was labeled with your last name, and your eyes were closed. 7', '2005-02-15 12:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170943, 145281, 2490, '<td valign="top">The eyes are great, but the nose ring either needs to be there or not be there to really make this one great.  Not slamming the nose ring; it just distracts from the pic as is, and a good portrait ALWAYS emphasizes the eyes, in my opinion.  Good luck! 7</td>', 'The eyes are great, but the nose ring either needs to be there or not be there to really make this one great.  Not slamming the nose ring; it just distracts from the pic as is, and a good portrait ALWAYS emphasizes the eyes, in my opinion.  Good luck! 7', '2005-02-15 12:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170944, 146521, 2490, '<td valign="top">I love the high key!  Monochrome works so well here, and you focused on the eyes very effectively.  Good shot! 9</td>', 'I love the high key!  Monochrome works so well here, and you focused on the eyes very effectively.  Good shot! 9', '2005-02-15 12:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170945, 146349, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very nice... good contrast and compozition.</td>', 'Very nice... good contrast and compozition.', '2005-02-15 12:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170946, 146419, 15274, '<td valign="top">nice reds... and framing... perhaps a better result with some sharpening on your face?</td>', 'nice reds... and framing... perhaps a better result with some sharpening on your face?', '2005-02-15 12:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170947, 145659, 2490, '<td valign="top">I like to see eyes more than noses - no insult to your nose :)  Fully including the eye would have helped me like this more.  6</td>', 'I like to see eyes more than noses - no insult to your nose :)  Fully including the eye would have helped me like this more.  6', '2005-02-15 12:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
