(1170961, 146563, 2490, '<td valign="top">Better focus on the eyes with a slight blur on the mouth would have improved this by a point or so.  7</td>', 'Better focus on the eyes with a slight blur on the mouth would have improved this by a point or so.  7', '2005-02-15 12:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170962, 146420, 15274, '<td valign="top">perfect</td>', 'perfect', '2005-02-15 12:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170963, 146484, 32754, '<td valign="top">Great portrait...love the hat and the shadow it casts on the eyes...everything fits.</td>', 'Great portrait...love the hat and the shadow it casts on the eyes...everything fits.', '2005-02-15 12:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170964, 146532, 2490, '<td valign="top">I think a SLIGHTLY (5-10%) tighter crop would have been a bit better.  I like space, but something about the position here makes me look at the space too much and the subject too little.  7</td>', 'I think a SLIGHTLY (5-10%) tighter crop would have been a bit better.  I like space, but something about the position here makes me look at the space too much and the subject too little.  7', '2005-02-15 12:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170968, 146647, 2490, '<td valign="top">A touch dark.  A bit of frontlighting on the belly would have helped this, for me.  Best of luck with the baby :) 6</td>', 'A touch dark.  A bit of frontlighting on the belly would have helped this, for me.  Best of luck with the baby :) 6', '2005-02-15 12:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170970, 146601, 2490, '<td valign="top">For some reason the crop seems static.  Rule of thirds is there, but the window frame is too centered.  Cropping the window some would have pulled my eye to the subject more effectively, I think.  6</td>', 'For some reason the crop seems static.  Rule of thirds is there, but the window frame is too centered.  Cropping the window some would have pulled my eye to the subject more effectively, I think.  6', '2005-02-15 12:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170972, 145677, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very nice light...</td>', 'Very nice light...', '2005-02-15 12:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170973, 146289, 29156, '<td valign="top">the photo would be much better if you´d crop above the line on your chest - it distracts from your face - then this photo would be very good</td>', 'the photo would be much better if you´d crop above the line on your chest - it distracts from your face - then this photo would be very good', '2005-02-15 12:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170974, 146507, 2490, '<td valign="top">Good lines!  Cropping out a bit of the foreground makes it pop more, for me, though.  8</td>', 'Good lines!  Cropping out a bit of the foreground makes it pop more, for me, though.  8', '2005-02-15 12:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170976, 146420, 16912, '<td valign="top">I''ve sat looking at this pic for 10 minutes trying to write a comment, am lost for words.  There are so many stories this picture can tell and eveything about it is excellent.</td>', 'I''ve sat looking at this pic for 10 minutes trying to write a comment, am lost for words.  There are so many stories this picture can tell and eveything about it is excellent.', '2005-02-15 12:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170977, 145220, 2490, '<td valign="top">A touch more symmetry of the hands and a slight crop off the right edge would have been an improvement.  7</td>', 'A touch more symmetry of the hands and a slight crop off the right edge would have been an improvement.  7', '2005-02-15 12:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170984, 146211, 16912, '<td valign="top">Great work, and well excecuted.</td>', 'Great work, and well excecuted.', '2005-02-15 12:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170985, 146860, 2490, '<td valign="top">Not to insult the figurine, but I think this would have been SOOOOO good without it.  Your face and the white background work together so well, and the eyes are perfectly focused and positioned.  The figurine distracts.  This is a perfect autobiography cover without the figurine. 8</td>', 'Not to insult the figurine, but I think this would have been SOOOOO good without it.  Your face and the white background work together so well, and the eyes are perfectly focused and positioned.  The figurine distracts.  This is a perfect autobiography cover without the figurine. 8', '2005-02-15 12:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170986, 146211, 27524, '<td valign="top">I think just one with eye would be enough impressive.</td>', 'I think just one with eye would be enough impressive.', '2005-02-15 12:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170989, 146673, 16912, '<td valign="top">Great use of b&amp;w, I think you got the shot spot on. If I could fault it I''d probably have been kissing rather than liking?</td>', 'Great use of b&w, I think you got the shot spot on. If I could fault it I''d probably have been kissing rather than liking?', '2005-02-15 12:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170990, 144919, 29156, '<td valign="top">excellent photo</td>', 'excellent photo', '2005-02-15 12:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170993, 146673, 2490, '<td valign="top">Obviously it''s YOUR portrait, so please don''t misunderstand, but I think the tongue retracted and an intimate cheek-guitar contact would have conveyed "lover" better.  This is a great shot, I just don''t particularly enjoy the pose. 7</td>', 'Obviously it''s YOUR portrait, so please don''t misunderstand, but I think the tongue retracted and an intimate cheek-guitar contact would have conveyed "lover" better.  This is a great shot, I just don''t particularly enjoy the pose. 7', '2005-02-15 12:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170994, 146577, 27524, '<td valign="top">Well done...good light and expression.</td>', 'Well done...good light and expression.', '2005-02-15 12:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170996, 146882, 29156, '<td valign="top">very nice work</td>', 'very nice work', '2005-02-15 12:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170998, 145659, 29156, '<td valign="top">excellent crop and work and nice look</td>', 'excellent crop and work and nice look', '2005-02-15 12:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1170999, 145599, 33336, '<td valign="top">Interesting...the light on your face is a little dark. My eye is drawn to the snow and blue jacket at the base, rather than the face.</td>', 'Interesting...the light on your face is a little dark. My eye is drawn to the snow and blue jacket at the base, rather than the face.', '2005-02-15 12:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171000, 146450, 29156, '<td valign="top">very beautiful and warm photo and excellent work - 10</td>', 'very beautiful and warm photo and excellent work - 10', '2005-02-15 12:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171001, 146521, 29156, '<td valign="top">absolutely great work - 10</td>', 'absolutely great work - 10', '2005-02-15 12:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171002, 145703, 29156, '<td valign="top">very nice work - 10</td>', 'very nice work - 10', '2005-02-15 12:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171003, 146710, 29156, '<td valign="top">very nice photo, warm and friendly - great crop, colors and work - 10</td>', 'very nice photo, warm and friendly - great crop, colors and work - 10', '2005-02-15 12:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171005, 146659, 27524, '<td valign="top">Impressive... creative idea.</td>', 'Impressive... creative idea.', '2005-02-15 12:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171008, 145677, 2490, '<td valign="top">Something about the lighting is harsh.  This pose has GREAT potential, and I like it.  Diffusing the light a little would help, and the black seems too even.  If there were stars, or something, I would really believe he is looking at his farm.  I like this, just trying to help you improve it a bit.  8</td>', 'Something about the lighting is harsh.  This pose has GREAT potential, and I like it.  Diffusing the light a little would help, and the black seems too even.  If there were stars, or something, I would really believe he is looking at his farm.  I like this, just trying to help you improve it a bit.  8', '2005-02-15 12:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171010, 146577, 16912, '<td valign="top">I''m becomming a fan of negatve space, I just can''t do it as well as you have. Great shot, and an excellent choice of model ;) I</td>', 'I''m becomming a fan of negatve space, I just can''t do it as well as you have. Great shot, and an excellent choice of model ;) I', '2005-02-15 12:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171011, 145691, 29156, '<td valign="top">great work with light, very nice self portrait, good framing and colors  -10</td>', 'great work with light, very nice self portrait, good framing and colors  -10', '2005-02-15 12:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171012, 146759, 2490, '<td valign="top">For some reason the slight variation in lighting from left to right eye bothers me.  I like it for the face, but I would like the "windows" to be evenly lighted.  Excellent focus and good catchlights on the left.  8</td>', 'For some reason the slight variation in lighting from left to right eye bothers me.  I like it for the face, but I would like the "windows" to be evenly lighted.  Excellent focus and good catchlights on the left.  8', '2005-02-15 12:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171013, 145078, 2490, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. 7</td>', 'Nice shot. 7', '2005-02-15 12:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171014, 146881, 2490, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous! 6</td>', 'I''m jealous! 6', '2005-02-15 13:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171015, 146848, 16912, '<td valign="top">Am sure I saw something similar recently (done differently though). I like the effect and the angle of the shot as got me spinning - well done.</td>', 'Am sure I saw something similar recently (done differently though). I like the effect and the angle of the shot as got me spinning - well done.', '2005-02-15 13:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171017, 146727, 2490, '<td valign="top">A white sheet covering the door and thus removing that texture from the photo would have made this a GREAT shot.  7</td>', 'A white sheet covering the door and thus removing that texture from the photo would have made this a GREAT shot.  7', '2005-02-15 13:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171019, 145677, 16912, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure and clarity in this shot, if you were facing just a touch to the right you''d have got an eye and more interest into the picture? bumping1</td>', 'Excellent exposure and clarity in this shot, if you were facing just a touch to the right you''d have got an eye and more interest into the picture? bumping1', '2005-02-15 13:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171020, 146810, 2490, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Lotsa work.  The pinky over the eye is a huge distraction for me.  I know this was a tough shot.  7</td>', 'Wow.  Lotsa work.  The pinky over the eye is a huge distraction for me.  I know this was a tough shot.  7', '2005-02-15 13:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171023, 145799, 16912, '<td valign="top">A few blown areas on this shot but looking at the rest of the picture I''d guess that was deliberate? very nice variation on a portrait shot.  bumping1</td>', 'A few blown areas on this shot but looking at the rest of the picture I''d guess that was deliberate? very nice variation on a portrait shot.  bumping1', '2005-02-15 13:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171027, 146577, 29156, '<td valign="top">great framing, crop, colors, gesture - great photo - 10  ...some sadness in your eyes, worries on your forehead and locked up soul in your mouth...</td>', 'great framing, crop, colors, gesture - great photo - 10  ...some sadness in your eyes, worries on your forehead and locked up soul in your mouth...', '2005-02-15 13:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
