(1171286, 144809, 27375, '<td valign="top">Nice brave  portrait. I would have liked the tones to be more even on the right arm and the thing in the floor is a bit distracting. Other than that everything is great.</td>', 'Nice brave  portrait. I would have liked the tones to be more even on the right arm and the thing in the floor is a bit distracting. Other than that everything is great.', '2005-02-15 15:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
