(1171329, 146507, 24925, '<td valign="top">I like it...kinda seems like I''m being cheated because it''s the elements of the landscape which I like about this photo.  As far as a self-portrait, I''m not seeing much of a human element in this photo...but if I looked long enough, I might find it.  I''m torn between giving it a 9 and giving it a 5...I might come back to this.  In the meantime, it''s a 7.  Either way, great photo!</td>', 'I like it...kinda seems like I''m being cheated because it''s the elements of the landscape which I like about this photo.  As far as a self-portrait, I''m not seeing much of a human element in this photo...but if I looked long enough, I might find it.  I''m torn between giving it a 9 and giving it a 5...I might come back to this.  In the meantime, it''s a 7.  Either way, great photo!', '2005-02-15 15:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
