(1171611, 146540, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Good capture of facial expression, lighting produces warm skin tones.  Unfortunately,  the image suffers from what I can only describe as "floating head syndrome."  A bit more light thrown on the shoulders would have helped with that.  Focal point appears to be dead center, although the positioning of the eyes in the top third is good.  Overall, a good shot which leaves the viewer wondering what the subject is contemplating.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Good capture of facial expression, lighting produces warm skin tones.  Unfortunately,  the image suffers from what I can only describe as "floating head syndrome."  A bit more light thrown on the shoulders would have helped with that.  Focal point appears to be dead center, although the positioning of the eyes in the top third is good.  Overall, a good shot which leaves the viewer wondering what the subject is contemplating.', '2005-02-15 18:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
