(1171651, 146302, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Good composition.  Lighting doesn''t flatter the skin tones, although it does bring out the drama in the eyes.  Find myself wishing the eyes were level or at least looking directly at the lens.  Overall, a decent shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Good composition.  Lighting doesn''t flatter the skin tones, although it does bring out the drama in the eyes.  Find myself wishing the eyes were level or at least looking directly at the lens.  Overall, a decent shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-02-15 19:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
