(1171672, 146483, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Creative concept!  Unfortunately, the alignment is a bit off which is a distraction.  Background is visually uninteresting and might have been cropped out for bigger impact.  Overall, a great idea.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Creative concept!  Unfortunately, the alignment is a bit off which is a distraction.  Background is visually uninteresting and might have been cropped out for bigger impact.  Overall, a great idea.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-02-15 19:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171673, 145789, 14012, '<td valign="top">Dude, you look so sad. You just got married and returned from Hawaii...it can''t be that bad!!  :-)<br/> <br/>Must be nice having a good studio at your disposal. Lighting is great, negative space is great. Should place up there. Good luck Joel.</td>', 'Dude, you look so sad. You just got married and returned from Hawaii...it can''t be that bad!!  :-) Must be nice having a good studio at your disposal. Lighting is great, negative space is great. Should place up there. Good luck Joel.', '2005-02-15 19:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171674, 146420, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is just awesome, great and unusual foreground.<br/> <br/>Fantastic tones.</td>', 'That is just awesome, great and unusual foreground. Fantastic tones.', '2005-02-15 19:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171675, 146516, 29404, '<td valign="top">that is one beautifull shot ...all elements r powerfull in effect....lovely shades and light....colors is great as well</td>', 'that is one beautifull shot ...all elements r powerfull in effect....lovely shades and light....colors is great as well', '2005-02-15 19:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171681, 145619, 14012, '<td valign="top">Too shallow DOF. Looks like the focus is on the left eye, and because the DOF is too shallow the right eye is a little softer. Not sure what your aperture was set at, but if you setting up a tad, that should take care of the soft right eye.</td>', 'Too shallow DOF. Looks like the focus is on the left eye, and because the DOF is too shallow the right eye is a little softer. Not sure what your aperture was set at, but if you setting up a tad, that should take care of the soft right eye.', '2005-02-15 19:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171686, 145745, 14012, '<td valign="top">really overexposed, green color cast, and the seam is really distracting. Sorry, not a bad idea, just poorly executed, IMHO. Good luck.</td>', 'really overexposed, green color cast, and the seam is really distracting. Sorry, not a bad idea, just poorly executed, IMHO. Good luck.', '2005-02-15 19:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171699, 146357, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Good pose and composition.  Focus seems a bit soft, which isn''t necessarily bad but doesn''t work as well here as you might have intended.  The highlight on the earring is a bit distracting as well.  Overall, a great capture of facial expression.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Good pose and composition.  Focus seems a bit soft, which isn''t necessarily bad but doesn''t work as well here as you might have intended.  The highlight on the earring is a bit distracting as well.  Overall, a great capture of facial expression.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-02-15 19:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1171715, 146735, 14012, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W. one nit pick, it looks like the focus is the tip of the nose, rather than your eyes. good luck</td>', 'I like the B&W. one nit pick, it looks like the focus is the tip of the nose, rather than your eyes. good luck', '2005-02-15 19:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
