(1171790, 145988, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, good colors, and fuuunyyy. I just wish the bag was squared up on the right hand side where it bulges out, but other than that perfect execution of a clever concept.</td>', 'Great lighting, good colors, and fuuunyyy. I just wish the bag was squared up on the right hand side where it bulges out, but other than that perfect execution of a clever concept.', '2005-02-15 20:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
