(1174912, 146394, 25363, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful. When I saw the thumb and read the title I cracked. Then enlarged and saw what a true great piece of art work! BRAVO!!! Definatly blue material. 2 thumbs up!</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful. When I saw the thumb and read the title I cracked. Then enlarged and saw what a true great piece of art work! BRAVO!!! Definatly blue material. 2 thumbs up!', '2005-02-16 14:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174943, 146495, 22479, '<td valign="top">Like your title. Given that this is a self portrait challenge, I hope ya shot a pic of yourself, which is actually better than what a few others have done. Nicely exposed and composed. A very literal and elegantly simple entry. Your choice of background may not be the most flattering however. I offer you a 6.</td>', 'Like your title. Given that this is a self portrait challenge, I hope ya shot a pic of yourself, which is actually better than what a few others have done. Nicely exposed and composed. A very literal and elegantly simple entry. Your choice of background may not be the most flattering however. I offer you a 6.', '2005-02-16 14:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174956, 146737, 22479, '<td valign="top">The left eye is out of the plane of focus, as clearly seen. You''re focusing in on a specific feature of your face, and I wish you kept both of them in focus.  Good detail within the other eye and a rather revealing catch light, as your title suggests, give insight to this picture. I offer you a 6.</td>', 'The left eye is out of the plane of focus, as clearly seen. You''re focusing in on a specific feature of your face, and I wish you kept both of them in focus.  Good detail within the other eye and a rather revealing catch light, as your title suggests, give insight to this picture. I offer you a 6.', '2005-02-16 15:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174962, 145842, 22479, '<td valign="top">A thoughtful and emotive entry, enhanced by the selective desaturation. It really works well here. I offer you a 7.</td>', 'A thoughtful and emotive entry, enhanced by the selective desaturation. It really works well here. I offer you a 7.', '2005-02-16 15:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174974, 146858, 22479, '<td valign="top">Fa, a long long way to run? With this technically excellent entry, I doubt it. I applaud your choice of employing a selective desaturation to the photo which really complements and enhances an entry for this type of challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Fa, a long long way to run? With this technically excellent entry, I doubt it. I applaud your choice of employing a selective desaturation to the photo which really complements and enhances an entry for this type of challenge. Well done.', '2005-02-16 15:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174980, 146883, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice response to the challenge with very good lighting to make the point.  The image has a softness but I like it because it supports the rather attentive but somber mood. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very nice response to the challenge with very good lighting to make the point.  The image has a softness but I like it because it supports the rather attentive but somber mood. Bumping up.', '2005-02-16 15:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174993, 145911, 22479, '<td valign="top">A bold entry with mostly excellent lighting. I would prefer if you had eliminated the shadow across your chest cast by your head. Aside from that minor issue, what can I say, just a great emotive piece. 8</td>', 'A bold entry with mostly excellent lighting. I would prefer if you had eliminated the shadow across your chest cast by your head. Aside from that minor issue, what can I say, just a great emotive piece. 8', '2005-02-16 15:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1174994, 146029, 22734, '<td valign="top">A great b/w study with an inner message that may evade the casual viewer. The dark and light background is inversed in the face which rings of the ying-yang and all things where polarity plays the sum result of the living experience both physically and spiritually. Even the hand placement adds tension and the entire image comes to a well balanced conclusion. Bumping up.</td>', 'A great b/w study with an inner message that may evade the casual viewer. The dark and light background is inversed in the face which rings of the ying-yang and all things where polarity plays the sum result of the living experience both physically and spiritually. Even the hand placement adds tension and the entire image comes to a well balanced conclusion. Bumping up.', '2005-02-16 15:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175007, 145727, 22734, '<td valign="top">Exceptional detail and good lighting speaking of the fatigue factor. A very interesting response to this challenge because it meets the principle and gives the extra extension of a feeling we are all subject to succumb to. Bumping up.</td>', 'Exceptional detail and good lighting speaking of the fatigue factor. A very interesting response to this challenge because it meets the principle and gives the extra extension of a feeling we are all subject to succumb to. Bumping up.', '2005-02-16 15:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
