(1175246, 145745, 5286, '<td valign="top">:)) funny idea :).</td>', ':)) funny idea :).', '2005-02-16 16:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175247, 145803, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>nice work.  the focus, composition, pose, and expression all work well.  the lighting is a bit strong, washing out a lot of the tonality and character in your face.  the cropping works extremely well.</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. nice work.  the focus, composition, pose, and expression all work well.  the lighting is a bit strong, washing out a lot of the tonality and character in your face.  the cropping works extremely well.', '2005-02-16 16:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175257, 145947, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>this is very, very clever, almost dali-esque.  i like most everything about the image except for your treatment of the foreground and the background:  the terrycloth picks up too much detail, and the wrinkles in the background come through too much.  other than that, this is a shot i would like to attempt, myself.  thanks for an interesting twist on the challenge!</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. this is very, very clever, almost dali-esque.  i like most everything about the image except for your treatment of the foreground and the background:  the terrycloth picks up too much detail, and the wrinkles in the background come through too much.  other than that, this is a shot i would like to attempt, myself.  thanks for an interesting twist on the challenge!', '2005-02-16 16:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175265, 144813, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>you have chosen a unique perspective to portray yourself.  in most situations, i would complain about the lighting washing out the details and character, but i can see that is what you are after:  good job!  the overall composition and expression work well.  this is a good example of recognizing what you are after before shooting, and then following through on the execution.  8 from me.</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. you have chosen a unique perspective to portray yourself.  in most situations, i would complain about the lighting washing out the details and character, but i can see that is what you are after:  good job!  the overall composition and expression work well.  this is a good example of recognizing what you are after before shooting, and then following through on the execution.  8 from me.', '2005-02-16 16:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175267, 144823, 24642, '<td valign="top">Congrats.</td>', 'Congrats.', '2005-02-16 16:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175271, 144897, 23394, '<td valign="top">somehow, i don''t think you spent 4 hours in the make-up trailer, getting ready for this shoot...<br/> <br/>interesting composition.  the lighting gets your point across, pretty much the same way you would if you were holding up a convenience store (in that you really don''t anyone to know just who you are).</td>', 'somehow, i don''t think you spent 4 hours in the make-up trailer, getting ready for this shoot... interesting composition.  the lighting gets your point across, pretty much the same way you would if you were holding up a convenience store (in that you really don''t anyone to know just who you are).', '2005-02-16 16:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175281, 145255, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>very clever idea, definitely one of the more interesting submissions i''ve run across.  i feel, though, the lighting is a bit too strong in some area, creating too much contrast between the near blowouts and the black background.  all the same, this is something i definitely would like to try.  thanks for the idea!  8 from me.</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. very clever idea, definitely one of the more interesting submissions i''ve run across.  i feel, though, the lighting is a bit too strong in some area, creating too much contrast between the near blowouts and the black background.  all the same, this is something i definitely would like to try.  thanks for the idea!  8 from me.', '2005-02-16 16:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175283, 146521, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very stylish.  A very good composition.</td>', 'Very stylish.  A very good composition.', '2005-02-16 16:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175289, 144823, 30777, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Great idea using the mirror</td>', 'Excellent!  Great idea using the mirror', '2005-02-16 16:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
