(1175308, 146459, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>excellent work!  what fun!  the composition, expression, and colors all work well together.  too bad about the hat taking the brunt of the lighting, because the range of tonalities elsewhere are wonderful.</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. excellent work!  what fun!  the composition, expression, and colors all work well together.  too bad about the hat taking the brunt of the lighting, because the range of tonalities elsewhere are wonderful.', '2005-02-16 16:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175312, 146757, 26756, '<td valign="top">I think the green and grey combination works well for this photo.  The pose is original.  The blurring looks like PS work, and there is nothing wrong with that, but I wonder what it would have looked like just shot at F/1.8 or 2.8.  Nice effect though and a good photo.</td>', 'I think the green and grey combination works well for this photo.  The pose is original.  The blurring looks like PS work, and there is nothing wrong with that, but I wonder what it would have looked like just shot at F/1.8 or 2.8.  Nice effect though and a good photo.', '2005-02-16 16:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175319, 145582, 5286, '<td valign="top">very well done. The tight crop from the top is really effective, and the background is great too. Also it helps that you have a good subject to start out with :) I only think it might be more effective with a tighter from the right.  9.</td>', 'very well done. The tight crop from the top is really effective, and the background is great too. Also it helps that you have a good subject to start out with :) I only think it might be more effective with a tighter from the right.  9.', '2005-02-16 16:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175321, 146710, 26756, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and crisp focus. I like the gray on white color combination.</td>', 'Nice framing and crisp focus. I like the gray on white color combination.', '2005-02-16 17:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175323, 146757, 5286, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture!! The colors are so neat, and so is the expression!! 10 :)</td>', 'Lovely picture!! The colors are so neat, and so is the expression!! 10 :)', '2005-02-16 17:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175324, 146846, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>i appreciate what you''ve attempted here, as i tried something similar, but just couldn''t make it work.  reflections are very, very tricky.  i like your general composition and choice of colors; i think they very much convey the image you wanted to create.  unfortunately, i think your reflection is coming through a bit too forced, almost as if pasted in.  this is definitely something worth revisiting, possibly outside the constraints of editing rules, as i think you are onto something.  nice effort!</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. i appreciate what you''ve attempted here, as i tried something similar, but just couldn''t make it work.  reflections are very, very tricky.  i like your general composition and choice of colors; i think they very much convey the image you wanted to create.  unfortunately, i think your reflection is coming through a bit too forced, almost as if pasted in.  this is definitely something worth revisiting, possibly outside the constraints of editing rules, as i think you are onto something.  nice effort!', '2005-02-16 17:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175333, 146864, 5286, '<td valign="top">Great picture. But it''s hardly siren like.. more angelic than siren-y :) with all the whites... Is this Sonja? <br/></td>', 'Great picture. But it''s hardly siren like.. more angelic than siren-y :) with all the whites... Is this Sonja? ', '2005-02-16 17:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175347, 144801, 26756, '<td valign="top">Very unique idea.  I like the motion blur and the subject matter which gives a hint of your lifestyle.  Good portrait.</td>', 'Very unique idea.  I like the motion blur and the subject matter which gives a hint of your lifestyle.  Good portrait.', '2005-02-16 17:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175380, 146507, 9452, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, contrast, sharpness and expresion.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, contrast, sharpness and expresion.', '2005-02-16 17:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175386, 146866, 9452, '<td valign="top">Cleaver! The refelction gives strength to the image.</td>', 'Cleaver! The refelction gives strength to the image.', '2005-02-16 17:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175394, 146395, 9452, '<td valign="top">Now, this is real good. From composition to sharpness.</td>', 'Now, this is real good. From composition to sharpness.', '2005-02-16 17:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175397, 146659, 9452, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, hope the glass had resisted. :)</td>', 'Interesting angle, hope the glass had resisted. :)', '2005-02-16 17:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1175401, 145156, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>my immediate reaction is that your face is too centered, that you are not making enough of the available negative space to either side of your profile.  next, i think lighting is just a tad too strong.  all the same, this is a great composition, nicely captured.</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. my immediate reaction is that your face is too centered, that you are not making enough of the available negative space to either side of your profile.  next, i think lighting is just a tad too strong.  all the same, this is a great composition, nicely captured.', '2005-02-16 17:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
