(1176074, 145438, 23394, '<td valign="top">dare i say...nice bokeh!  excellent work, gordon.  the lighting is tops.  you really have captured the full range of your face.  honestly, i don''t know enough about portraiture to really critique this, so i''m just going through, looking to see what seems to work and what doesn''t.  this pretty much seems to hit all the way around.  good luck!  8 from me.</td>', 'dare i say...nice bokeh!  excellent work, gordon.  the lighting is tops.  you really have captured the full range of your face.  honestly, i don''t know enough about portraiture to really critique this, so i''m just going through, looking to see what seems to work and what doesn''t.  this pretty much seems to hit all the way around.  good luck!  8 from me.', '2005-02-16 21:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176076, 146211, 4793, '<td valign="top">Different, nice composition, nice work.</td>', 'Different, nice composition, nice work.', '2005-02-16 21:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
