(1176119, 145395, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice title!  I love the double entendre!  (Not a bad photo either. At least, it works for me!)  Excellent composition, very sharp focus.... nice  work!  9</td>', 'Nice title!  I love the double entendre!  (Not a bad photo either. At least, it works for me!)  Excellent composition, very sharp focus.... nice  work!  9', '2005-02-16 21:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
