(1176133, 145593, 32754, '<td valign="top">Wait until you''re my age...if you feel this intense now..watch out!</td>', 'Wait until you''re my age...if you feel this intense now..watch out!', '2005-02-16 21:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176136, 146350, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>my initial reaction is it is a bit too centered.  i like the lighting, the expression, the pose.  i especially like the range of colors across your face--very nice work.  it just feels that there is a bit too much space behind your head (maybe take a look at a 1.25:1 crop from the left?).  all the same, great work, and good luck!</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. my initial reaction is it is a bit too centered.  i like the lighting, the expression, the pose.  i especially like the range of colors across your face--very nice work.  it just feels that there is a bit too much space behind your head (maybe take a look at a 1.25:1 crop from the left?).  all the same, great work, and good luck!', '2005-02-16 21:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176144, 146420, 32754, '<td valign="top">I love the quality of this photo, it has a coarse grainy foreground softened by the person beyond.  The textures are very good and arresting to the eye.</td>', 'I love the quality of this photo, it has a coarse grainy foreground softened by the person beyond.  The textures are very good and arresting to the eye.', '2005-02-16 21:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176163, 146349, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>what am excellent capture.  damn!  i hope to learn how to do this.  the lighting, composition, focus, expression--you''ve done it all.  love the hat.   really hope to see this on the front page.  9 from me.</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. what am excellent capture.  damn!  i hope to learn how to do this.  the lighting, composition, focus, expression--you''ve done it all.  love the hat.   really hope to see this on the front page.  9 from me.', '2005-02-16 21:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176175, 145988, 6661, '<td valign="top">LMAO</td>', 'LMAO', '2005-02-16 21:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176187, 144919, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is simply stunning.  i don''t know squat about portraiture (i specialize in bugs, sunrises, blurry taxis), but this is something i hope to learn to do.  i just love images that are on the edge, but so subtly under control that when you realize that it''s not accidental all you can do is go WOW.  this is one of those images.  great work.  at least a 9 from me.</td>', 'this is simply stunning.  i don''t know squat about portraiture (i specialize in bugs, sunrises, blurry taxis), but this is something i hope to learn to do.  i just love images that are on the edge, but so subtly under control that when you realize that it''s not accidental all you can do is go WOW.  this is one of those images.  great work.  at least a 9 from me.', '2005-02-16 21:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176206, 145988, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is a RIOT!  and sure to be one of the most commented on images in the challenge.  well done, all the way around.  lighting, colors, composition, pose--it all works.  good luck!</td>', 'this is a RIOT!  and sure to be one of the most commented on images in the challenge.  well done, all the way around.  lighting, colors, composition, pose--it all works.  good luck!', '2005-02-16 21:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176210, 146840, 23394, '<td valign="top">i still say someone visiting with limited time should spend more of their time east of city hall...</td>', 'i still say someone visiting with limited time should spend more of their time east of city hall...', '2005-02-16 22:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176216, 146622, 23394, '<td valign="top">i can be as forgiving and open minded as the next guy, but this is stretching it just a bit too far.  5 is the best i can do at the moment.</td>', 'i can be as forgiving and open minded as the next guy, but this is stretching it just a bit too far.  5 is the best i can do at the moment.', '2005-02-16 22:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176266, 145745, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i admire the effort you went through to produce this image, i''m afraid the execution has let you down.</td>', 'while i admire the effort you went through to produce this image, i''m afraid the execution has let you down.', '2005-02-16 22:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176278, 146885, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>my first reaction to this is that it is more of a snapshot of you than an image that i would consider a portrait.  but, as i look at it more, you have captured the essence of you, which is the whole purpose, isn''t it?  maybe it would have a bit more impact if it was more tightly cropped to your hands and face.  all the same, good luck!</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. my first reaction to this is that it is more of a snapshot of you than an image that i would consider a portrait.  but, as i look at it more, you have captured the essence of you, which is the whole purpose, isn''t it?  maybe it would have a bit more impact if it was more tightly cropped to your hands and face.  all the same, good luck!', '2005-02-16 22:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176285, 146673, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice composition and control over the lighting.  my guess is that this is running hit-or-miss on the appeal factor, but that you really don''t care--you have a killer image that captured exactly what you were after.  good luck!</td>', 'nice composition and control over the lighting.  my guess is that this is running hit-or-miss on the appeal factor, but that you really don''t care--you have a killer image that captured exactly what you were after.  good luck!', '2005-02-16 22:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176317, 146725, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m not going to beat you up over image size or meeting the challenge.  i''m scoring you a 5, and hoping that you don''t take the comments personally.  this place can do wonders for developing your photography, but it is not without bumps and bruises.  i like your idea and the creativity it shows.  just remember, the biggest mistake you can make is to quit trying!</td>', 'i''m not going to beat you up over image size or meeting the challenge.  i''m scoring you a 5, and hoping that you don''t take the comments personally.  this place can do wonders for developing your photography, but it is not without bumps and bruises.  i like your idea and the creativity it shows.  just remember, the biggest mistake you can make is to quit trying!', '2005-02-16 22:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176329, 146395, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>great lighting and composition.  overall, nicely captured.  love the range of colors.  all in all, everything works very well here.  really goes to show what is possible in the middle of the day, if you know what you''re doing.  good luck!</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. great lighting and composition.  overall, nicely captured.  love the range of colors.  all in all, everything works very well here.  really goes to show what is possible in the middle of the day, if you know what you''re doing.  good luck!', '2005-02-16 22:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
