(1176365, 145571, 23394, '<td valign="top">as always, excellent work.  as i don''t know squat about portraiture, i''m just going through the images, looking for what works and what doesn''t.  the lighting and composition are perfect, and the treatment is very well-suited.  do hope you''ll share your lighting set up with this is over.  good luck!</td>', 'as always, excellent work.  as i don''t know squat about portraiture, i''m just going through the images, looking for what works and what doesn''t.  the lighting and composition are perfect, and the treatment is very well-suited.  do hope you''ll share your lighting set up with this is over.  good luck!', '2005-02-16 22:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
