(1176374, 144760, 20662, '<td valign="top">I hope at 75 I will be stepping out not hiding! I bet your lovely behind that scarf.</td>', 'I hope at 75 I will be stepping out not hiding! I bet your lovely behind that scarf.', '2005-02-16 22:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176376, 146513, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>my first reaction is that the lighting is a bit off, but the more i look at it, the more the image settles in.  i like the cropping and composition.  this definitely has more of a real-life feel than a studio shot.  i does seem that it could benefit from a bit more lighting on the dark side of the face:  there just seems to be a bit more character in there that is lost in the shadows.  good luck!</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. my first reaction is that the lighting is a bit off, but the more i look at it, the more the image settles in.  i like the cropping and composition.  this definitely has more of a real-life feel than a studio shot.  i does seem that it could benefit from a bit more lighting on the dark side of the face:  there just seems to be a bit more character in there that is lost in the shadows.  good luck!', '2005-02-16 22:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
