(1176380, 146521, 20662, '<td valign="top">very creative portrait. love the high key</td>', 'very creative portrait. love the high key', '2005-02-16 23:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176381, 146415, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>what a great shot!  the colors, composition, expression, focus, lighting--all the elements come together.  the one thing i can''t tell is just what that expression means?  is it a "you''re kidding me" look, or a "hold still and i''ll whack you" look?  good job keeping it all under control, especially shooting at this time of day.  good luck!</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image as a guinnea pig as to what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. what a great shot!  the colors, composition, expression, focus, lighting--all the elements come together.  the one thing i can''t tell is just what that expression means?  is it a "you''re kidding me" look, or a "hold still and i''ll whack you" look?  good job keeping it all under control, especially shooting at this time of day.  good luck!', '2005-02-16 23:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
