(1176864, 146349, 27767, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8, Very nice composition.  I enjoy the cropping out of some of the face and hat, and it makes the shot feel more lively than perfectly centered portraits<br/>Technical: 8, Excellent (and important) catchlight on both eyes.<br/>Appeal: 8, Great balance of light and shadow<br/>Challenge: 9<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 8, Good overall focus too</td>', 'Composition: 8, Very nice composition.  I enjoy the cropping out of some of the face and hat, and it makes the shot feel more lively than perfectly centered portraitsTechnical: 8, Excellent (and important) catchlight on both eyes.Appeal: 8, Great balance of light and shadowChallenge: 9Overall Calculated Average Score: 8, Good overall focus too', '2005-02-17 03:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1176898, 146048, 27767, '<td valign="top">Composition: 6<br/>Technical: 8<br/>Appeal: 10, Excellent Illusion! Hope to read about how you did it after the challenge<br/>Challenge: 10, Great creativity to make this shot stand out in the crowd<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 9</td>', 'Composition: 6Technical: 8Appeal: 10, Excellent Illusion! Hope to read about how you did it after the challengeChallenge: 10, Great creativity to make this shot stand out in the crowdOverall Calculated Average Score: 9', '2005-02-17 04:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
