(1177189, 144824, 27767, '<td valign="top">Composition: 7<br/>Technical: 8, Very interesting lighting effects<br/>Appeal: 9, Great pose captured in mid-air<br/>Challenge: 9<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 8, Almost has frightening feel to it with that expression.  Quite interesting</td>', 'Composition: 7Technical: 8, Very interesting lighting effectsAppeal: 9, Great pose captured in mid-airChallenge: 9Overall Calculated Average Score: 8, Almost has frightening feel to it with that expression.  Quite interesting', '2005-02-17 08:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177204, 146830, 22734, '<td valign="top">Usually the eyes are eagerly sought in a portrait, however, in this case the downward gaze with eye lids covering most of them, works so well simply because gaze supports the pensive general expression down to the slightly tightly pursed lips. Even a softer background would have been better to maintain attention on the facial feautures. While the lighting is not as dramatic as the expression, the overall effect meets the challenge well. These observations are all minor in comparison to the general insight that this image portrays. Bumping up.</td>', 'Usually the eyes are eagerly sought in a portrait, however, in this case the downward gaze with eye lids covering most of them, works so well simply because gaze supports the pensive general expression down to the slightly tightly pursed lips. Even a softer background would have been better to maintain attention on the facial feautures. While the lighting is not as dramatic as the expression, the overall effect meets the challenge well. These observations are all minor in comparison to the general insight that this image portrays. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 08:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177209, 145911, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is an image that quickly graduates into the artistic genre. While not a portrait, it is a very creative presentation with lighting that creates an immediate mood of darkness and mystery. A very good effort. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is an image that quickly graduates into the artistic genre. While not a portrait, it is a very creative presentation with lighting that creates an immediate mood of darkness and mystery. A very good effort. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 08:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177220, 144872, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image will attract the bell curve because it departs slightly from the intent of the portrait. My vote is on the higher end of the curve because the artistic presentation is appreciated. This image creates a dark sensation of something associated with the sinister. This communication aspect is one of the main goals of art. Bumping up.</td>', 'This image will attract the bell curve because it departs slightly from the intent of the portrait. My vote is on the higher end of the curve because the artistic presentation is appreciated. This image creates a dark sensation of something associated with the sinister. This communication aspect is one of the main goals of art. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177225, 146048, 22734, '<td valign="top">A mean special effect with great lighting. This is one of those efforts that meet the challenge and then rises above to deliver that extra surprise. Very well executed. Bumping up.</td>', 'A mean special effect with great lighting. This is one of those efforts that meet the challenge and then rises above to deliver that extra surprise. Very well executed. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 09:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177229, 146166, 22734, '<td valign="top">Wild and crazy and breaking happy smiles all over the voters lips. This is great because of the inflated cheeks. There is enough detail to qualify for the portrait aspect and the special effect is like the cherry on top. Bumping up.</td>', 'Wild and crazy and breaking happy smiles all over the voters lips. This is great because of the inflated cheeks. There is enough detail to qualify for the portrait aspect and the special effect is like the cherry on top. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 09:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177234, 145121, 22734, '<td valign="top">Indeed a work of art. The lighting, the face angle, the cloded eyes all add to maintain a deeper aspect of the human experience. Congratulations on this outstanding effort. Some may say that it is not quite a portrait, I disagree because althought it is not a conventional face image, it is a portrait of a feeling and this image transmits this information at once. Bumping up.</td>', 'Indeed a work of art. The lighting, the face angle, the cloded eyes all add to maintain a deeper aspect of the human experience. Congratulations on this outstanding effort. Some may say that it is not quite a portrait, I disagree because althought it is not a conventional face image, it is a portrait of a feeling and this image transmits this information at once. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 09:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177241, 145676, 20662, '<td valign="top">beautiful hair</td>', 'beautiful hair', '2005-02-17 09:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177242, 144919, 22734, '<td valign="top">Leaning slightly towards a graphical reprentation, this image transcends the medium because of the distinct features. While nothing is sharply spelled out, the look has great impact and a sense of intimacy. These type of image is not easy to create and obtain this superb effect. Bumping up.</td>', 'Leaning slightly towards a graphical reprentation, this image transcends the medium because of the distinct features. While nothing is sharply spelled out, the look has great impact and a sense of intimacy. These type of image is not easy to create and obtain this superb effect. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 09:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177252, 146517, 7190, '<td valign="top">This would have been a good shot if you just had moved to the right or left. and came in tighter. You are are overwhelmed by the head of the sphinx. Or maybe if there was more distance between you and the head but then you would have needed a set of wings or a rocket pack when you took off from its top.</td>', 'This would have been a good shot if you just had moved to the right or left. and came in tighter. You are are overwhelmed by the head of the sphinx. Or maybe if there was more distance between you and the head but then you would have needed a set of wings or a rocket pack when you took off from its top.', '2005-02-17 09:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177256, 145611, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very cool and complete effect which conjures mystery and drama off the gate. Very smart to allow the hair drape and support the great face angle. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very cool and complete effect which conjures mystery and drama off the gate. Very smart to allow the hair drape and support the great face angle. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 09:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
