(1177262, 146759, 22734, '<td valign="top">Indeed. The strenght of a portrait is in the eyes. Here the visual expression is enhanced by a well determined facial expression. The lighting is on the money and the framing is superb. Bumping up.</td>', 'Indeed. The strenght of a portrait is in the eyes. Here the visual expression is enhanced by a well determined facial expression. The lighting is on the money and the framing is superb. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 09:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
