(1177269, 145879, 22734, '<td valign="top">An outstanding effort with superior focus and great mood lighting. The facial expression grab the viewer at once and the steely blue eyes are like rivets coming at you. Bumping up.</td>', 'An outstanding effort with superior focus and great mood lighting. The facial expression grab the viewer at once and the steely blue eyes are like rivets coming at you. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 09:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
