(1177566, 146841, 19010, '<td valign="top">Hello pedro.  This shot was ver well done. I like the overall tone of the shot. I also like the seemingly natural and casual pose that you are in. It hides the fact that thi was a self portrait very well. I do feel however that the dark areas are a bit to dark. Your jeans and head fade a bit to harshly IMO into the background. The pole looks a little oversotend and there is a distracting white somthing on it beside your elbow. The only other thing I can see in this shot that I dont care for is that your left elbow was cut off. This shot was well done. Very crisp, well composed, and it has great composition. While I can''t say it''s a 10, I feel it earned every bit of a 8. Keep up the great work.</td>', 'Hello pedro.  This shot was ver well done. I like the overall tone of the shot. I also like the seemingly natural and casual pose that you are in. It hides the fact that thi was a self portrait very well. I do feel however that the dark areas are a bit to dark. Your jeans and head fade a bit to harshly IMO into the background. The pole looks a little oversotend and there is a distracting white somthing on it beside your elbow. The only other thing I can see in this shot that I dont care for is that your left elbow was cut off. This shot was well done. Very crisp, well composed, and it has great composition. While I can''t say it''s a 10, I feel it earned every bit of a 8. Keep up the great work.', '2005-02-17 13:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177578, 145599, 25143, '<td valign="top">the beautiful vibrant blue and snow patch draw the attention down , the image cropped to a square would draw the viewer towards the serious regard of the face ; I like the contrast of the tree bark patterns and the skin , and the elusiveness of the face</td>', 'the beautiful vibrant blue and snow patch draw the attention down , the image cropped to a square would draw the viewer towards the serious regard of the face ; I like the contrast of the tree bark patterns and the skin , and the elusiveness of the face', '2005-02-17 13:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
