(1177590, 145571, 4517, '<td valign="top">This is really good except for just one thing, the wristwatch. Might just be me but my eye keeps getting drawn to the chunky watch. Still a 9.</td>', 'This is really good except for just one thing, the wristwatch. Might just be me but my eye keeps getting drawn to the chunky watch. Still a 9.', '2005-02-17 13:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
