(1177845, 146825, 22734, '<td valign="top">Cool presentation with great flair and very well cpmposed as the subject appears as art director/photographer. The profile is great and the position of light meter and camera add to the dynamics specially with the lens cap swing. The blue frocks cements the contrast to the good skin tones. Bumping up.</td>', 'Cool presentation with great flair and very well cpmposed as the subject appears as art director/photographer. The profile is great and the position of light meter and camera add to the dynamics specially with the lens cap swing. The blue frocks cements the contrast to the good skin tones. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 15:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177855, 145948, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good character study with good tranquil feel.  The composition was well thought out and its only minor set back is that the focus point should have rested on the studious head. The wall, the full score and finger placement is all great. Bumping up on very good effort.</td>', 'A very good character study with good tranquil feel.  The composition was well thought out and its only minor set back is that the focus point should have rested on the studious head. The wall, the full score and finger placement is all great. Bumping up on very good effort.', '2005-02-17 15:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177858, 144824, 10080, '<td valign="top">Very nice and original! 8</td>', 'Very nice and original! 8', '2005-02-17 15:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177868, 146875, 22734, '<td valign="top">From the shells and up to the flower wreath along with the joyous facial expression this image begs admiration. The face angle and the eyes'' gaze jutting towards the left of the frame add an element of friendly tension which the great smile immediately dissolve. A very good effort with good color to boot. Bumping up.</td>', 'From the shells and up to the flower wreath along with the joyous facial expression this image begs admiration. The face angle and the eyes'' gaze jutting towards the left of the frame add an element of friendly tension which the great smile immediately dissolve. A very good effort with good color to boot. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 15:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177879, 146872, 22734, '<td valign="top">Good and honest character revelation. The facial expression and hand placement make the image endearing. The image has a searching look which we are all familiar. However, outside of the superb composition the lighting enhances the impact. A tiny minor flaw, but one easily forgiven in self portraits is the rendition of the left pupil. It lacks the crispness of the right. Yet, the image has enough substance to over ride this inequality. Bumping up to 7</td>', 'Good and honest character revelation. The facial expression and hand placement make the image endearing. The image has a searching look which we are all familiar. However, outside of the superb composition the lighting enhances the impact. A tiny minor flaw, but one easily forgiven in self portraits is the rendition of the left pupil. It lacks the crispness of the right. Yet, the image has enough substance to over ride this inequality. Bumping up to 7', '2005-02-17 15:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177885, 146394, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great idea, well executed.<br/> <br/>Besides that I have a kind of bet with Kiwiness for a plate of ''pannekoeken''. He said I couldn''t find him in this selfportrait challenge. Well, if I am wrong sorry, but I think this is you Gary. <br/></td>', 'Great idea, well executed. Besides that I have a kind of bet with Kiwiness for a plate of ''pannekoeken''. He said I couldn''t find him in this selfportrait challenge. Well, if I am wrong sorry, but I think this is you Gary. ', '2005-02-17 15:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177890, 146507, 3032, '<td valign="top">Fun photo. I like it how it is composed, there is no avoiding you. :)</td>', 'Fun photo. I like it how it is composed, there is no avoiding you. :)', '2005-02-17 15:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177893, 144824, 3032, '<td valign="top">I really like the mood of this photo. 10</td>', 'I really like the mood of this photo. 10', '2005-02-17 15:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177894, 146507, 4517, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, you must be mad.</td>', 'Cool photo, you must be mad.', '2005-02-17 15:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177899, 145611, 33836, '<td valign="top">wow, this is an awesome portait picture, NICE WORK!!</td>', 'wow, this is an awesome portait picture, NICE WORK!!', '2005-02-17 15:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177915, 146420, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great photo JJ.  You not ony framed yourself with the wooden frame and chickenwire but something tells me that the J shaped metal at the left isn''t accidental.</td>', 'Great photo JJ.  You not ony framed yourself with the wooden frame and chickenwire but something tells me that the J shaped metal at the left isn''t accidental.', '2005-02-17 15:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177919, 146521, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice image though i doubt that DPC is ready for it. It is more a graphical reprentation and these images do invite the famous bell curve.<br/> <br/>As a a graphical art study it is great because it chooses to lean on the understatement with a nice soothing tint. Of course, the beauty of the subject begs the conventional full tonal values to appreciate it even more.<br/> <br/>Well, I am a graphical artist and find this image very endearing, Bumping up to 7</td>', 'A very nice image though i doubt that DPC is ready for it. It is more a graphical reprentation and these images do invite the famous bell curve. As a a graphical art study it is great because it chooses to lean on the understatement with a nice soothing tint. Of course, the beauty of the subject begs the conventional full tonal values to appreciate it even more. Well, I am a graphical artist and find this image very endearing, Bumping up to 7', '2005-02-17 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177927, 146730, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I like the ''environmental'' aspect by including the safety rope and pack of shingles. Sometimes I work with those as well, but they are not that common in Holland. I really hate it when the paper is torn and the shingles scrape your neck.<br/>Working with natural slates is the most interesting imho.</td>', 'Great photo, I like the ''environmental'' aspect by including the safety rope and pack of shingles. Sometimes I work with those as well, but they are not that common in Holland. I really hate it when the paper is torn and the shingles scrape your neck.Working with natural slates is the most interesting imho.', '2005-02-17 15:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177933, 145799, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good portrait and very well framed. The tonal values are exceedingly good and one wishes the the tonal values would have also been applied to the frame to avoid the burn out areas. Outside of this the gaze and facial expression is just great along with the hand placement. Enough charm to receive another bump.</td>', 'A very good portrait and very well framed. The tonal values are exceedingly good and one wishes the the tonal values would have also been applied to the frame to avoid the burn out areas. Outside of this the gaze and facial expression is just great along with the hand placement. Enough charm to receive another bump.', '2005-02-17 15:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177945, 145726, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image create instant laughter that lingers. Every challenge contains a special gem and this is one of them. A great effect. bumping up to 7 for great funny rendition.</td>', 'This image create instant laughter that lingers. Every challenge contains a special gem and this is one of them. A great effect. bumping up to 7 for great funny rendition.', '2005-02-17 15:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177950, 144823, 22734, '<td valign="top">A great sense of humor and a very justifiable use of a fish eye. This image sparkles with wit. Bumping up.</td>', 'A great sense of humor and a very justifiable use of a fish eye. This image sparkles with wit. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 15:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1177960, 146426, 22734, '<td valign="top">This shot requires expert technique in holding the camera/sensor parallel to the frame. A very good and light hearted image which illicits a happy grin,. Bumping up.</td>', 'This shot requires expert technique in holding the camera/sensor parallel to the frame. A very good and light hearted image which illicits a happy grin,. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 15:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
