(1178024, 146647, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice image which will invite the bell curve because the face remains lost in darkness. The color and pose evokes a very sensual feel and the venetian blind adds flavor. A profile, even in silhoutte would have raised the value higher into the self portrait realm. However, I like the concept. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very nice image which will invite the bell curve because the face remains lost in darkness. The color and pose evokes a very sensual feel and the venetian blind adds flavor. A profile, even in silhoutte would have raised the value higher into the self portrait realm. However, I like the concept. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 16:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178032, 145335, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very good study which is bold and neat with exceptional good focus. The composition and framing are tops. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very good study which is bold and neat with exceptional good focus. The composition and framing are tops. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 16:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
