(1178691, 146577, 8624, '<td valign="top">you are as beautiful as your photos! I like the lighting here as it accentuates your strong cheekbones and jawline. Your lips and eyes look great, especially the catchlights. I''m not that crazy about the pose and the crop. Your shoulder seems to be sticking out a bit strangely but the way your are leaning into the frame does create a sense of intimacy. An excellent portrait overall, with the strenghs outweighing the few problems.</td>', 'you are as beautiful as your photos! I like the lighting here as it accentuates your strong cheekbones and jawline. Your lips and eyes look great, especially the catchlights. I''m not that crazy about the pose and the crop. Your shoulder seems to be sticking out a bit strangely but the way your are leaning into the frame does create a sense of intimacy. An excellent portrait overall, with the strenghs outweighing the few problems.', '2005-02-17 20:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178694, 145580, 32902, '<td valign="top">should have cropped a little more- a handsome guy though. . .</td>', 'should have cropped a little more- a handsome guy though. . .', '2005-02-17 20:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
