(1178841, 144919, 21072, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and effect!</td>', 'Nice lighting and effect!', '2005-02-17 22:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178863, 146350, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice study because of the great facial expression. The dark background works great and the intensity could have been lifted higher by a shift in the gama adjustment. However, the composition is good and this alone deserves a bump.</td>', 'A very nice study because of the great facial expression. The dark background works great and the intensity could have been lifted higher by a shift in the gama adjustment. However, the composition is good and this alone deserves a bump.', '2005-02-17 22:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178865, 145220, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hi, Mocabela (I assume). Nice pic ya got here. Looks like the tone is intentionally dark, but you did a good job holding the highlights. Given the title, I wish you were looking directly at the camera (looks like your eyes are focused a little above the lens).</td>', 'Hi, Mocabela (I assume). Nice pic ya got here. Looks like the tone is intentionally dark, but you did a good job holding the highlights. Given the title, I wish you were looking directly at the camera (looks like your eyes are focused a little above the lens).', '2005-02-17 22:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178867, 145799, 26756, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I like the whole concept of the frame.  The hands on both corners and the fram form a nice diagonal line.  Focus is sharp where it needs to be.  Some of the lighting is a bit harsh, but not in areas where it would really be a huge problem.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I like the whole concept of the frame.  The hands on both corners and the fram form a nice diagonal line.  Focus is sharp where it needs to be.  Some of the lighting is a bit harsh, but not in areas where it would really be a huge problem.', '2005-02-17 22:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178868, 146596, 22734, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes that reveal the deeper aspects of character. The low key effect works well because it places the emphasis on the white and the pupils. The dark tonal values accentuate the lips and lend a very pleasant contour to the nose. It is a lovely gaze. Bumping up.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes that reveal the deeper aspects of character. The low key effect works well because it places the emphasis on the white and the pupils. The dark tonal values accentuate the lips and lend a very pleasant contour to the nose. It is a lovely gaze. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 22:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178872, 145691, 26756, '<td valign="top">A very simple, straight-forward shot but well executed.  The lighting looks good in your hair and shirt, there aren''t any blown out highlights, focus is okay and composition is fine.  Not the most interesting of the challenge but technically fine.</td>', 'A very simple, straight-forward shot but well executed.  The lighting looks good in your hair and shirt, there aren''t any blown out highlights, focus is okay and composition is fine.  Not the most interesting of the challenge but technically fine.', '2005-02-17 22:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178879, 145677, 6130, '<td valign="top">Magnificent. 10+</td>', 'Magnificent. 10+', '2005-02-17 22:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178880, 146484, 26756, '<td valign="top">While the whole concept of the photo is great...the hat, suit, etc, what gives it that little extra is the hunched shoulder pose.  Very well done</td>', 'While the whole concept of the photo is great...the hat, suit, etc, what gives it that little extra is the hunched shoulder pose.  Very well done', '2005-02-17 22:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178881, 146585, 17203, '<td valign="top">A good sunset photo, but it doesn''t really strike me as a self-portrait (at least in the sense that this could be almost anybody).</td>', 'A good sunset photo, but it doesn''t really strike me as a self-portrait (at least in the sense that this could be almost anybody).', '2005-02-17 22:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178884, 146507, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is indeed one of the most dynamic images in this challenge. The sensation is of a man flying. Had you extended your arms it would have completed the effect, but yes, this was not the intent. That is just my flight of fancy. <br/> <br/>I am more than pleased with the effect and the image fits and exceeds the challenge. Funny, I thought I had a good image and have been humbled after looking at all these outstanding images. Bumping up another notch.</td>', 'This is indeed one of the most dynamic images in this challenge. The sensation is of a man flying. Had you extended your arms it would have completed the effect, but yes, this was not the intent. That is just my flight of fancy.  I am more than pleased with the effect and the image fits and exceeds the challenge. Funny, I thought I had a good image and have been humbled after looking at all these outstanding images. Bumping up another notch.', '2005-02-17 22:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178886, 145695, 22734, '<td valign="top">Good, strong and mysterious due to the ultra low key. Bumping up.</td>', 'Good, strong and mysterious due to the ultra low key. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 22:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178888, 146438, 22734, '<td valign="top">A lovely silhoutte executed with precision and very good taste. Bumping up.</td>', 'A lovely silhoutte executed with precision and very good taste. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 22:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178890, 146577, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hello Heida! Why so sad? With all your talent and so much admiration from others, you should have a permanent smile wrapped all the way around your head. Nice job burning that background, too. ;-)</td>', 'Hello Heida! Why so sad? With all your talent and so much admiration from others, you should have a permanent smile wrapped all the way around your head. Nice job burning that background, too. ;-)', '2005-02-17 22:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178892, 145219, 24674, '<td valign="top">Having one eye blacked out is not that nice and lends a pirate like air.</td>', 'Having one eye blacked out is not that nice and lends a pirate like air.', '2005-02-17 22:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178893, 146560, 22734, '<td valign="top">A great honest rendition which imparts the sense of superior strength as evidenced by the full bodied arms. The pleasant smile lends a quiet sense of friendliness. The pose, background and composition are exceedingly good. Bumping up.</td>', 'A great honest rendition which imparts the sense of superior strength as evidenced by the full bodied arms. The pleasant smile lends a quiet sense of friendliness. The pose, background and composition are exceedingly good. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 22:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178898, 146522, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very friendly soul pours out of this image. If I may dare a suggestion, whenever the hand is so employed it is advisable to tilt the head a tad to give the feeling that the head is resting on the hand. Otherwise, the image accomplishes the requirements of the challenge. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very friendly soul pours out of this image. If I may dare a suggestion, whenever the hand is so employed it is advisable to tilt the head a tad to give the feeling that the head is resting on the hand. Otherwise, the image accomplishes the requirements of the challenge. Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 22:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1178903, 144872, 17203, '<td valign="top">Uh... no thanks. I''m going to go play in traffic. I think it''s safer. ;-)</td>', 'Uh... no thanks. I''m going to go play in traffic. I think it''s safer. ;-)', '2005-02-17 22:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
