(1178918, 145653, 22734, '<td valign="top">Cool and mysretious in its low key habitat. The lighting adds that nocturnal feel and the gaze elevates the effect. Good! Bumping up.</td>', 'Cool and mysretious in its low key habitat. The lighting adds that nocturnal feel and the gaze elevates the effect. Good! Bumping up.', '2005-02-17 22:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
