(1178927, 146841, 22734, '<td valign="top">Cool and with that twinge of humor. the pose is great and the stare projects right at the viewer. This portrait conveys strength, strong character and untold determination. Bumping up another notch.</td>', 'Cool and with that twinge of humor. the pose is great and the stare projects right at the viewer. This portrait conveys strength, strong character and untold determination. Bumping up another notch.', '2005-02-17 22:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
