(1179030, 146815, 12253, '<td valign="top">There you be!  I was looking at all the thumbnails for you, and that''s why I couldn''t find it.  Very clever.  I like the contrasting red and black theme and of course the nice stop motion, multiple image shot.  I can imagine this would have also worked well with your image on some of those newton''s balls., but might have been hard to get it to stick and look natural.<br/> <br/>What this shot needs is some big heavy bold grain ;)<br/> <br/>Actually, I have a real challenge for you.  Capture this motion, but in a cats cradle, getting the shape of the string and several swings.  Hands/arms are ok.  I really think it would be awesome.<br/> <br/>But it''s a good shot and very clever, if I didn''t say that already.</td>', 'There you be!  I was looking at all the thumbnails for you, and that''s why I couldn''t find it.  Very clever.  I like the contrasting red and black theme and of course the nice stop motion, multiple image shot.  I can imagine this would have also worked well with your image on some of those newton''s balls., but might have been hard to get it to stick and look natural. What this shot needs is some big heavy bold grain ;) Actually, I have a real challenge for you.  Capture this motion, but in a cats cradle, getting the shape of the string and several swings.  Hands/arms are ok.  I really think it would be awesome. But it''s a good shot and very clever, if I didn''t say that already.', '2005-02-17 23:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179054, 146841, 17203, '<td valign="top">Too freakin'' funny! 8, maybe more. ;-)<br/>Okay, 9, but that''s my final offer. Maybe. One of my top 5 picks.</td>', 'Too freakin'' funny! 8, maybe more. ;-)Okay, 9, but that''s my final offer. Maybe. One of my top 5 picks.', '2005-02-18 00:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
