(1179116, 145335, 15811, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I''m not a huge fan of black and white -- or for highly exposed photographs, but this photograph works very well for me.  You clearly have the skills to set the shot up and the looks to be in the shot...one of my highest rated ... definately deserving of a ribbon.</td>', 'I really like this.  I''m not a huge fan of black and white -- or for highly exposed photographs, but this photograph works very well for me.  You clearly have the skills to set the shot up and the looks to be in the shot...one of my highest rated ... definately deserving of a ribbon.', '2005-02-18 01:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179117, 144823, 15811, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot and a great idea...very original.  I think it might suffer just a bit because it is out of focus (and no I don''t know how you could get sharper focus in a mirror like that) -- I''m not saying it''s a bad thing.<br/> <br/>One of my highest rated -- good work!</td>', 'very interesting shot and a great idea...very original.  I think it might suffer just a bit because it is out of focus (and no I don''t know how you could get sharper focus in a mirror like that) -- I''m not saying it''s a bad thing. One of my highest rated -- good work!', '2005-02-18 01:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179118, 145571, 15811, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  I love the sepia treatment.  You seem to have the lighting just perfect and you are a great model.  good work!</td>', 'Very interesting.  I love the sepia treatment.  You seem to have the lighting just perfect and you are a great model.  good work!', '2005-02-18 01:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
