(1179123, 146728, 15811, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  Not sure about its ''photographic integrity'' but it just really appeals to me.  It''s more art than photography and thus, I feel it probably won''t get the score it deserves as art usually appeals to a less wide array of viewers.  Very interesting and a great concept...i hope you do well!</td>', 'I like this a lot.  Not sure about its ''photographic integrity'' but it just really appeals to me.  It''s more art than photography and thus, I feel it probably won''t get the score it deserves as art usually appeals to a less wide array of viewers.  Very interesting and a great concept...i hope you do well!', '2005-02-18 01:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179126, 146647, 15811, '<td valign="top">Very good attempt.  I personally don''t like the lighting.  I realize images like this one have their place in some people''s minds, but it just isn''t really all that appealing to me, personally.</td>', 'Very good attempt.  I personally don''t like the lighting.  I realize images like this one have their place in some people''s minds, but it just isn''t really all that appealing to me, personally.', '2005-02-18 01:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
