(1179824, 146622, 29269, '<td valign="top">Is that you - those two people taking a picture? Then it is a loong shot. Although it will be scored down for not ''exactly'' meeting the challenge theme, I like this shot. I think that the part of the wall at the bottom was unnecessary and that it could have been cropped out.</td>', 'Is that you - those two people taking a picture? Then it is a loong shot. Although it will be scored down for not ''exactly'' meeting the challenge theme, I like this shot. I think that the part of the wall at the bottom was unnecessary and that it could have been cropped out.', '2005-02-18 10:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179858, 145611, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome eyes.  I hope you don´t take this the wrong way but when I viewed the thumbnail and before seeing the whole image in this size I immediately thought of Elijah Wood as Frodo.  I know the soft focus is intentional but it doesn´t really appeal to me though but everything else I like about this shot, good use of light.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Awesome eyes.  I hope you don´t take this the wrong way but when I viewed the thumbnail and before seeing the whole image in this size I immediately thought of Elijah Wood as Frodo.  I know the soft focus is intentional but it doesn´t really appeal to me though but everything else I like about this shot, good use of light.  Keep up the good work.', '2005-02-18 11:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179862, 146881, 27482, '<td valign="top">Funny idea, you just need some more creative lighting and this would be perfect, the lighting seems a bit flat and also could use a little contrast boost in photoshop.  Anyway, I like it and keep up the good work.</td>', 'Funny idea, you just need some more creative lighting and this would be perfect, the lighting seems a bit flat and also could use a little contrast boost in photoshop.  Anyway, I like it and keep up the good work.', '2005-02-18 11:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179868, 145799, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I like just about everything about it and especially the composition but the glare/overexposure of the frame itself I find very distracting and it drags it down a notch.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Good idea, I like just about everything about it and especially the composition but the glare/overexposure of the frame itself I find very distracting and it drags it down a notch.  Keep up the good work!', '2005-02-18 11:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1179871, 146166, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  Brilliant idea and very well executed, at least it made me smile.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Lol!  Brilliant idea and very well executed, at least it made me smile.  Keep up the good work.', '2005-02-18 11:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
