(1179907, 145842, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool shot.  I absolutely love the dark feel to it.  The strands of hair on the ground add alot of interest .  You seem to be about as camera shy as I am. :-)  This is a great way to take a SP and still show us something about yourself without exposing who you really are.</td>', 'This is a very cool shot.  I absolutely love the dark feel to it.  The strands of hair on the ground add alot of interest .  You seem to be about as camera shy as I am. :-)  This is a great way to take a SP and still show us something about yourself without exposing who you really are.', '2005-02-18 12:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
