(1179943, 145571, 27482, '<td valign="top">I think I know who you are... Graphicfunk?  I think I owe you a comment, you have commented on lot´s of my shots and always been helpful and honest and I appreciate it.<br/> <br/>Anyway, good shot, I love the tones in this image and usually I don´t like sepia but it works in this photo.  Unlike most shots in the challenge this actually tells me a litte bit aboutyourself, you made the portrait very personal and thats good.  The lighting is also very good.  All in all, a very good job so keep it up.</td>', 'I think I know who you are... Graphicfunk?  I think I owe you a comment, you have commented on lot´s of my shots and always been helpful and honest and I appreciate it. Anyway, good shot, I love the tones in this image and usually I don´t like sepia but it works in this photo.  Unlike most shots in the challenge this actually tells me a litte bit aboutyourself, you made the portrait very personal and thats good.  The lighting is also very good.  All in all, a very good job so keep it up.', '2005-02-18 12:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
