(1180193, 145571, 5286, '<td valign="top">Hi Dan! I found you.. Not that you are hiding :). I like the colors and the expression and composition are such that the face completely holds my attention. I really like that about this picture. Not sure what the title means, guess I''m missing a reference...</td>', 'Hi Dan! I found you.. Not that you are hiding :). I like the colors and the expression and composition are such that the face completely holds my attention. I really like that about this picture. Not sure what the title means, guess I''m missing a reference...', '2005-02-18 14:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
