(1180202, 146858, 5286, '<td valign="top">You''re very pretty :).. The picture is very well done. I really like the tones and the choice of black and white is a very good one, I think.</td>', 'You''re very pretty :).. The picture is very well done. I really like the tones and the choice of black and white is a very good one, I think.', '2005-02-18 14:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
