(1180219, 146215, 8005, '<td valign="top">The first thing I noticed is that it looks like you are wearing pink makeup. The colors don''t seem natural. 5</td>', 'The first thing I noticed is that it looks like you are wearing pink makeup. The colors don''t seem natural. 5', '2005-02-18 14:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
