(1180413, 145659, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very unusual.  This photo breaks most of the rules, but I like it for the expression and the fact that the mount and eye are what we see.</td>', 'Very unusual.  This photo breaks most of the rules, but I like it for the expression and the fact that the mount and eye are what we see.', '2005-02-18 16:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180417, 146507, 32570, '<td valign="top">My only complaint is that you could use a better title.  This photo is magnificent!</td>', 'My only complaint is that you could use a better title.  This photo is magnificent!', '2005-02-18 16:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180425, 146859, 32570, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea!  I really like this!</td>', 'Very nice idea!  I really like this!', '2005-02-18 16:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180426, 146513, 19503, '<td valign="top">Really like the soft and inviting light you used here Ruedi. The texture of the fabric looks smooth and soft, as you would like to touch it.. Also have the mood of the movie you''re refferring to. Awesome! :)</td>', 'Really like the soft and inviting light you used here Ruedi. The texture of the fabric looks smooth and soft, as you would like to touch it.. Also have the mood of the movie you''re refferring to. Awesome! :)', '2005-02-18 16:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180429, 146637, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s crazy.   I don''t know why I like this photo.  Maybe it''s because the lighting is right out of a product commercial : it''s cold, its uniform, it''s unrelenting.  Nobody every uses this for portraiture.  The guy behind the computer should be a tall skinny guy with thick black hair wearing a pinstriped suit.  And if you close your eyes there he is.</td>', 'It''s crazy.   I don''t know why I like this photo.  Maybe it''s because the lighting is right out of a product commercial : it''s cold, its uniform, it''s unrelenting.  Nobody every uses this for portraiture.  The guy behind the computer should be a tall skinny guy with thick black hair wearing a pinstriped suit.  And if you close your eyes there he is.', '2005-02-18 16:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180430, 145799, 27375, '<td valign="top">Hey, who is this sexy guy? :P<br/>Nice composition with the frame tilted and catchlights.</td>', 'Hey, who is this sexy guy? :PNice composition with the frame tilted and catchlights.', '2005-02-18 16:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180432, 146162, 31865, '<td valign="top">I''m going crazy on how to vote this one.  It''s a beautiful photo, and I get the idea behind it: you are your art.  But I can''t help but wish there was a reflection of you in the drop of water.  Still, it''s great, and I love the abstract thinking...<br/> <br/>ok, ok.. 8</td>', 'I''m going crazy on how to vote this one.  It''s a beautiful photo, and I get the idea behind it: you are your art.  But I can''t help but wish there was a reflection of you in the drop of water.  Still, it''s great, and I love the abstract thinking... ok, ok.. 8', '2005-02-18 16:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180440, 146370, 33560, '<td valign="top">Good expression.  Strong Lighting</td>', 'Good expression.  Strong Lighting', '2005-02-18 16:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180441, 146652, 33560, '<td valign="top">Ooops, forgot the numbers.</td>', 'Ooops, forgot the numbers.', '2005-02-18 16:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180457, 146418, 33560, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I saw little here that distinguished it from a snap shot.  I can see you used lots of lights: one or two for the background, and a strong one (or two)overhead. And these certainly distinguish it from a snapshot.  Nevertheless they produce a snapshot quality.   I find the curtains distracting.  And the purple sweater makes no sense to me - the rest of the photo makes me expect a sepia.  Also it looks blurry, as if the focus was on the curtains instead of the subject.</td>', 'Sorry, I saw little here that distinguished it from a snap shot.  I can see you used lots of lights: one or two for the background, and a strong one (or two)overhead. And these certainly distinguish it from a snapshot.  Nevertheless they produce a snapshot quality.   I find the curtains distracting.  And the purple sweater makes no sense to me - the rest of the photo makes me expect a sepia.  Also it looks blurry, as if the focus was on the curtains instead of the subject.', '2005-02-18 16:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180460, 146532, 33560, '<td valign="top">The large photo is much better than the postage stamp promises. The lighting and background are inspired.</td>', 'The large photo is much better than the postage stamp promises. The lighting and background are inspired.', '2005-02-18 16:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180466, 146836, 33560, '<td valign="top">Super concept.  Good realization.  My gut reaction to the picture is "I hate it."  But the humorous content is worth two points.</td>', 'Super concept.  Good realization.  My gut reaction to the picture is "I hate it."  But the humorous content is worth two points.', '2005-02-18 16:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180468, 146372, 33560, '<td valign="top">But the photo really wasn''t lit with this flame.  And I wish it were.</td>', 'But the photo really wasn''t lit with this flame.  And I wish it were.', '2005-02-18 16:38:22.000000', NULL, 1);
