(1180490, 145897, 33560, '<td valign="top">One if by land, two if by sea.  But where''s the horse? I like the light and rich color it produces.  The face is dramatically lit and the expression clear. The checked shirt provide us little hints of where the rest of the subject is.</td>', 'One if by land, two if by sea.  But where''s the horse? I like the light and rich color it produces.  The face is dramatically lit and the expression clear. The checked shirt provide us little hints of where the rest of the subject is.', '2005-02-18 16:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
