(1180511, 146036, 33560, '<td valign="top">Look through a bottle of my favorite beer and you''ll see I am a conehead?  It''s a very interesting way to construct the photograph.  Twice there but not there.  It''s pretty, clever, superbly photographed.  But it leaves me cold.</td>', 'Look through a bottle of my favorite beer and you''ll see I am a conehead?  It''s a very interesting way to construct the photograph.  Twice there but not there.  It''s pretty, clever, superbly photographed.  But it leaves me cold.', '2005-02-18 16:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
