(1180590, 146450, 31403, '<td valign="top">Everytime I see this I bump it up again.  Now we''re at the top.  I love the joy your image evokes.  So you''re hitting my "my youngest is 9 and the rest are teenagers, boy I miss babies" chord pretty good.<br/> <br/>The framing of the baby is great, enough to tell the story, while keeping you as the main subject.  I love it.  Very well done.</td>', 'Everytime I see this I bump it up again.  Now we''re at the top.  I love the joy your image evokes.  So you''re hitting my "my youngest is 9 and the rest are teenagers, boy I miss babies" chord pretty good. The framing of the baby is great, enough to tell the story, while keeping you as the main subject.  I love it.  Very well done.', '2005-02-18 17:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180606, 146521, 33560, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  I don''t know what the metal thing is, but it gives the impression of a barrier, which is consistent with the expression.</td>', 'I really like this.  I don''t know what the metal thing is, but it gives the impression of a barrier, which is consistent with the expression.', '2005-02-18 17:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180617, 144823, 33560, '<td valign="top">My initial reaction to this photo was very negative.  But I find it clever technically and conceptually.  And when I veiw it in context of what it is communicating, I find my opinion of it has improved markedly.</td>', 'My initial reaction to this photo was very negative.  But I find it clever technically and conceptually.  And when I veiw it in context of what it is communicating, I find my opinion of it has improved markedly.', '2005-02-18 17:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180630, 145947, 33560, '<td valign="top">I guess shooting things through fluid-filled glass containers is the technique du jour.  Think it works here better than the beer bottle, though I cannot say why. But I wonder whether we might be  drawing near the end of the days where everything looks better through a beverage glass or bottle. I think I''ve gotten there.</td>', 'I guess shooting things through fluid-filled glass containers is the technique du jour.  Think it works here better than the beer bottle, though I cannot say why. But I wonder whether we might be  drawing near the end of the days where everything looks better through a beverage glass or bottle. I think I''ve gotten there.', '2005-02-18 17:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180632, 146461, 25655, '<td valign="top">Funny and flattering portrait IMO.<br/>I love the tones and the lights. I just wish your eyes had been a bit more in focus.<br/></td>', 'Funny and flattering portrait IMO.I love the tones and the lights. I just wish your eyes had been a bit more in focus.', '2005-02-18 17:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
