(1180645, 146730, 33560, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail of this looked hopeless.  The bigger photo looks ridiculous, but in a sly, humorous way. I wonder if we''d have gotten it that they were asphalt shingles if they had been cropped?</td>', 'The thumbnail of this looked hopeless.  The bigger photo looks ridiculous, but in a sly, humorous way. I wonder if we''d have gotten it that they were asphalt shingles if they had been cropped?', '2005-02-18 17:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180650, 145678, 25655, '<td valign="top">I love the lights and shadows.<br/>Just one little thing that bothers me a bit: your left eye (my right) looks a bit too bright in the shadows, which make it look quite spooky, like it''s a glass or something. Other then that a good portrait.</td>', 'I love the lights and shadows.Just one little thing that bothers me a bit: your left eye (my right) looks a bit too bright in the shadows, which make it look quite spooky, like it''s a glass or something. Other then that a good portrait.', '2005-02-18 17:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
