(1180665, 146370, 25655, '<td valign="top">Did anyone ever tell you you look a little bit like Ewan McGregor?<br/>Great portrait and good lighting.<br/>i wish your lips had been a bit darker though. You look a bit ill...<br/>Nice work!</td>', 'Did anyone ever tell you you look a little bit like Ewan McGregor?Great portrait and good lighting.i wish your lips had been a bit darker though. You look a bit ill...Nice work!', '2005-02-18 17:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
