(1180705, 145220, 33560, '<td valign="top">So distracted by the fact that I saw the same face, same expression, same pose, same lighting in the Pain competition just days ago...  It''s nicely lit, exposed and photographed.  And though I know it'' s not the same because the macara is not smudged in this one, the similarity is too strikiing to ignore.  So what?  Well every photo has its novelty factor; every trick wows less the second time around.</td>', 'So distracted by the fact that I saw the same face, same expression, same pose, same lighting in the Pain competition just days ago...  It''s nicely lit, exposed and photographed.  And though I know it'' s not the same because the macara is not smudged in this one, the similarity is too strikiing to ignore.  So what?  Well every photo has its novelty factor; every trick wows less the second time around.', '2005-02-18 18:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
