(1180729, 145988, 280, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit of a cop out for a self-portrait, but I think I''m just jealous I didn''t think of covering my ugly mug this way! The only thing that I think distracts from this photo is the uneven background, other than that a great shot and I love the pose. 9</td>', 'Seems a bit of a cop out for a self-portrait, but I think I''m just jealous I didn''t think of covering my ugly mug this way! The only thing that I think distracts from this photo is the uneven background, other than that a great shot and I love the pose. 9', '2005-02-18 18:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
