(1180994, 146196, 26756, '<td valign="top">Striking eyes, beautiful colors and beautiful light around your hair.  I like the shadows on the face as well.  WIth the top part so dark the photo almost looks cropped, maybe a touch of light up there would be nice, but this is a very nice self portrait.</td>', 'Striking eyes, beautiful colors and beautiful light around your hair.  I like the shadows on the face as well.  WIth the top part so dark the photo almost looks cropped, maybe a touch of light up there would be nice, but this is a very nice self portrait.', '2005-02-18 19:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1180997, 146876, 26756, '<td valign="top">I like the pose a lot, and also the sepia tone.  Works well in this photo. Nice detail and focus.</td>', 'I like the pose a lot, and also the sepia tone.  Works well in this photo. Nice detail and focus.', '2005-02-18 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181001, 145842, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image to try to figure out what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>if the art of portraiture is to capture the essence of the individual, i would have to believe that you have succeeded.  otherwise, i guess you would have called this, "I Wish".  so, what have you done to tell me who you are?  you are at peace with yourself, revealing only what you want, but hiding in a way that doesn''t say you''re hiding.  while you come across as a non-conformist, you subtly like to control every variable in a situation.  you also seem to enjoy chaos, but being ever mindful to make sure that there is always a point of order to fall back on (or at least a safe starting point).  i really believe this is exactly the image you wanted it to be.  thanks for sharing.  9 from me.</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image to try to figure out what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. if the art of portraiture is to capture the essence of the individual, i would have to believe that you have succeeded.  otherwise, i guess you would have called this, "I Wish".  so, what have you done to tell me who you are?  you are at peace with yourself, revealing only what you want, but hiding in a way that doesn''t say you''re hiding.  while you come across as a non-conformist, you subtly like to control every variable in a situation.  you also seem to enjoy chaos, but being ever mindful to make sure that there is always a point of order to fall back on (or at least a safe starting point).  i really believe this is exactly the image you wanted it to be.  thanks for sharing.  9 from me.', '2005-02-18 19:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181004, 145947, 26756, '<td valign="top">Very, very unique.  I like the effect quite a bit.  Great light on the glass and very, very crisp.</td>', 'Very, very unique.  I like the effect quite a bit.  Great light on the glass and very, very crisp.', '2005-02-18 19:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181008, 145121, 26756, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, it''s very different and produced a cool effect.  If the light could have been a bit more even across the whole photo, I think I would have liked it a bit more but a great effort.</td>', 'I like the idea, it''s very different and produced a cool effect.  If the light could have been a bit more even across the whole photo, I think I would have liked it a bit more but a great effort.', '2005-02-18 19:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181014, 146302, 26756, '<td valign="top">I very much like the blue hood, especially the lines on the left part.  The crop works for me too.  The light, imo, is a bit too hot and doesn''t add too much to the beauty of the photo.  Love the blue eyes too.</td>', 'I very much like the blue hood, especially the lines on the left part.  The crop works for me too.  The light, imo, is a bit too hot and doesn''t add too much to the beauty of the photo.  Love the blue eyes too.', '2005-02-18 19:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181021, 146596, 23394, '<td valign="top">[ok, i''m really sorry about this, but i''m having a hard time scoring your image.  the thumbnail looks great, and if i don''t look too closely at the full image, i like what i see.  BUT, on close inspection, i am finding areas of blurs right next to areas that are very sharp, particularly around your lips, your eyebrows, and your right cheek.  i have a 21" monitor with high resolution, and i have to believe what i''m seeing is in the image.  as much as i would like to offer more, the highest i can score this as i''m seeing it is a 5.  it''s a shame, because it does look like you put a solid effort into this.]</td>', '[ok, i''m really sorry about this, but i''m having a hard time scoring your image.  the thumbnail looks great, and if i don''t look too closely at the full image, i like what i see.  BUT, on close inspection, i am finding areas of blurs right next to areas that are very sharp, particularly around your lips, your eyebrows, and your right cheek.  i have a 21" monitor with high resolution, and i have to believe what i''m seeing is in the image.  as much as i would like to offer more, the highest i can score this as i''m seeing it is a 5.  it''s a shame, because it does look like you put a solid effort into this.]', '2005-02-18 19:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
