(1181147, 145438, 6600, '<td valign="top">Is your dad John Edward (of ''Crossing Over'' fame, do a google search, you''ll see what I mean).  Rather festive lighting in the background (some may think it distracting), photo well exposed and composed.  Good job!</td>', 'Is your dad John Edward (of ''Crossing Over'' fame, do a google search, you''ll see what I mean).  Rather festive lighting in the background (some may think it distracting), photo well exposed and composed.  Good job!', '2005-02-18 21:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181150, 146842, 11769, '<td valign="top">Eerie surreal and very creative. Like a lot. I will say it is not a photo to do well in these Challenges but it has an artistic quality and emotional impact that  sets it apart. Good work.</td>', 'Eerie surreal and very creative. Like a lot. I will say it is not a photo to do well in these Challenges but it has an artistic quality and emotional impact that  sets it apart. Good work.', '2005-02-18 21:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181164, 146461, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I love the idea &amp; title, and I love the wild crop at the top.  It would be easy to underestimate this image because of the light-hearted approach, but it is also a really good photograph.  You must know your model pretty well.  7.<br/>Back for second opinion ... what was I thinking?  This is better than 7.  It''s the most joie-de-vivre portrait in the challenge.  Bump right up to 9.</td>', 'This is great.  I love the idea & title, and I love the wild crop at the top.  It would be easy to underestimate this image because of the light-hearted approach, but it is also a really good photograph.  You must know your model pretty well.  7.Back for second opinion ... what was I thinking?  This is better than 7.  It''s the most joie-de-vivre portrait in the challenge.  Bump right up to 9.', '2005-02-18 21:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181177, 146425, 30625, '<td valign="top">Compsition: 10 I like how you gave the extra space<br/>Techinical: 7 good use of light I just didnt like the pink or reddish lipstick maybe a more subtle color I think would have made me like it more<br/>Challenge: 10<br/>Appeal: 10<br/>Overall: 9<br/></td>', 'Compsition: 10 I like how you gave the extra spaceTechinical: 7 good use of light I just didnt like the pink or reddish lipstick maybe a more subtle color I think would have made me like it moreChallenge: 10Appeal: 10Overall: 9', '2005-02-18 21:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181185, 146814, 30625, '<td valign="top">Composition: 9 I didnt like the extra space I think portrait would have got you a 10<br/>Technical: 10 good DOF and use of light<br/>Title: 10 I take it your irish.....a paddy<br/>Challenge: 10<br/>Appeal: 8 Nice shot just not giving me the wow <br/>Overall: 9</td>', 'Composition: 9 I didnt like the extra space I think portrait would have got you a 10Technical: 10 good DOF and use of lightTitle: 10 I take it your irish.....a paddyChallenge: 10Appeal: 8 Nice shot just not giving me the wow Overall: 9', '2005-02-18 21:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181190, 146864, 30625, '<td valign="top">Composition: 10 great composition<br/>Technical: 10  good use of light and worked very well in B&amp;W<br/>Title: 10 Yes seductive and beautiful<br/>Challenge: 10<br/>Appeal: 10 I would frame it<br/>Overall: 10</td>', 'Composition: 10 great compositionTechnical: 10  good use of light and worked very well in B&WTitle: 10 Yes seductive and beautifulChallenge: 10Appeal: 10 I would frame itOverall: 10', '2005-02-18 21:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181191, 144824, 30625, '<td valign="top">Interesting very interesting. Gives me a unique felling of vampire. I like it.</td>', 'Interesting very interesting. Gives me a unique felling of vampire. I like it.', '2005-02-18 21:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181199, 146162, 30364, '<td valign="top">Bear?  I don''t recognise the profile, but the title looks like you.  Anyway, Bear or not, I''m giving this a 7 for lateral thinking &amp; for a finely-judged DOF.</td>', 'Bear?  I don''t recognise the profile, but the title looks like you.  Anyway, Bear or not, I''m giving this a 7 for lateral thinking & for a finely-judged DOF.', '2005-02-18 21:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
