(1181292, 146420, 7810, '<td valign="top">this is my kind of portrait ...my fav  for the challenge ...love the textures  great shot</td>', 'this is my kind of portrait ...my fav  for the challenge ...love the textures  great shot', '2005-02-18 22:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181293, 145395, 7810, '<td valign="top">reminds me of my" windows to the soul " shot  ...nice portrait</td>', 'reminds me of my" windows to the soul " shot  ...nice portrait', '2005-02-18 22:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181294, 146450, 7810, '<td valign="top">lovely image ...love the sepia tones</td>', 'lovely image ...love the sepia tones', '2005-02-18 22:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181391, 144943, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a very relaxed and casual approach. A frame within a frame always has merit specially when the inner is not a mere mimick. The texture of the jacket and the wood shed are appealing because of the color harmony which helps the skin tones.The overall focus is good and the body position along with facial expression and hands impart that rustic feel. Of course, while the face is clear we all want closer, but that would be a trade off for the peaceful state that is currently portrayed. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is a very relaxed and casual approach. A frame within a frame always has merit specially when the inner is not a mere mimick. The texture of the jacket and the wood shed are appealing because of the color harmony which helps the skin tones.The overall focus is good and the body position along with facial expression and hands impart that rustic feel. Of course, while the face is clear we all want closer, but that would be a trade off for the peaceful state that is currently portrayed. Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 00:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181406, 145283, 22734, '<td valign="top">Persinally I prefer a level image. Outside of this, I am unable to identify the contents but the portrait itself is very well lit and the focus is right on. The artistic effect gives the feeling of a record album cover. The half moon lighting gives the image a special feel like that of some mystery. Bumping up on artistic merit and clarity of image.</td>', 'Persinally I prefer a level image. Outside of this, I am unable to identify the contents but the portrait itself is very well lit and the focus is right on. The artistic effect gives the feeling of a record album cover. The half moon lighting gives the image a special feel like that of some mystery. Bumping up on artistic merit and clarity of image.', '2005-02-19 00:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181407, 145156, 22734, '<td valign="top">A great study arising out of the darkness. The profile works well with closed eyes and the lighting has achieved the desired effect bacuse it brings out the form to perfection. Bumping up.</td>', 'A great study arising out of the darkness. The profile works well with closed eyes and the lighting has achieved the desired effect bacuse it brings out the form to perfection. Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 00:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181408, 146395, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great! Would have loved the camera angle just a tad lower to allow the rim of the glasses to clear the eyes. The composition is good and so is the focus. In one word: charming. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great! Would have loved the camera angle just a tad lower to allow the rim of the glasses to clear the eyes. The composition is good and so is the focus. In one word: charming. Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 00:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181413, 145618, 22734, '<td valign="top">A charming face framed by lovely hair. Perhaps a bit too soft but then the framing is superb and so is the background. Bumping up.</td>', 'A charming face framed by lovely hair. Perhaps a bit too soft but then the framing is superb and so is the background. Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 00:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181440, 144824, 30669, '<td valign="top">A GREAT shot</td>', 'A GREAT shot', '2005-02-19 01:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181442, 146516, 30669, '<td valign="top">This is terrific!!!!!!!! Love the lighting,setting, and title.</td>', 'This is terrific!!!!!!!! Love the lighting,setting, and title.', '2005-02-19 01:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181444, 145726, 30669, '<td valign="top">A most interesting and funny photo. Well done!</td>', 'A most interesting and funny photo. Well done!', '2005-02-19 01:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181450, 146882, 30669, '<td valign="top">A most interesting and clever photo. Well done ! One of my favorites.</td>', 'A most interesting and clever photo. Well done ! One of my favorites.', '2005-02-19 01:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181452, 146420, 28695, '<td valign="top">A stunning picture.  I keep coming back to it.  Great detail and contrast.</td>', 'A stunning picture.  I keep coming back to it.  Great detail and contrast.', '2005-02-19 01:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181453, 146420, 30669, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite shot. If I could vote it would be a 10.</td>', 'This is my favorite shot. If I could vote it would be a 10.', '2005-02-19 01:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181460, 146046, 30669, '<td valign="top">Great shot</td>', 'Great shot', '2005-02-19 01:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181461, 146859, 22734, '<td valign="top">Certainly cute and filled with levity. This concept is so nice that i would have explored more variations to bring the couch even closer and perhaps absent the floor cover on the left. However, I am nevertheless pleased with this image. Bumping up.</td>', 'Certainly cute and filled with levity. This concept is so nice that i would have explored more variations to bring the couch even closer and perhaps absent the floor cover on the left. However, I am nevertheless pleased with this image. Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 01:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181468, 146461, 33640, '<td valign="top">Probably one of the best self-portraits I''ve seen so far. Nice composition, tones are perfect, and I love how the limited depth of field puts all but the bubble and left side of your face out of focus. It''s a very cute concept, as well. Your eyes and expression convey the message very nicely, making the title believable.<br/>Wonderful work.</td>', 'Probably one of the best self-portraits I''ve seen so far. Nice composition, tones are perfect, and I love how the limited depth of field puts all but the bubble and left side of your face out of focus. It''s a very cute concept, as well. Your eyes and expression convey the message very nicely, making the title believable.Wonderful work.', '2005-02-19 01:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181476, 146450, 30364, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait, composed and photographed with restraint.  I love the way you just sneaked in enough of the reason for your happiness to tell us the story, but not enough to steal our attention away from the subject (you are the taller one, right?).  7</td>', 'A beautiful portrait, composed and photographed with restraint.  I love the way you just sneaked in enough of the reason for your happiness to tell us the story, but not enough to steal our attention away from the subject (you are the taller one, right?).  7', '2005-02-19 01:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181480, 146819, 30364, '<td valign="top">Bill Gates, yes?  Well, even if you''re not, this is a very instructive portrait.  First because the crop gives it an intimacy that it would not have if your whole head was in the shot.  And second because of the effective use of limited depth of field.  Great all-round photographic skills, employed with subtlety and confidence.  8.</td>', 'Bill Gates, yes?  Well, even if you''re not, this is a very instructive portrait.  First because the crop gives it an intimacy that it would not have if your whole head was in the shot.  And second because of the effective use of limited depth of field.  Great all-round photographic skills, employed with subtlety and confidence.  8.', '2005-02-19 01:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181487, 146461, 31214, '<td valign="top">Bump for the freckles</td>', 'Bump for the freckles', '2005-02-19 02:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181502, 146543, 23478, '<td valign="top">Very creative!</td>', 'Very creative!', '2005-02-19 02:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181504, 146846, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, it may have been nice to crop it a bit tighter:)</td>', 'Nice shot, it may have been nice to crop it a bit tighter:)', '2005-02-19 02:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181506, 145836, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting!</td>', 'Excellent lighting!', '2005-02-19 03:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181511, 146868, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and creative idea adding an extra element.</td>', 'Nice shot and creative idea adding an extra element.', '2005-02-19 03:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181512, 146535, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great photo!</td>', 'Great photo!', '2005-02-19 03:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181513, 145799, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and good lighting.</td>', 'Excellent idea and good lighting.', '2005-02-19 03:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181515, 146484, 23478, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I like the subtle shadows.</td>', 'Good shot, I like the subtle shadows.', '2005-02-19 03:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181517, 146713, 23478, '<td valign="top">Creative take.</td>', 'Creative take.', '2005-02-19 03:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181520, 145440, 23478, '<td valign="top">Wow, cool photo, the lighting and contrast work well.</td>', 'Wow, cool photo, the lighting and contrast work well.', '2005-02-19 03:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181523, 146532, 23478, '<td valign="top">What a great smile!  Good photo.</td>', 'What a great smile!  Good photo.', '2005-02-19 03:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181536, 145690, 23478, '<td valign="top">This made me smile:)  Nice shot.</td>', 'This made me smile:)  Nice shot.', '2005-02-19 03:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181539, 145552, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2005-02-19 03:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181625, 145836, 22689, '<td valign="top">Very "clean" , no distractive elements . Really nice !</td>', 'Very "clean" , no distractive elements . Really nice !', '2005-02-19 06:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181626, 146459, 22689, '<td valign="top">Funny ! Excellent composition.</td>', 'Funny ! Excellent composition.', '2005-02-19 06:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181627, 146592, 3724, '<td valign="top">A striking profile,  in repose - but not resting..  Appears an awkward position,  but composition really works.  Beautiful simplicity.</td>', 'A striking profile,  in repose - but not resting..  Appears an awkward position,  but composition really works.  Beautiful simplicity.', '2005-02-19 06:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181628, 146438, 27847, '<td valign="top">Flash, hmmmm. So your too quick for the camera but you shadow is not? Ha ha ... interesting self-portrait.</td>', 'Flash, hmmmm. So your too quick for the camera but you shadow is not? Ha ha ... interesting self-portrait.', '2005-02-19 06:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181629, 146855, 27847, '<td valign="top">Good clean, sharp photo however the background is a bit distracting. Especially that red thing above your head, posing in front of something more uniformed would have helped and or using a very shallow DOF.</td>', 'Good clean, sharp photo however the background is a bit distracting. Especially that red thing above your head, posing in front of something more uniformed would have helped and or using a very shallow DOF.', '2005-02-19 06:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181630, 146247, 27847, '<td valign="top">Great choice of background, in this case it works for the photo instead of takes away from it because it''s not too distracting. I do find it a little soft and/or something... still good work.</td>', 'Great choice of background, in this case it works for the photo instead of takes away from it because it''s not too distracting. I do find it a little soft and/or something... still good work.', '2005-02-19 06:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181631, 146395, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very nice work! Photo is very sharp with enough light but not over exposed and over all a interesting photo. The shadows of the glasses take away from drawing the view to your eyes, but guess you sometimes can''t control the sun. Superb self-portrait!</td>', 'Very nice work! Photo is very sharp with enough light but not over exposed and over all a interesting photo. The shadows of the glasses take away from drawing the view to your eyes, but guess you sometimes can''t control the sun. Superb self-portrait!', '2005-02-19 06:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181632, 146349, 27847, '<td valign="top">So, youre a hat maker during the night and a photographer during the day? ha ha. Superb photo very sharp and nice neutral background so it doesn''t take away from you. One thing that I wish was not there is the light reflection in the right eye, since the eye is in the shadows that light reflection really become noticeable. Still, excellent photo!</td>', 'So, youre a hat maker during the night and a photographer during the day? ha ha. Superb photo very sharp and nice neutral background so it doesn''t take away from you. One thing that I wish was not there is the light reflection in the right eye, since the eye is in the shadows that light reflection really become noticeable. Still, excellent photo!', '2005-02-19 06:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181633, 145599, 22689, '<td valign="top">Hard to see you well...</td>', 'Hard to see you well...', '2005-02-19 06:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181634, 146602, 22689, '<td valign="top">Of course !<br/>Very sweet tones !</td>', 'Of course !Very sweet tones !', '2005-02-19 06:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181637, 145911, 22689, '<td valign="top">Like a sculpture of the great Michelangelo !</td>', 'Like a sculpture of the great Michelangelo !', '2005-02-19 07:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181639, 146483, 27847, '<td valign="top">OK now, this is not Halloween where you dress up and put on different faces! ha ha Those are some nicely done nails for a guy, and slim and very feminine. Hey look that''s not the same person holding up his face. OK, yes I''m finished. Interesting take on the self-portrait.</td>', 'OK now, this is not Halloween where you dress up and put on different faces! ha ha Those are some nicely done nails for a guy, and slim and very feminine. Hey look that''s not the same person holding up his face. OK, yes I''m finished. Interesting take on the self-portrait.', '2005-02-19 07:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181640, 145727, 27847, '<td valign="top">Now it would be official if you had the slobber running down the keyboard, yes that would not have been appealing but that''s how I usually find myself. haha Nice Shot.</td>', 'Now it would be official if you had the slobber running down the keyboard, yes that would not have been appealing but that''s how I usually find myself. haha Nice Shot.', '2005-02-19 07:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181641, 146415, 27847, '<td valign="top">That''s a big tripod for such a little guy, ha ha just kidding. I think it''s time to lighten up that backpack. Excellent photo.</td>', 'That''s a big tripod for such a little guy, ha ha just kidding. I think it''s time to lighten up that backpack. Excellent photo.', '2005-02-19 07:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181643, 146254, 27847, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites with excellent use of the black space. It really draws the viewer to you and your ''minds eye'' (well to your face). If your right hand could have been moved a little up as not to interfer with the face that really would have been excellet self-portriat. Superb work.</td>', 'One of my favorites with excellent use of the black space. It really draws the viewer to you and your ''minds eye'' (well to your face). If your right hand could have been moved a little up as not to interfer with the face that really would have been excellet self-portriat. Superb work.', '2005-02-19 07:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181662, 146571, 1128, '<td valign="top">your eye looks cool, and I''m glad the line down your face is fuzzy</td>', 'your eye looks cool, and I''m glad the line down your face is fuzzy', '2005-02-19 07:43:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1181663, 145976, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea.  I wish you''d chosen a different colored background because your shirt and the wine blend into it.  I like your hands in this shot, and you have a very friendly look on your face.</td>', 'This is a good idea.  I wish you''d chosen a different colored background because your shirt and the wine blend into it.  I like your hands in this shot, and you have a very friendly look on your face.', '2005-02-19 07:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181664, 145879, 16241, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2005-02-19 07:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181665, 146507, 16241, '<td valign="top">good one!</td>', 'good one!', '2005-02-19 07:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181668, 146768, 1128, '<td valign="top">I like the tones of this shot, and the amount of your face that you chose to show. On my computer, I''m detect signs of oversharpening-- particularly on your arm and right cheek.</td>', 'I like the tones of this shot, and the amount of your face that you chose to show. On my computer, I''m detect signs of oversharpening-- particularly on your arm and right cheek.', '2005-02-19 07:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181671, 145618, 1128, '<td valign="top">Cute title, and your skin looks so flawless!  I like the look on your face too,  and the fact that you''re not centered.  The focus is too soft for my taste.</td>', 'Cute title, and your skin looks so flawless!  I like the look on your face too,  and the fact that you''re not centered.  The focus is too soft for my taste.', '2005-02-19 07:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181675, 145580, 1128, '<td valign="top">I really like everything about this (particularly the colors, and the way you''re positioned).  It seems like your face is a little out of focus.</td>', 'I really like everything about this (particularly the colors, and the way you''re positioned).  It seems like your face is a little out of focus.', '2005-02-19 07:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181679, 146859, 1128, '<td valign="top">Very very very clever!  bump</td>', 'Very very very clever!  bump', '2005-02-19 07:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181680, 146516, 1128, '<td valign="top">oooooh  I like the composition very much.  The colors are right on, too.</td>', 'oooooh  I like the composition very much.  The colors are right on, too.', '2005-02-19 07:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181681, 146394, 1128, '<td valign="top">Love it, love it.  I love the clever title and I love your depth of field.  I love the amount of wet clay and dry clay and I love your expression.  Awesome!</td>', 'Love it, love it.  I love the clever title and I love your depth of field.  I love the amount of wet clay and dry clay and I love your expression.  Awesome!', '2005-02-19 08:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181682, 146166, 1128, '<td valign="top">so clever!</td>', 'so clever!', '2005-02-19 08:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181684, 146587, 23394, '<td valign="top">i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image to try to figure out what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image.<br/> <br/>my initial reaction is that this is a strong, sharp image.  while i like the contrast, i think the lighting is just everso slightly too strong.  the expression and pose is perfect, especially for a self-portrait.  the only things i really have qualms with are the centering of the subject and background on right.  i think if you went with a 1:1.25 crop from the left, it would be perfect.  but then again, what the hell do i know?  i shoot bugs and blurry taxis.  you have a fine image, and i hope it does well for you!</td>', 'i don''t know anything about portraiture, so i''m using your image to try to figure out what i think i would or wouldn''t do in this situation, as well as what i notice and get out of your image. my initial reaction is that this is a strong, sharp image.  while i like the contrast, i think the lighting is just everso slightly too strong.  the expression and pose is perfect, especially for a self-portrait.  the only things i really have qualms with are the centering of the subject and background on right.  i think if you went with a 1:1.25 crop from the left, it would be perfect.  but then again, what the hell do i know?  i shoot bugs and blurry taxis.  you have a fine image, and i hope it does well for you!', '2005-02-19 08:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181685, 144813, 1128, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  :)  I like the crop and I love the tone of the black and white.  Your hair is tack-sharp.</td>', 'I really like this.  :)  I like the crop and I love the tone of the black and white.  Your hair is tack-sharp.', '2005-02-19 08:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181686, 145749, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely.  Wouldn''t change a thing!</td>', 'This is just lovely.  Wouldn''t change a thing!', '2005-02-19 08:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181689, 146420, 1128, '<td valign="top">fabulous!  I love the tones and the exquisite sharpness of everything</td>', 'fabulous!  I love the tones and the exquisite sharpness of everything', '2005-02-19 08:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181691, 146030, 1128, '<td valign="top">Very clever concept and title.  Personally, I would prefer a little more focus.</td>', 'Very clever concept and title.  Personally, I would prefer a little more focus.', '2005-02-19 08:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181696, 146872, 1128, '<td valign="top">You look a little scared of your own little world.  I like the tones you used.</td>', 'You look a little scared of your own little world.  I like the tones you used.', '2005-02-19 08:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181697, 146211, 1128, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  Especially the eye part.  The note on the computer screen is the *only* thing I that distracts me.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  Especially the eye part.  The note on the computer screen is the *only* thing I that distracts me.', '2005-02-19 08:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181698, 146289, 1128, '<td valign="top">I think I get what your were trying to do here.  I like your makeup and hair.  Truthfully, it comes off looking like somewhat of a mug shot.   A different background, off-center composition and a smile might make it look like more of a self protrait.</td>', 'I think I get what your were trying to do here.  I like your makeup and hair.  Truthfully, it comes off looking like somewhat of a mug shot.   A different background, off-center composition and a smile might make it look like more of a self protrait.', '2005-02-19 08:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181699, 146760, 1128, '<td valign="top">The skin on your neck is so awesome.  The rest of the shot is a little too busy for me.</td>', 'The skin on your neck is so awesome.  The rest of the shot is a little too busy for me.', '2005-02-19 08:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181705, 146349, 1128, '<td valign="top">love the hat!  Great tones and focus</td>', 'love the hat!  Great tones and focus', '2005-02-19 08:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181707, 146507, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely.  Il like the converging lines and the colors.  Very cool (litererally)</td>', 'This is just lovely.  Il like the converging lines and the colors.  Very cool (litererally)', '2005-02-19 08:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181739, 146517, 33933, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2005-02-19 09:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181741, 146855, 27763, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the background elements were distracting, especially the mobile, but now that I look at it more, I think they work well in the composition in an abstract/geometric way.  The colors in this shot work really well together (muted reds/yellows/greens).</td>', 'At first I thought the background elements were distracting, especially the mobile, but now that I look at it more, I think they work well in the composition in an abstract/geometric way.  The colors in this shot work really well together (muted reds/yellows/greens).', '2005-02-19 09:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181761, 146577, 32363, '<td valign="top">Something eerily clear about this shot - the skin tones are some of the most natural I''ve seen through a browser, great foto (10)</td>', 'Something eerily clear about this shot - the skin tones are some of the most natural I''ve seen through a browser, great foto (10)', '2005-02-19 09:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181768, 146483, 32363, '<td valign="top">Great shot - I like that you didn''t try to "fake it" with filters (9)</td>', 'Great shot - I like that you didn''t try to "fake it" with filters (9)', '2005-02-19 09:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181806, 146859, 22641, '<td valign="top">Intersting move<br/></td>', 'Intersting move', '2005-02-19 10:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181832, 146577, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very effective self-portrait, it really draws the viewers view right onto you. Simple composition with excellent use of negative space and it adds to the over all mood. Nice work!</td>', 'Very effective self-portrait, it really draws the viewers view right onto you. Simple composition with excellent use of negative space and it adds to the over all mood. Nice work!', '2005-02-19 10:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181873, 146394, 5286, '<td valign="top">neat idea! and the eyes are captivating. Gotcha Kiwi!!</td>', 'neat idea! and the eyes are captivating. Gotcha Kiwi!!', '2005-02-19 11:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181939, 145842, 33520, '<td valign="top">i really like it a lot very lovely pic</td>', 'i really like it a lot very lovely pic', '2005-02-19 11:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181946, 146742, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very original Wendy :)</td>', 'Very original Wendy :)', '2005-02-19 11:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1181964, 146843, 7810, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and clarity of this shot...try setting up a little further from your background to avoid shadows...well done</td>', 'Love the colours and clarity of this shot...try setting up a little further from your background to avoid shadows...well done', '2005-02-19 11:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182039, 146420, 8891, '<td valign="top">my fav. like the composition, tones, textures and exposure. Very interesting image to view. You are a great subject.</td>', 'my fav. like the composition, tones, textures and exposure. Very interesting image to view. You are a great subject.', '2005-02-19 12:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182084, 146215, 24674, '<td valign="top">bad title on a good photo.</td>', 'bad title on a good photo.', '2005-02-19 12:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182092, 145583, 10080, '<td valign="top">Thats just crazy! I like the balck and the symmatry. I wish I could see a bit more of the hair. I don''t know what most people on dpc look like, but your a charecter. 7</td>', 'Thats just crazy! I like the balck and the symmatry. I wish I could see a bit more of the hair. I don''t know what most people on dpc look like, but your a charecter. 7', '2005-02-19 12:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182095, 144813, 10080, '<td valign="top">I like the detail in your hair...the highlights are a bit blown out, but its a good core of a shot with a bit better lighting. it has a good feel. 6</td>', 'I like the detail in your hair...the highlights are a bit blown out, but its a good core of a shot with a bit better lighting. it has a good feel. 6', '2005-02-19 12:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182098, 146877, 10080, '<td valign="top">I love the idea..it just needs a bit more punch. its a good situation to do a few more takes on. Good job 7</td>', 'I love the idea..it just needs a bit more punch. its a good situation to do a few more takes on. Good job 7', '2005-02-19 12:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182099, 146264, 10080, '<td valign="top">Great expression, and I like the crop and shadows. 7</td>', 'Great expression, and I like the crop and shadows. 7', '2005-02-19 13:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182100, 146843, 10080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty! I like the colors, and detail! 8</td>', 'Very pretty! I like the colors, and detail! 8', '2005-02-19 13:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182101, 145440, 10080, '<td valign="top">It a really pretty and well executed shot, Its a very nice all around picture, but I needed to see you somehow. It would have been a 10 but I have to give you a 7. I really like it though</td>', 'It a really pretty and well executed shot, Its a very nice all around picture, but I needed to see you somehow. It would have been a 10 but I have to give you a 7. I really like it though', '2005-02-19 13:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182103, 145395, 10080, '<td valign="top">Very nice! LOVE the glasses, and the execution is flawless! Top 5 from what I have voted on. Nice work! 10</td>', 'Very nice! LOVE the glasses, and the execution is flawless! Top 5 from what I have voted on. Nice work! 10', '2005-02-19 13:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182104, 146507, 26151, '<td valign="top">Great concept, great execution.</td>', 'Great concept, great execution.', '2005-02-19 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182105, 146738, 10080, '<td valign="top">Very cool take on it! Really has my eyes going. I wish it was bigger, but its a nice shot.8</td>', 'Very cool take on it! Really has my eyes going. I wish it was bigger, but its a nice shot.8', '2005-02-19 13:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182107, 145879, 10080, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I bet you have all the chicks in DPC land swooning. Technically I LOVE the way the eyes sparkle. That makes any portrait, and the overall feel of the shot is good! 9 Good job!</td>', 'Very nice! I bet you have all the chicks in DPC land swooning. Technically I LOVE the way the eyes sparkle. That makes any portrait, and the overall feel of the shot is good! 9 Good job!', '2005-02-19 13:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182109, 146420, 26151, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and lighting. A fine work of art.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and lighting. A fine work of art.', '2005-02-19 13:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182110, 146444, 10080, '<td valign="top">Its a cool idea! Its an original take on this challenge, 7</td>', 'Its a cool idea! Its an original take on this challenge, 7', '2005-02-19 13:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182113, 146230, 10080, '<td valign="top">Turned out nice! I like the overall feel! Good job 9</td>', 'Turned out nice! I like the overall feel! Good job 9', '2005-02-19 13:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182115, 146866, 10080, '<td valign="top">What a great shot if you were just a little more focused. The colors and composition are nice! 7</td>', 'What a great shot if you were just a little more focused. The colors and composition are nice! 7', '2005-02-19 13:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182119, 145911, 10080, '<td valign="top">My first thought "POWERFUL" Great lighting! Nice pose. Great overall artistic portrait. I wanna see a Woman in that same shot! 10</td>', 'My first thought "POWERFUL" Great lighting! Nice pose. Great overall artistic portrait. I wanna see a Woman in that same shot! 10', '2005-02-19 13:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182126, 145281, 10080, '<td valign="top">I can tell you are pretty lady, I just wsh the eyes were a little better lit. At least the one in the shadow. Its a nice take! 7</td>', 'I can tell you are pretty lady, I just wsh the eyes were a little better lit. At least the one in the shadow. Its a nice take! 7', '2005-02-19 13:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182128, 146715, 10080, '<td valign="top">Tecnically its well done. Its just lacking emotion. I just picture a musical talent as more expressive. 6</td>', 'Tecnically its well done. Its just lacking emotion. I just picture a musical talent as more expressive. 6', '2005-02-19 13:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182129, 146757, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is really good! The apparently shallow depth of field works very well. I like the colors too. Well done!<br/></td>', 'This is really good! The apparently shallow depth of field works very well. I like the colors too. Well done!', '2005-02-19 13:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182130, 146762, 22734, '<td valign="top">An image with strong emotional projection and the lighting and background greatly enforce the mood. The expression with corners of mouth leading down along with the expert camera angle create a a highly penetrating visual. Bumping up.</td>', 'An image with strong emotional projection and the lighting and background greatly enforce the mood. The expression with corners of mouth leading down along with the expert camera angle create a a highly penetrating visual. Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 13:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182131, 146808, 10080, '<td valign="top">Ive seen ya before, but I don''t know the faces out there. Its a great shot! I love the lighting, 9</td>', 'Ive seen ya before, but I don''t know the faces out there. Its a great shot! I love the lighting, 9', '2005-02-19 13:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182133, 146596, 16230, '<td valign="top">Although the entire image is a bit too dark for my taste, I really like the pose, and composition is very nice. Beautiful eyes!</td>', 'Although the entire image is a bit too dark for my taste, I really like the pose, and composition is very nice. Beautiful eyes!', '2005-02-19 13:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182134, 146555, 26151, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. The only problem I have with it though, is kind of a big one: The two bases of the railing behind the bigger you, in the forefront, align with your mouth, making the two bases look like some kind of fangs or something. That''s what I see when I look at it. Otherwise I love it, the whole idea and everything. And I can see from the other you, that you are really a good looking, fangless person.</td>', 'This is a great shot. The only problem I have with it though, is kind of a big one: The two bases of the railing behind the bigger you, in the forefront, align with your mouth, making the two bases look like some kind of fangs or something. That''s what I see when I look at it. Otherwise I love it, the whole idea and everything. And I can see from the other you, that you are really a good looking, fangless person.', '2005-02-19 13:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182135, 146278, 10080, '<td valign="top">Its a great idea. Very original 7</td>', 'Its a great idea. Very original 7', '2005-02-19 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182137, 146030, 10080, '<td valign="top">Had me laughng! I like that. Detail is nice..the lighting and crop coulda been a bit better, but it makes me smile. 7</td>', 'Had me laughng! I like that. Detail is nice..the lighting and crop coulda been a bit better, but it makes me smile. 7', '2005-02-19 13:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182139, 144809, 22734, '<td valign="top">A highly interesting and strong image with great punch. The low key values describe something akin to the soul search which we must all come to terms with. The b/w adds magic because the image seems to appear from the dark abyss much like out thoughts do. A good study very well posed. Bumping up.</td>', 'A highly interesting and strong image with great punch. The low key values describe something akin to the soul search which we must all come to terms with. The b/w adds magic because the image seems to appear from the dark abyss much like out thoughts do. A good study very well posed. Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 13:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182140, 145121, 10080, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Love the artistic approach and feel!9</td>', 'Very nice. Love the artistic approach and feel!9', '2005-02-19 13:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182142, 145703, 16230, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the over-exposure much. With a beautiful face such as this I''d try to show as much detail as possible. The pose and composition are super!<br/></td>', 'I don''t like the over-exposure much. With a beautiful face such as this I''d try to show as much detail as possible. The pose and composition are super!', '2005-02-19 13:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182147, 146483, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very convincing and great effect. The stare adds substance to the portrait aspect. The colors and tones are well controlled. This reminds me of the moments we are set back by surprise when the magician pulls the rabbit out of the hat. Bumping up to 7</td>', 'Very convincing and great effect. The stare adds substance to the portrait aspect. The colors and tones are well controlled. This reminds me of the moments we are set back by surprise when the magician pulls the rabbit out of the hat. Bumping up to 7', '2005-02-19 13:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182149, 145220, 16230, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very well done! I love those eyes! I might have tried shining some light on the hair and leaving the background black, or maybe let both go all black. That gorgeous face really stands out nicely in this photo.  Want to model for me? &lt;g&gt;</td>', 'Wow! Very well done! I love those eyes! I might have tried shining some light on the hair and leaving the background black, or maybe let both go all black. That gorgeous face really stands out nicely in this photo.  Want to model for me? <g>', '2005-02-19 13:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182151, 146737, 22734, '<td valign="top">It is all in the eyes. A very good and penetrating gaze. A little deeper dof would have been better. The skin tones and lighting are on the money. Bumping up.</td>', 'It is all in the eyes. A very good and penetrating gaze. A little deeper dof would have been better. The skin tones and lighting are on the money. Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 13:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182154, 146592, 26151, '<td valign="top">Wow! Simply amazing. This should be hanging in a gallery somewhere. It looks like the painting of a master.</td>', 'Wow! Simply amazing. This should be hanging in a gallery somewhere. It looks like the painting of a master.', '2005-02-19 13:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182157, 146822, 14012, '<td valign="top">good idea, but you need a little more light</td>', 'good idea, but you need a little more light', '2005-02-19 13:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182161, 146425, 14012, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation really detracts from this.</td>', 'The selective desaturation really detracts from this.', '2005-02-19 13:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182162, 145726, 14012, '<td valign="top">funny take on the challenge, executed well. Good luck</td>', 'funny take on the challenge, executed well. Good luck', '2005-02-19 13:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182165, 145335, 14012, '<td valign="top">very well done high key</td>', 'very well done high key', '2005-02-19 13:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182182, 146394, 25873, '<td valign="top">My favourite of the challenge.<br/> <br/>Very striking and intense, perfect lighting and tonal range.</td>', 'My favourite of the challenge. Very striking and intense, perfect lighting and tonal range.', '2005-02-19 14:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182183, 146420, 25873, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites of the challenge.  This photo has great lighting and the framing makes one really wonder about the story you have to tell.</td>', 'One of my favourites of the challenge.  This photo has great lighting and the framing makes one really wonder about the story you have to tell.', '2005-02-19 14:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182184, 146507, 25873, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites of the challenge.  The perspective draws all the attention to the subject and provides a great contrast (cold surrounding, warm body).</td>', 'One of my favourites of the challenge.  The perspective draws all the attention to the subject and provides a great contrast (cold surrounding, warm body).', '2005-02-19 14:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182186, 145726, 25873, '<td valign="top">I love this portrait - it obviously shows your sense of humour.  But the grey t-shirt and plain background say something about an uncomplicated and easy going nature that I''m sure complement your humour.</td>', 'I love this portrait - it obviously shows your sense of humour.  But the grey t-shirt and plain background say something about an uncomplicated and easy going nature that I''m sure complement your humour.', '2005-02-19 14:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182190, 146757, 25873, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot for its quirkiness but also the surprisingly good effect of the selective blur.  It would think the blur would look artificial - but it really draws the focus to your eye and your expression in a pleasing way.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot for its quirkiness but also the surprisingly good effect of the selective blur.  It would think the blur would look artificial - but it really draws the focus to your eye and your expression in a pleasing way.', '2005-02-19 14:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182197, 144823, 25873, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you got such a clear, well lit picture from a non-SLR camera in the reflection of a hospital convex mirror, so major points for technical difficulty there!<br/> <br/>Apart from the technical merits, you really captured an incredible moment and the look on your face makes for one of the best portraits of this challenge.</td>', 'I can''t believe you got such a clear, well lit picture from a non-SLR camera in the reflection of a hospital convex mirror, so major points for technical difficulty there! Apart from the technical merits, you really captured an incredible moment and the look on your face makes for one of the best portraits of this challenge.', '2005-02-19 14:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182198, 144801, 25873, '<td valign="top">I would love to see an explanation of how you were able to get such a great effect - was there a lot of cloning out of blurring that must have invariably happened as you raised/lowered your arms?<br/> <br/>Fantastic idea, great result.</td>', 'I would love to see an explanation of how you were able to get such a great effect - was there a lot of cloning out of blurring that must have invariably happened as you raised/lowered your arms? Fantastic idea, great result.', '2005-02-19 14:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182200, 146859, 25873, '<td valign="top">Great idea, reminds me of those HP imaging commercials that have been on TV a lot lately.</td>', 'Great idea, reminds me of those HP imaging commercials that have been on TV a lot lately.', '2005-02-19 14:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182202, 145571, 2667, '<td valign="top">Daniel is that you? Very nice portrait you have done here. I like the idea and the execution is spot on.</td>', 'Daniel is that you? Very nice portrait you have done here. I like the idea and the execution is spot on.', '2005-02-19 14:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182211, 145146, 16106, '<td valign="top">there is a ton of potential here but I wish there was more light more contrast more of your face, more personality, more of you. I wish there was either more pendant or none at all. I am lazy and don'' want to work this hard to decoce the image, what you have might be a lovely print, but it is too subtle for the screen.</td>', 'there is a ton of potential here but I wish there was more light more contrast more of your face, more personality, more of you. I wish there was either more pendant or none at all. I am lazy and don'' want to work this hard to decoce the image, what you have might be a lovely print, but it is too subtle for the screen.', '2005-02-19 14:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
