(1182356, 145842, 12253, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  This is very nice!  A bit soft maybe, but I really like it overall.  One thing I might suggest is cropping the right so the shot ends to the right of the block of hair crossing your mouth, and then maybe the carpet area as well.  Try it. I think it really further accentuates your eyes and the parts of your face that are showing through.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  This is very nice!  A bit soft maybe, but I really like it overall.  One thing I might suggest is cropping the right so the shot ends to the right of the block of hair crossing your mouth, and then maybe the carpet area as well.  Try it. I think it really further accentuates your eyes and the parts of your face that are showing through.  Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 16:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
