(1182694, 146278, 7810, '<td valign="top">great idea  like the image blur effect in both shots</td>', 'great idea  like the image blur effect in both shots', '2005-02-19 18:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182697, 146828, 7810, '<td valign="top">scarey take on the challenge ...cool effect</td>', 'scarey take on the challenge ...cool effect', '2005-02-19 18:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182698, 145219, 7810, '<td valign="top">nice lighting ...good portrait</td>', 'nice lighting ...good portrait', '2005-02-19 18:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182700, 146162, 16106, '<td valign="top">ok such a blatant shot at the brown deserves punishment. 10. other than the fact that it has nothing to do with the challenge it really is a nice shot, very moody.</td>', 'ok such a blatant shot at the brown deserves punishment. 10. other than the fact that it has nothing to do with the challenge it really is a nice shot, very moody.', '2005-02-19 18:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182708, 145703, 16106, '<td valign="top">I cant decide if the flash shadow ruins or makes the shot. It looks like something off a Robert Palmer albumb. the close cropping makes for an uncomfortable familiarty, and the aversion of the eyes puts it into the voyeuristic. Odd, arresting, offputting and very beautiful.</td>', 'I cant decide if the flash shadow ruins or makes the shot. It looks like something off a Robert Palmer albumb. the close cropping makes for an uncomfortable familiarty, and the aversion of the eyes puts it into the voyeuristic. Odd, arresting, offputting and very beautiful.', '2005-02-19 18:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182713, 145659, 16106, '<td valign="top">very sly and witty. the reflection off the few hairs in the black are a bit of a distraction in an otherwise stark study. top ten</td>', 'very sly and witty. the reflection off the few hairs in the black are a bit of a distraction in an otherwise stark study. top ten', '2005-02-19 18:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182725, 145678, 22734, '<td valign="top">Honest, complete and to the point of the challenge.The focus is on the spot and the lighting brings out the form to good advantage along with the dark background. Bumping up.</td>', 'Honest, complete and to the point of the challenge.The focus is on the spot and the lighting brings out the form to good advantage along with the dark background. Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182727, 145583, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great independent eye control. Maybe you can give me some lessons so that my double visions disappears.lol The lighting and focus is great and the impression adds a touch of humor. Good technique. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great independent eye control. Maybe you can give me some lessons so that my double visions disappears.lol The lighting and focus is great and the impression adds a touch of humor. Good technique. Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 19:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182732, 146425, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very nice and striking self portrait woth a super low key lighting. While the red has been too overly saturated, this is a minor adjustment to return this image to the credit it deserves. Bumping up on nice composition.</td>', 'A very nice and striking self portrait woth a super low key lighting. While the red has been too overly saturated, this is a minor adjustment to return this image to the credit it deserves. Bumping up on nice composition.', '2005-02-19 19:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182738, 146624, 22734, '<td valign="top">Although not a complete portrait the sepia tone adds a zest to make this stare very dynamic. The lighting is very comfortable, the pupils impressive and their catchlights superb to bring out the liquid nature. Bumping up because to me this is image has enough to convey character.</td>', 'Although not a complete portrait the sepia tone adds a zest to make this stare very dynamic. The lighting is very comfortable, the pupils impressive and their catchlights superb to bring out the liquid nature. Bumping up because to me this is image has enough to convey character.', '2005-02-19 19:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182740, 146289, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very sweet girl with an iron will. While not exhibiting ultra clarity, there is great character projection of tolerence and determination. On the lighter side, the feautures are attractive and a [;easure to look at. Bumping up.</td>', 'A very sweet girl with an iron will. While not exhibiting ultra clarity, there is great character projection of tolerence and determination. On the lighter side, the feautures are attractive and a [;easure to look at. Bumping up.', '2005-02-19 19:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182753, 146370, 16790, '<td valign="top">The desaturated feel really works for this - lighting is great and the definition is excellent. Nice work.</td>', 'The desaturated feel really works for this - lighting is great and the definition is excellent. Nice work.', '2005-02-19 19:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182755, 146507, 16790, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Gorgeous scenery, excellent composition, and a nice clear facial view.  A creative take on the challenge that worked out well.</td>', 'Awesome.  Gorgeous scenery, excellent composition, and a nice clear facial view.  A creative take on the challenge that worked out well.', '2005-02-19 19:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182756, 145911, 16790, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, and the deep shadows look lovely.  Very artistic and surprisingly clear for such low light levels.  Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent lighting, and the deep shadows look lovely.  Very artistic and surprisingly clear for such low light levels.  Nice work.', '2005-02-19 19:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182760, 146418, 16790, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure why I like this so much, but I do.  It reminds me of a 30-or-so year old snapshot - the toning is great; it really seems to match the slightly dissheveled hair. Focus is a little soft, but that keeps with the mood.  Oddly appealing shot - nice work.</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure why I like this so much, but I do.  It reminds me of a 30-or-so year old snapshot - the toning is great; it really seems to match the slightly dissheveled hair. Focus is a little soft, but that keeps with the mood.  Oddly appealing shot - nice work.', '2005-02-19 19:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182765, 146420, 16790, '<td valign="top">Stunning clarity - DOF is perfect, everything is so sharp and perfectly lit.  The toning really finishes this and makes it shine.  Awesome work.</td>', 'Stunning clarity - DOF is perfect, everything is so sharp and perfectly lit.  The toning really finishes this and makes it shine.  Awesome work.', '2005-02-19 19:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182768, 145395, 16790, '<td valign="top">My eyes are a bit more drawn to the glasses than your face, but nonetheless this is a very cool picture.  The lighting seems to be just about right, and the clarity is excellent.  The toning really works for the photograph; overall nice work.</td>', 'My eyes are a bit more drawn to the glasses than your face, but nonetheless this is a very cool picture.  The lighting seems to be just about right, and the clarity is excellent.  The toning really works for the photograph; overall nice work.', '2005-02-19 19:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182773, 146808, 16790, '<td valign="top">Creepy.  Excellent lighting though - I love how the edges of the hood are highlighted.  Very clear and well done; exposure seems perfect, and the focus is right on.</td>', 'Creepy.  Excellent lighting though - I love how the edges of the hood are highlighted.  Very clear and well done; exposure seems perfect, and the focus is right on.', '2005-02-19 19:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182774, 146394, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is.. very odd, but very creative.  The details are fantastic, the focus is excellent, and the toning works well for the mood.  The eyes really stand out - excellent work.</td>', 'This is.. very odd, but very creative.  The details are fantastic, the focus is excellent, and the toning works well for the mood.  The eyes really stand out - excellent work.', '2005-02-19 19:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182776, 145604, 16790, '<td valign="top">There''s something appealing about this, and I''m not entirely sure what it is.  The mood is good, and I actually like the fact that the focus is on the background - even though that doesn''t really fit with the portrait theme.  Still, this has something special - good job.</td>', 'There''s something appealing about this, and I''m not entirely sure what it is.  The mood is good, and I actually like the fact that the focus is on the background - even though that doesn''t really fit with the portrait theme.  Still, this has something special - good job.', '2005-02-19 19:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182779, 145749, 16790, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  This one has a real sense of serenity about it, probably helped by the soft pastel colours, and the fact that it''s not a studio shot only adds to the appeal.  Beautiful work.</td>', 'Lovely.  This one has a real sense of serenity about it, probably helped by the soft pastel colours, and the fact that it''s not a studio shot only adds to the appeal.  Beautiful work.', '2005-02-19 19:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182780, 146394, 28258, '<td valign="top">Cool shot...I think it will be top 5</td>', 'Cool shot...I think it will be top 5', '2005-02-19 19:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182802, 146543, 4285, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot Hugh. You lined it up very well. Must of took a bit of figuring and shooting to get it just right.</td>', 'Awesome shot Hugh. You lined it up very well. Must of took a bit of figuring and shooting to get it just right.', '2005-02-19 19:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1182813, 144919, 4285, '<td valign="top">Leslie? The high key works well. Nice.</td>', 'Leslie? The high key works well. Nice.', '2005-02-19 19:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
