(1184733, 145434, 31597, '<td valign="top">i love this idea.  most voters on this site seem to stray away from the abstract and extream, however i try to embrace it.  this is a perfect example of why i do it, like this photo, those pictures are unique and memerable.</td>', 'i love this idea.  most voters on this site seem to stray away from the abstract and extream, however i try to embrace it.  this is a perfect example of why i do it, like this photo, those pictures are unique and memerable.', '2005-02-20 22:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
