(1184736, 145799, 4285, '<td valign="top">Hey Brian. :)</td>', 'Hey Brian. :)', '2005-02-20 22:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184738, 146166, 3214, '<td valign="top">Inventive, interesting, and it sure turned your body into that of a young boy...or maybe you ARE a young boy!</td>', 'Inventive, interesting, and it sure turned your body into that of a young boy...or maybe you ARE a young boy!', '2005-02-20 22:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184739, 146513, 18349, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was Sam Elliot meets Willie Nelson meets Kris Kristofferson.  Whether you are or not, you''d make a way cool cowboy!  :o)</td>', 'My first reaction was Sam Elliot meets Willie Nelson meets Kris Kristofferson.  Whether you are or not, you''d make a way cool cowboy!  :o)', '2005-02-20 22:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184740, 146726, 31597, '<td valign="top">this picture is out of focus and grainy.  you have the right idea on being creative, however, i think it is best to pick one of the other, not both fo pas, to make the image creative.</td>', 'this picture is out of focus and grainy.  you have the right idea on being creative, however, i think it is best to pick one of the other, not both fo pas, to make the image creative.', '2005-02-20 22:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184742, 146507, 31597, '<td valign="top">you brave soul<br/>the background adds character and originality, not to mention a bit of texture from the road, very cool.</td>', 'you brave soulthe background adds character and originality, not to mention a bit of texture from the road, very cool.', '2005-02-20 22:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184743, 145799, 18349, '<td valign="top">You can''t hide behind a frame, Brian... you''re WAAAY too handsome for that!  Excellent idea for your SP and great image.  Well done!!!!  :o)</td>', 'You can''t hide behind a frame, Brian... you''re WAAAY too handsome for that!  Excellent idea for your SP and great image.  Well done!!!!  :o)', '2005-02-20 22:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184746, 146762, 3214, '<td valign="top">love the attitude! and the moisture.  ;-)</td>', 'love the attitude! and the moisture.  ;-)', '2005-02-20 22:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184748, 145255, 18349, '<td valign="top">Terrific idea!!!  One of the most unique of the challenge.  Well done! :o)</td>', 'Terrific idea!!!  One of the most unique of the challenge.  Well done! :o)', '2005-02-20 22:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184751, 144801, 18349, '<td valign="top">I thought I recognized you!  Wonderful portrait idea, and great lighting.  I hope it does well!  :o)</td>', 'I thought I recognized you!  Wonderful portrait idea, and great lighting.  I hope it does well!  :o)', '2005-02-20 22:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184752, 146725, 31597, '<td valign="top">its not you at all, its your shadow!<br/>i would still give comments on the way you took your photo, however the image is too small for my to see any details.  my suggestion, next time make your picture a smaller resolution and larger pixels before posting</td>', 'its not you at all, its your shadow!i would still give comments on the way you took your photo, however the image is too small for my to see any details.  my suggestion, next time make your picture a smaller resolution and larger pixels before posting', '2005-02-20 22:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184754, 145676, 14012, '<td valign="top">I think looking into the camera would have added something. The pink border doesn''t do anything but take away from an otherwise good shot.</td>', 'I think looking into the camera would have added something. The pink border doesn''t do anything but take away from an otherwise good shot.', '2005-02-20 22:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184759, 146450, 25787, '<td valign="top">A touching photograph.  What great expressions on both of you.  Congratulations on the beautiful baby.</td>', 'A touching photograph.  What great expressions on both of you.  Congratulations on the beautiful baby.', '2005-02-20 22:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184761, 145434, 18349, '<td valign="top">Well there''s something you don''t see every day... I won''t ask.  Great portrait though...and nice b/w as well.  The highlights on the face are a bit distracting but good job overall.</td>', 'Well there''s something you don''t see every day... I won''t ask.  Great portrait though...and nice b/w as well.  The highlights on the face are a bit distracting but good job overall.', '2005-02-20 22:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184762, 145796, 3214, '<td valign="top">Nice, sick humor, well executed!</td>', 'Nice, sick humor, well executed!', '2005-02-20 22:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184764, 144823, 25787, '<td valign="top">Brilliant photograph.  Excellent processing.  A neat way to make a fish eye lens.  7.  By the way, congratulations on the baby.</td>', 'Brilliant photograph.  Excellent processing.  A neat way to make a fish eye lens.  7.  By the way, congratulations on the baby.', '2005-02-20 22:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184766, 145677, 6600, '<td valign="top">Love the textures and tones.  Adding in you favorite suckin'' weed was a neat touch.  Composition works for me.  A slight turn of you head toward the camera would probably improve your final score (I like the shot though).  Great job!<br/>I think I would have just dubbed this "Reaper"</td>', 'Love the textures and tones.  Adding in you favorite suckin'' weed was a neat touch.  Composition works for me.  A slight turn of you head toward the camera would probably improve your final score (I like the shot though).  Great job!I think I would have just dubbed this "Reaper"', '2005-02-20 22:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184767, 146357, 31597, '<td valign="top">out of focus, and there is some color missing from the top of the photograph.  you have a beautiful smile, but next time try to focus on other things of your personality and add things (like flowers, or show off your jewelery more) and find a way to make colors pop.  adding the boarder was a good idea.</td>', 'out of focus, and there is some color missing from the top of the photograph.  you have a beautiful smile, but next time try to focus on other things of your personality and add things (like flowers, or show off your jewelery more) and find a way to make colors pop.  adding the boarder was a good idea.', '2005-02-20 22:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184768, 145078, 14012, '<td valign="top">highlights are very overexposed, especially on the left. You have completely lost all details on the check.</td>', 'highlights are very overexposed, especially on the left. You have completely lost all details on the check.', '2005-02-20 22:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184769, 146420, 25787, '<td valign="top">Great textures.  Very interesting pose.  Awsome way to frame yourself.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Great textures.  Very interesting pose.  Awsome way to frame yourself.  Bumping up.', '2005-02-20 22:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184773, 146819, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, very soft.... (resemble Bill Gates just a bit).</td>', 'Nice composition, very soft.... (resemble Bill Gates just a bit).', '2005-02-20 22:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184774, 146484, 14012, '<td valign="top">One of the best I''ve seen so far...I really like this. Maybe just a tad more fill to take care of the shadow over the eyes, cause by the brim of the hat.</td>', 'One of the best I''ve seen so far...I really like this. Maybe just a tad more fill to take care of the shadow over the eyes, cause by the brim of the hat.', '2005-02-20 22:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184775, 146162, 31597, '<td valign="top">i understand your point of making yourself your work. however, i''m not going to rate this picture high because i really can''t see too much personality here.  however, this is a nice shot.  nice value in the background and sharpness on the water droplet.  good placement of subject as well</td>', 'i understand your point of making yourself your work. however, i''m not going to rate this picture high because i really can''t see too much personality here.  however, this is a nice shot.  nice value in the background and sharpness on the water droplet.  good placement of subject as well', '2005-02-20 22:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184776, 146857, 25787, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Did you take the glass out of those frames?  Bumping up to 7</td>', 'Very nice.  Did you take the glass out of those frames?  Bumping up to 7', '2005-02-20 22:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184781, 146561, 31597, '<td valign="top">very good subject, however, poorly shot/editied.  this would have been a great image if there where more colors that popped out, or maybe making the photo on grayscale but leave the color in the flame.</td>', 'very good subject, however, poorly shot/editied.  this would have been a great image if there where more colors that popped out, or maybe making the photo on grayscale but leave the color in the flame.', '2005-02-20 22:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184786, 145255, 6600, '<td valign="top">Creative idea.  Like it!  Good job!</td>', 'Creative idea.  Like it!  Good job!', '2005-02-20 22:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184794, 146425, 6600, '<td valign="top">Neat lighting.... I think total desaturation or no desaturation would have made a better option.</td>', 'Neat lighting.... I think total desaturation or no desaturation would have made a better option.', '2005-02-20 22:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184800, 146653, 31597, '<td valign="top">i have some issues with this image.  though it is sometimes okay to have the camera inside a self-image shot, i don''t think it works here.  i also see you''re trying to get the hang of image resizing, which is a very confusing task.  colors need to be more saturated as well.  i think this was a good effort but method could be improved.</td>', 'i have some issues with this image.  though it is sometimes okay to have the camera inside a self-image shot, i don''t think it works here.  i also see you''re trying to get the hang of image resizing, which is a very confusing task.  colors need to be more saturated as well.  i think this was a good effort but method could be improved.', '2005-02-20 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184802, 145988, 6600, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh out loud!  Thanks.  Nice touch.</td>', 'This made me laugh out loud!  Thanks.  Nice touch.', '2005-02-20 22:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184805, 146841, 14012, '<td valign="top">ok  "1"<br/> <br/>just kidding. nice shot. maybe a little hair light from the top/ack to give a little glow around you. Otherwise, a very nice portrait. Love your toning, as usual.</td>', 'ok  "1" just kidding. nice shot. maybe a little hair light from the top/ack to give a little glow around you. Otherwise, a very nice portrait. Love your toning, as usual.', '2005-02-20 22:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184821, 146357, 14012, '<td valign="top">turn your shoulders 45 degrees to the camera, so your shoulder isn''t blocking your chin. Also seems to be a tad out of focus. Normally with portraits you want the focus sharp on the eyes.</td>', 'turn your shoulders 45 degrees to the camera, so your shoulder isn''t blocking your chin. Also seems to be a tad out of focus. Normally with portraits you want the focus sharp on the eyes.', '2005-02-20 22:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184832, 146810, 31597, '<td valign="top">i think this is an interesting image.  though i''m a little lost in the idea of it.  first time i looked at it i noticed first off that the skin and shodow of you is very well taken, very pretty skin in photos, (edited or not) is always nice to see.  i also see this could be a contrast between an evil self and a good self, which is an awsome idea and is portrayed well except for the chess board.  at first glance i didn''t know what it was, but not that i''ve looked at it again i get it.  theme of your photo is very bold and thats always good to see, just keep experimenting with technical ways to make your photos extraordinary.  if you check out my portfolio, you can see i have the same problem</td>', 'i think this is an interesting image.  though i''m a little lost in the idea of it.  first time i looked at it i noticed first off that the skin and shodow of you is very well taken, very pretty skin in photos, (edited or not) is always nice to see.  i also see this could be a contrast between an evil self and a good self, which is an awsome idea and is portrayed well except for the chess board.  at first glance i didn''t know what it was, but not that i''ve looked at it again i get it.  theme of your photo is very bold and thats always good to see, just keep experimenting with technical ways to make your photos extraordinary.  if you check out my portfolio, you can see i have the same problem', '2005-02-20 22:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184863, 146450, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait- one of my top 15. Wish I could see a little more of the baby''s face, because the expression looks like one in a million. The window light was a good choice, but something about the dark shadow on the side of your face looks unnatural (cropping through the cheek would solve most of that). Still very nice. 8</td>', 'Beautiful portrait- one of my top 15. Wish I could see a little more of the baby''s face, because the expression looks like one in a million. The window light was a good choice, but something about the dark shadow on the side of your face looks unnatural (cropping through the cheek would solve most of that). Still very nice. 8', '2005-02-20 22:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184869, 146230, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like this picture...it has a frank, open appeal...</td>', 'I like this picture...it has a frank, open appeal...', '2005-02-20 22:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184871, 145255, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is a great, creative twist on the self-portrait.</td>', 'This is a great, creative twist on the self-portrait.', '2005-02-20 22:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184873, 145220, 4285, '<td valign="top">Hi Julia ;) Great self-portrait.</td>', 'Hi Julia ;) Great self-portrait.', '2005-02-20 22:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184885, 145593, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hi Bob- nice shot... the lighting, angle and expression are all great, though I''d like to see you moved further to the right within the frame. Something about the edge detail seems off- maybe some slight motion, ISO1600, or something in the way the shot was processed, but there''s just enough pixelization around the eyes to be noticeable. Still, a strong entry.</td>', 'Hi Bob- nice shot... the lighting, angle and expression are all great, though I''d like to see you moved further to the right within the frame. Something about the edge detail seems off- maybe some slight motion, ISO1600, or something in the way the shot was processed, but there''s just enough pixelization around the eyes to be noticeable. Still, a strong entry.', '2005-02-20 23:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184886, 145611, 19936, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  My top pick.  Did you use a layer without the eyes to apply blur?</td>', 'I love this photo.  My top pick.  Did you use a layer without the eyes to apply blur?', '2005-02-20 23:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184887, 146769, 17203, '<td valign="top">I do hope you at least brushed your teeth after the shoot. ;-)</td>', 'I do hope you at least brushed your teeth after the shoot. ;-)', '2005-02-20 23:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184891, 145659, 19936, '<td valign="top">Another of my top picks and so similar to the other.  Great expression.  Great light.  Love the softness of the face with sharp lips and eyes.</td>', 'Another of my top picks and so similar to the other.  Great expression.  Great light.  Love the softness of the face with sharp lips and eyes.', '2005-02-20 23:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184892, 146647, 6172, '<td valign="top">I think your lighting, and what it seems to imply to me are exceptional in this photo!</td>', 'I think your lighting, and what it seems to imply to me are exceptional in this photo!', '2005-02-20 23:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184893, 145726, 17203, '<td valign="top">LOL- nice sense of humor. Could have been even stronger if the prints didn''t appear washed out.</td>', 'LOL- nice sense of humor. Could have been even stronger if the prints didn''t appear washed out.', '2005-02-20 23:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184895, 146166, 19936, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see how this was done, so creative.  Great job.  9</td>', 'I can''t wait to see how this was done, so creative.  Great job.  9', '2005-02-20 23:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184896, 146577, 6172, '<td valign="top">Exceptional(h.), as always...</td>', 'Exceptional(h.), as always...', '2005-02-20 23:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
