(1184902, 146450, 19936, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for soon to be moms (pregnant) and new moms.  The love is captured so well in both mom and baby.  Great exposure and light.  9</td>', 'I''m a sucker for soon to be moms (pregnant) and new moms.  The love is captured so well in both mom and baby.  Great exposure and light.  9', '2005-02-20 23:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1184904, 146420, 22734, '<td valign="top">Wow! Does image have flair, richness, detail, superior focus and technique. Hey, I know when I have been outdone. This is perhaps the most impressive image of the collection. Bumping up. Returning for for my highest vote!</td>', 'Wow! Does image have flair, richness, detail, superior focus and technique. Hey, I know when I have been outdone. This is perhaps the most impressive image of the collection. Bumping up. Returning for for my highest vote!', '2005-02-20 23:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
