(1185138, 146420, 10170, '<td valign="top">All I can say is WOW!  <br/> <br/>I knew this would be the blue (ok, I am seldom right but this time I was) and am not at all surprised you got a score as high as this.<br/> <br/>This is an absolutely sensational shot, I can see this quite easily hanging in large photographic exhibits.  Amazing.</td>', 'All I can say is WOW!   I knew this would be the blue (ok, I am seldom right but this time I was) and am not at all surprised you got a score as high as this. This is an absolutely sensational shot, I can see this quite easily hanging in large photographic exhibits.  Amazing.', '2005-02-21 00:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1185141, 146420, 8891, '<td valign="top">A decisive win and my favorite. Glad to see it win and glad to see you in the blue again, JJ!  Congrats!   RoB</td>', 'A decisive win and my favorite. Glad to see it win and glad to see you in the blue again, JJ!  Congrats!   RoB', '2005-02-21 00:21:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1185142, 146757, 23458, '<td valign="top">There were quite a few in this challenge that made me smile - but none did as good a job of that as this! Congratulations.</td>', 'There were quite a few in this challenge that made me smile - but none did as good a job of that as this! Congratulations.', '2005-02-21 00:21:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1185143, 145779, 93, '<td valign="top">Damn you''re cute :)</td>', 'Damn you''re cute :)', '2005-02-21 00:21:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1185144, 146394, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is cool.  Many congratulations!!!!!</td>', 'Wow!  This is cool.  Many congratulations!!!!!', '2005-02-21 00:22:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1185145, 146652, 12253, '<td valign="top">Hey Brando, I liked this one.  My favorite kind of shot.  Excellent poses and nice time/multiple exposure.  I mean REALLY.  I don''t even think I can make the face on the right! <br/> <br/>To me the only thing that I could have seen improving is the "grayness" of it--I don''t know if that was intentional.  You might try to play with the levels on it--I can see this working in high key, which is what it might become with some playing.<br/> <br/>Thanks for your comments on mine, and hey, you weren''t far behind in score to me anyway (and you have a favorite!)  See you around the site!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hey Brando, I liked this one.  My favorite kind of shot.  Excellent poses and nice time/multiple exposure.  I mean REALLY.  I don''t even think I can make the face on the right!  To me the only thing that I could have seen improving is the "grayness" of it--I don''t know if that was intentional.  You might try to play with the levels on it--I can see this working in high key, which is what it might become with some playing. Thanks for your comments on mine, and hey, you weren''t far behind in score to me anyway (and you have a favorite!)  See you around the site! ', '2005-02-21 00:22:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1185146, 146577, 31637, '<td valign="top">Hi...I loved this from the start...the craziest frame and her pretty face is so clear I want to kiss it !! Great job on top 5 finish!</td>', 'Hi...I loved this from the start...the craziest frame and her pretty face is so clear I want to kiss it !! Great job on top 5 finish!', '2005-02-21 00:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1185149, 146420, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images that will be revisited over and over again. It is indeed a work of art giving the viewer that magic of the play of light and shadows and rich textures to weave an illusion like only photography can. A master execution which stands high above at the apex of the pyramid in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your esay access to the Blue.</td>', 'This is one of those images that will be revisited over and over again. It is indeed a work of art giving the viewer that magic of the play of light and shadows and rich textures to weave an illusion like only photography can. A master execution which stands high above at the apex of the pyramid in this challenge. Congratulations on your esay access to the Blue.', '2005-02-21 00:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1185150, 146484, 93, '<td valign="top">Hey.. we placed pretty close together! I didn''t realise there was another one of us s7000''ers out there.  Nice shot, it has a very, "campy" feel to it.. Like an old Dr. Who episode or something.</td>', 'Hey.. we placed pretty close together! I didn''t realise there was another one of us s7000''ers out there.  Nice shot, it has a very, "campy" feel to it.. Like an old Dr. Who episode or something.', '2005-02-21 00:24:10.000000', NULL, 0),
