(1185468, 146507, 20066, '<td valign="top">WOW<br/>I don''t know what to say.  I was dreaming about a ribbon whole night.  But well, not this time.  I''s just so strange I didn''t think much of that photo when I was doing it.  Just a sudden idea while driving and yes taking photos.  <br/> <br/>And about the risk of beeing on the middle of the road.  There wasn''t so much risk since I saw just 4 or 5 cars while I was doing it and that was perhaps around 20 minutes.<br/> <br/>I want to thank all the voters and those sixty something commenters who commented on my photo during the challenge.<br/> <br/>But I think it is unfair to have a photo voted 7.3 something but no ribbon at all!</td>', 'WOWI don''t know what to say.  I was dreaming about a ribbon whole night.  But well, not this time.  I''s just so strange I didn''t think much of that photo when I was doing it.  Just a sudden idea while driving and yes taking photos.   And about the risk of beeing on the middle of the road.  There wasn''t so much risk since I saw just 4 or 5 cars while I was doing it and that was perhaps around 20 minutes. I want to thank all the voters and those sixty something commenters who commented on my photo during the challenge. But I think it is unfair to have a photo voted 7.3 something but no ribbon at all!', '2005-02-21 02:57:07.000000', NULL, 0),
