(1185735, 146726, 12571, '<td valign="top">Well Dayum.... I didn''t thing it was THAT bad... even though I did upload the wrong pic. LOL Ah well, at least I achieved SOMETHING.<br/>Here''s what the pic was SUPPOSED to be:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=149053" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12571/thumb/149053.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12571/thumb/149053.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/12571/thumb/149053.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I had JUST signed up to be a paying member and hurried to take a pic and do some post editing to it. I submitted it at the last second and took the wrong one, since the all looked so similar. Oh well, live and learn.</td>', 'Well Dayum.... I didn''t thing it was THAT bad... even though I did upload the wrong pic. LOL Ah well, at least I achieved SOMETHING.Here''s what the pic was SUPPOSED to be:  I had JUST signed up to be a paying member and hurried to take a pic and do some post editing to it. I submitted it at the last second and took the wrong one, since the all looked so similar. Oh well, live and learn.', '2005-02-21 06:33:50.000000', NULL, 0),
