(1185750, 144809, 16912, '<td valign="top">Thanks for taking the time to comment on my submission peeps (all bar 1 of you anyway). I''m happy to receive constructive critsism, and thats how I learn. Childish ridicule, even if it was meant to be funny gets me angry. This was a first, and most likely the last nude for me, I very nearly pulled it at the last minute but feel I''ve learnt something this past week so it was almost worth it?<br/> <br/>Its currently N04 on my top pics so guess I need to go out and take a better picture sharpish if I don''t want to see it everyday!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-02-21 07:04:43.</i></td>', 'Thanks for taking the time to comment on my submission peeps (all bar 1 of you anyway). I''m happy to receive constructive critsism, and thats how I learn. Childish ridicule, even if it was meant to be funny gets me angry. This was a first, and most likely the last nude for me, I very nearly pulled it at the last minute but feel I''ve learnt something this past week so it was almost worth it? Its currently N04 on my top pics so guess I need to go out and take a better picture sharpish if I don''t want to see it everyday!', '2005-02-21 07:01:40.000000', '2005-02-21 07:04:43.000000', 0),
