(1185878, 146846, 17103, '<td valign="top">I''m especially grateful for the comments this time, as without them I never would have known about the green hair reflection, which just doesn''t show up on my monitor.  I guess it''s also invisible to some other folks out there, too, judging from some of the more positive comments.  I did view this photo on my husband''s computer after I''d received one or two comments about it and the reflection does appear in all its hideous glory on his monitor. lol!  Well, it''s taught me a good lesson, that I need to either buy a new monitor or check every photo on at least two computers!  I really wish I could remove this one from my portfolio.  In any event, thanks again for the honest comments. :)</td>', 'I''m especially grateful for the comments this time, as without them I never would have known about the green hair reflection, which just doesn''t show up on my monitor.  I guess it''s also invisible to some other folks out there, too, judging from some of the more positive comments.  I did view this photo on my husband''s computer after I''d received one or two comments about it and the reflection does appear in all its hideous glory on his monitor. lol!  Well, it''s taught me a good lesson, that I need to either buy a new monitor or check every photo on at least two computers!  I really wish I could remove this one from my portfolio.  In any event, thanks again for the honest comments. :)', '2005-02-21 08:48:59.000000', NULL, 0),
