(1186031, 146563, 27735, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aerogurl:</b></div><hr/><i> this scored way to low, nice photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, Dana. I''m not really dissatisfied with the score...if it had scored any higher it would have been my best score and taken the #1 spot on my profile. As it is, it will probably still be on my profile forever. :( Oh well, not too bad for a last minute snapshot using a table top tripod and autofocus, huh? :) Thanks, everyone, for all the comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by aerogurl: this scored way to low, nice photo.   Thanks, Dana. I''m not really dissatisfied with the score...if it had scored any higher it would have been my best score and taken the #1 spot on my profile. As it is, it will probably still be on my profile forever. :( Oh well, not too bad for a last minute snapshot using a table top tripod and autofocus, huh? :) Thanks, everyone, for all the comments.', '2005-02-21 10:44:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1186033, 146876, 25232, '<td valign="top">George Michael? I think I''d rather look like Barbara Striesand. <br/> <br/>This was a last minute shot I did for fun that was posted at 11:58 PM EST, just 2 minutes before the deadline. I like taking pictures of other people but I see my mug in the mirror every morning, so it''s not all that new for me. Thanks for all the votes.</td>', 'George Michael? I think I''d rather look like Barbara Striesand.  This was a last minute shot I did for fun that was posted at 11:58 PM EST, just 2 minutes before the deadline. I like taking pictures of other people but I see my mug in the mirror every morning, so it''s not all that new for me. Thanks for all the votes.', '2005-02-21 10:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1186043, 146859, 23751, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I always get a kick out of pictures of people taking pictures.  And I love the orange - my favortite color!</td>', 'Nice job.  I always get a kick out of pictures of people taking pictures.  And I love the orange - my favortite color!', '2005-02-21 10:50:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1186049, 145078, 10275, '<td valign="top">The prettiest of them all. You look so beautiful. I did recognize you, but I didn''t vote in this challenge and didn''t comment (you know why).<br/> <br/>I really love the etheral feel of this photo. I don''t mind the overexposure, it adds that "high-key" feeling to it. Well done Sally.</td>', 'The prettiest of them all. You look so beautiful. I did recognize you, but I didn''t vote in this challenge and didn''t comment (you know why). I really love the etheral feel of this photo. I don''t mind the overexposure, it adds that "high-key" feeling to it. Well done Sally.', '2005-02-21 10:52:40.000000', NULL, 0),
