(1186395, 146622, 32488, '<td valign="top">Wow- you all are much kinder than I would think necessary!<br/>It was a "tongue-in-cheek" kind of entry and I certainly didnt expect an average of 5 ,but hey- if it made someone laugh then my intended use worked out ;)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow- you all are much kinder than I would think necessary!It was a "tongue-in-cheek" kind of entry and I certainly didnt expect an average of 5 ,but hey- if it made someone laugh then my intended use worked out ;) ', '2005-02-21 13:29:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1186403, 145611, 25655, '<td valign="top">I thought this one was yours, Julia.<br/>It''s hypnotic. I wouldn''t say sinister, but there is something about it that keeps me restless. <br/>The very warm colors against the cold, marble-like feel of the skin, the over-saturated look of the eyes, the weird looking shadows... <br/> <br/>not everything of your friend''s words were clear to me, but just one short and very simple sentence of it is enough for a life time:<br/>"I believe in the friendship, the kisses, rain, the smiles and the secrets".<br/> <br/>Shouldn''t we all?</td>', 'I thought this one was yours, Julia.It''s hypnotic. I wouldn''t say sinister, but there is something about it that keeps me restless. The very warm colors against the cold, marble-like feel of the skin, the over-saturated look of the eyes, the weird looking shadows...  not everything of your friend''s words were clear to me, but just one short and very simple sentence of it is enough for a life time:"I believe in the friendship, the kisses, rain, the smiles and the secrets". Shouldn''t we all?', '2005-02-21 13:31:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1186415, 146842, 8860, '<td valign="top">I too loved this - I voted it an 8. It''s got an ethereal vibe that, as Bod says, is quite difficult to define. Keep it up - buck the trends!</td>', 'I too loved this - I voted it an 8. It''s got an ethereal vibe that, as Bod says, is quite difficult to define. Keep it up - buck the trends!', '2005-02-21 13:36:18.000000', NULL, 0),
