(1186683, 146162, 26308, '<td valign="top">I did not vote in this challenge but if I had I would have understood the connection you were making.  It reminds me of the work of a photographer who made self-portraits out of things that had meaning to him or some connection to him, without ever putting himself into the picture.  Unfortunately, his name escapes me at the moment, and I feel silly for commenting without knowing his name, but I felt that I just had to say that I felt this was a very highly underrated photograph.</td>', 'I did not vote in this challenge but if I had I would have understood the connection you were making.  It reminds me of the work of a photographer who made self-portraits out of things that had meaning to him or some connection to him, without ever putting himself into the picture.  Unfortunately, his name escapes me at the moment, and I feel silly for commenting without knowing his name, but I felt that I just had to say that I felt this was a very highly underrated photograph.', '2005-02-21 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 0),
