(1186825, 145335, 93, '<td valign="top">I''ve posted a new After Challenge write up, since I''ve had a day to get over my disappointment of not hitting top 10 :)<br/> <br/>Feel free to read it.  As it says, thank you to everyone who commented.. there were some wonderful, encouraging comments from a huge number of really talented people that I admire and respect, and that, I think, beats a top 10 any day..  and don''t worry.. you''ll see me around in the future.. if another challenge comes up that kicks me in the head for an idea :)</td>', 'I''ve posted a new After Challenge write up, since I''ve had a day to get over my disappointment of not hitting top 10 :) Feel free to read it.  As it says, thank you to everyone who commented.. there were some wonderful, encouraging comments from a huge number of really talented people that I admire and respect, and that, I think, beats a top 10 any day..  and don''t worry.. you''ll see me around in the future.. if another challenge comes up that kicks me in the head for an idea :)', '2005-02-21 17:01:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1186867, 146484, 280, '<td valign="top">Don''t get me wrong 12th place is good, but I can''t belive you didn''t rank higher! The style of this shot just reminded me of some of the great photographers from the 60''s, like Barry Lategan and David Bailey.</td>', 'Don''t get me wrong 12th place is good, but I can''t belive you didn''t rank higher! The style of this shot just reminded me of some of the great photographers from the 60''s, like Barry Lategan and David Bailey.', '2005-02-21 17:27:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1186948, 146162, 11793, '<td valign="top">well it''s a pretty nice photo, and a subject rather popular here.<br/>i see no reason why interpreting an image as missing a challenge would cause so many to deduct all points.  personally i would hope at some point people will realize ( as mentioned above ) that there is more than your personal views on interpreting a challenge theme.<br/> <br/>i shutter to think how many images get completely overlooked here - minus the 3 second glance during voting.<br/> <br/>kudos...<br/> <br/></td>', 'well it''s a pretty nice photo, and a subject rather popular here.i see no reason why interpreting an image as missing a challenge would cause so many to deduct all points.  personally i would hope at some point people will realize ( as mentioned above ) that there is more than your personal views on interpreting a challenge theme. i shutter to think how many images get completely overlooked here - minus the 3 second glance during voting. kudos... ', '2005-02-21 18:09:19.000000', NULL, 0),
