(1187488, 145988, 30364, '<td valign="top">You don''t look much like you sound, Ed.  I had pictured more oval eyes and perhaps a roguish touch of 5-o''clock-shadow towards the southern extremeties of the bag.  The inscrutable expression is , however, exactly as I had anticipated.  I really can''t imagine how you managed to keep a straight face.</td>', 'You don''t look much like you sound, Ed.  I had pictured more oval eyes and perhaps a roguish touch of 5-o''clock-shadow towards the southern extremeties of the bag.  The inscrutable expression is , however, exactly as I had anticipated.  I really can''t imagine how you managed to keep a straight face.', '2005-02-21 22:47:18.000000', NULL, 0),
