(1187896, 146858, 20375, '<td valign="top">I scored this a 10. Should have finished higher.<br/>Was checking your profile and in viewing several photos <br/>of yourself I have to say the camera really likes you.<br/>Wish I looked so natural in front of the lens.<br/> <br/>This image is top ten, the voters have lost their minds.</td>', 'I scored this a 10. Should have finished higher.Was checking your profile and in viewing several photos of yourself I have to say the camera really likes you.Wish I looked so natural in front of the lens. This image is top ten, the voters have lost their minds.', '2005-02-22 06:03:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1187946, 146162, 27574, '<td valign="top">Robert, I really like this photo, it is well executed and the composition is very good. I think one of the main reasons that you got the score you did is that there are just too many photos to rate....it becomes overwhelming.  So often it is a quick reaction, no time to contemplate....and that is a shame, but I don''t know what the answer is. <br/> <br/>I gave this one a 5. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Robert, I really like this photo, it is well executed and the composition is very good. I think one of the main reasons that you got the score you did is that there are just too many photos to rate....it becomes overwhelming.  So often it is a quick reaction, no time to contemplate....and that is a shame, but I don''t know what the answer is.  I gave this one a 5.  ', '2005-02-22 06:55:49.000000', NULL, 0),
