(1192108, 146859, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by utro:</b></div><hr/><i> Thanks to everyone for their kind comments!  I''m really grateful.  I just hope it wasn''t a fluke and I continue to produce better photos than my first two challenges :p </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well this was NOT necessarily better than your first two challenges, Alison.  It is VERY good indeed, but I think your Bridge was even better, and I think maybe you might too.   ''Course, this one sure scored much higher!  But I don''t imagine either one was a fluke.</td>', 'Originally posted by utro: Thanks to everyone for their kind comments!  I''m really grateful.  I just hope it wasn''t a fluke and I continue to produce better photos than my first two challenges :p   Well this was NOT necessarily better than your first two challenges, Alison.  It is VERY good indeed, but I think your Bridge was even better, and I think maybe you might too.   ''Course, this one sure scored much higher!  But I don''t imagine either one was a fluke.', '2005-02-24 02:09:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1192121, 146420, 9906, '<td valign="top">JJ, I tried, I truly tried, but I could not help but add this to my favorites.  I strive to be half the photographer that you are.  If we weren''t half a world apart, I would beg you to allow me to follow you around so that I could attempt to get into the mind of a true master.<br/>Humbly yours,<br/>TC</td>', 'JJ, I tried, I truly tried, but I could not help but add this to my favorites.  I strive to be half the photographer that you are.  If we weren''t half a world apart, I would beg you to allow me to follow you around so that I could attempt to get into the mind of a true master.Humbly yours,TC', '2005-02-24 02:32:14.000000', NULL, 0),
