(1196575, 146029, 25553, '<td valign="top">not cheesy at all. i too lost my father who was very supportive to my artistic self, i always think of him and almost feel hes with me encouraging my artistic side. great picture.</td>', 'not cheesy at all. i too lost my father who was very supportive to my artistic self, i always think of him and almost feel hes with me encouraging my artistic side. great picture.', '2005-02-27 10:47:47.000000', NULL, 0),
