(1209862, 145611, 12611, '<td valign="top">grief is a dangerous muse, but perhaps not as bad as self pity. you have captured what is such a vibrant part of what photography does best- taking a real emotion and making it live beyond the exposure- much like our memories and feelings live beyond the subject''s life. very nice.</td>', 'grief is a dangerous muse, but perhaps not as bad as self pity. you have captured what is such a vibrant part of what photography does best- taking a real emotion and making it live beyond the exposure- much like our memories and feelings live beyond the subject''s life. very nice.', '2005-03-05 21:59:15.000000', NULL, 0),
