(1222080, 146450, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very natural shot all round - the light, experessions of love - and the composition is great. There''s a tangible bridge between you both, formed only by your eyes. As good a reason as any to find a shot for a challenge.<br/>: )</td>', 'Very natural shot all round - the light, experessions of love - and the composition is great. There''s a tangible bridge between you both, formed only by your eyes. As good a reason as any to find a shot for a challenge.: )', '2005-03-11 17:43:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1222420, 146592, 32569, '<td valign="top">I agree with Imagineer.  This photo really caought my breath and time just stopped.  It make me want to be related to the subject in the photo.  How come I didn''t see this photo when I voted?  I would definitely give it a 10.</td>', 'I agree with Imagineer.  This photo really caought my breath and time just stopped.  It make me want to be related to the subject in the photo.  How come I didn''t see this photo when I voted?  I would definitely give it a 10.', '2005-03-11 22:53:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1223410, 146602, 12611, '<td valign="top">this is nice. this has a great glow to it, a great creaminess to the skintone. It hurts my neck to look into your eyes, but I must say its interesting.</td>', 'this is nice. this has a great glow to it, a great creaminess to the skintone. It hurts my neck to look into your eyes, but I must say its interesting.', '2005-03-12 16:43:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1223411, 145749, 12611, '<td valign="top">The set up is flawless. I would have preferred it a touch darker and sharper. but overall, great expression.</td>', 'The set up is flawless. I would have preferred it a touch darker and sharper. but overall, great expression.', '2005-03-12 16:45:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1233282, 146450, 22872, '<td valign="top">I love this picture....nursing is one of the most rewarding experiences a mother can have.  I nursed my oldest only for a few months but I nursed my youngest until he was 3 (everyone had a heart attack)and it''s amazing how much closer you get with your child...  I only have the two but I would of had a gaggle if things had been different :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love this picture....nursing is one of the most rewarding experiences a mother can have.  I nursed my oldest only for a few months but I nursed my youngest until he was 3 (everyone had a heart attack)and it''s amazing how much closer you get with your child...  I only have the two but I would of had a gaggle if things had been different :) ', '2005-03-16 21:06:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1233790, 146843, 34154, '<td valign="top">definitely dont get rid of the freckles. nice photo, i like your portfolio</td>', 'definitely dont get rid of the freckles. nice photo, i like your portfolio', '2005-03-17 02:31:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1237569, 146450, 22734, '<td valign="top">I love this image because somrthing very natural has been captured here. There is an overall easeness which lends itself to projection. Melissa, you work is very good.</td>', 'I love this image because somrthing very natural has been captured here. There is an overall easeness which lends itself to projection. Melissa, you work is very good.', '2005-03-19 13:23:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1238575, 146162, 27812, '<td valign="top">Robt, I gave it a five, yip, it''s not a self portrait but on the merit of the photo I could never give it less. In another competition I would have given it at least a 8 to 10. Don''t let it get to you, look at my movies and pink and roadsign entries... Are they realy 4''s? But that''s the way others see it. Maybe one of the reasons why I''m seriously contemplating my participation in competitions. Who do I have to make happy?</td>', 'Robt, I gave it a five, yip, it''s not a self portrait but on the merit of the photo I could never give it less. In another competition I would have given it at least a 8 to 10. Don''t let it get to you, look at my movies and pink and roadsign entries... Are they realy 4''s? But that''s the way others see it. Maybe one of the reasons why I''m seriously contemplating my participation in competitions. Who do I have to make happy?', '2005-03-20 06:54:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1244555, 146029, 35304, '<td valign="top">Admittedly, I was more then a little intrigued by your title as it relates to grief for your father.  Your picture evokes quite a bit of emotion pain and sorrow still.  The gesture of your hands placed over your nose and mouth implies an effort to stop or hide.  Its ok, our father''s have always played such an important part in our lives, and they will continue to do so long after their pasting.<br/> <br/>I find that one of the most genuine and fascinating aspects of photography to be that a single picture (i.e. glimpse of a moment in time) has the ability to evoke such emotion, be it joy or sorrow, and that is truly exceptional.  I believe that as we capture these moments we measure their success based on many factors of these the most powerful are splendor &amp; emotion.  That sir you have achieved with your self-portrait revisited.  <br/> <br/>Thank you for sharing a glimpse of your travels in this journey called life.  <br/> <br/>Best regards,<br/> <br/>C.J.Gilreath<br/> <br/></td>', 'Admittedly, I was more then a little intrigued by your title as it relates to grief for your father.  Your picture evokes quite a bit of emotion pain and sorrow still.  The gesture of your hands placed over your nose and mouth implies an effort to stop or hide.  Its ok, our father''s have always played such an important part in our lives, and they will continue to do so long after their pasting. I find that one of the most genuine and fascinating aspects of photography to be that a single picture (i.e. glimpse of a moment in time) has the ability to evoke such emotion, be it joy or sorrow, and that is truly exceptional.  I believe that as we capture these moments we measure their success based on many factors of these the most powerful are splendor & emotion.  That sir you have achieved with your self-portrait revisited.   Thank you for sharing a glimpse of your travels in this journey called life.   Best regards, C.J.Gilreath ', '2005-03-23 01:18:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1271639, 146843, 17837, '<td valign="top">you my lady friend, are SMOKIN. Totally diggin the hair.</td>', 'you my lady friend, are SMOKIN. Totally diggin the hair.', '2005-04-05 01:26:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1273938, 146450, 7473, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture you have crafted.  What a moment on film!</td>', 'Beautiful picture you have crafted.  What a moment on film!', '2005-04-06 04:15:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1283699, 145677, 18450, '<td valign="top">Really love this shot!! The lighting and composition are wonderful.</td>', 'Really love this shot!! The lighting and composition are wonderful.', '2005-04-11 07:15:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1284247, 145699, 31606, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Upon first look I didn''t see your face.  Now I do.  I like the fact that you have to look hard to see your face. You have done a nice job with editing and with the desaturation.  Nothing looks blown out.  The only problem I see is the border gets lost on your left elbow.  But that is a minor flaw.  At first look I didn''t like the reflection on the binoculars but the longer I look at it the beeter I think it is with the reflection. Some will see the background as a bit busy but to me it helps your photo of course. I noticed in your notes that you cloned out some debris on your sleeve.  You have also done a nice job with that because I can''t tell where it was.  If you have any questions don''t hesitate to PM me.</td>', '*Critique Club* Upon first look I didn''t see your face.  Now I do.  I like the fact that you have to look hard to see your face. You have done a nice job with editing and with the desaturation.  Nothing looks blown out.  The only problem I see is the border gets lost on your left elbow.  But that is a minor flaw.  At first look I didn''t like the reflection on the binoculars but the longer I look at it the beeter I think it is with the reflection. Some will see the background as a bit busy but to me it helps your photo of course. I noticed in your notes that you cloned out some debris on your sleeve.  You have also done a nice job with that because I can''t tell where it was.  If you have any questions don''t hesitate to PM me.', '2005-04-11 14:41:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1285216, 146592, 7778, '<td valign="top">Something is in sync here. I''m happy to admit that I don''t know what it is. <br/>Everything I thought I''ve learnt, is off somewhere, irrelevantly afloat, sifting through lesser work it can get a handle on.<br/> <br/>My people, look at this photo! It is so unassuming, it had to be created according to its own laws. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Something is in sync here. I''m happy to admit that I don''t know what it is. Everything I thought I''ve learnt, is off somewhere, irrelevantly afloat, sifting through lesser work it can get a handle on. My people, look at this photo! It is so unassuming, it had to be created according to its own laws.  ', '2005-04-12 01:19:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1287827, 146221, 10342, '<td valign="top">I love this picture...so deep... makes you wonder what thoughts inspired the picture :))</td>', 'I love this picture...so deep... makes you wonder what thoughts inspired the picture :))', '2005-04-13 07:52:25.000000', NULL, 0);
