(1339963, 146420, 36701, '<td valign="top">i really love this picture. its great, nice job.</td>', 'i really love this picture. its great, nice job.', '2005-04-28 21:18:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1346828, 145842, 36361, '<td valign="top">Was just looking through your portfolio and I am completely in awe of your talent.  Can''t believe you are 15!  I''m sure you have great things in store for your future.</td>', 'Was just looking through your portfolio and I am completely in awe of your talent.  Can''t believe you are 15!  I''m sure you have great things in store for your future.', '2005-04-30 15:04:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1349100, 146592, 6870, '<td valign="top">I just discovered this beauty. This is really amazing work. Thanks for doing what needed to be done! If you keep this up, you won''t win many DPC ribbons, but your name will still be remembered as a great photographer in 200 years.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-01 10:58:34.</i></td>', 'I just discovered this beauty. This is really amazing work. Thanks for doing what needed to be done! If you keep this up, you won''t win many DPC ribbons, but your name will still be remembered as a great photographer in 200 years.', '2005-05-01 11:57:41.000000', '2005-05-01 11:58:34.000000', 0),
(1353499, 146819, 2560, '<td valign="top">Hey this really is a good photo. I bet it took some shots to get the focus just right. People vote down borders, just say no to borders. :)</td>', 'Hey this really is a good photo. I bet it took some shots to get the focus just right. People vote down borders, just say no to borders. :)', '2005-05-02 19:33:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1374566, 145842, 12896, '<td valign="top">just great!</td>', 'just great!', '2005-05-10 01:41:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1390079, 145676, 18028, '<td valign="top">I tonia, I just discovered this shot of yours and I must say, I find it quite appealing, especially as a self portrait.   Great  compo, color rendition and cool attitude...I really think you should shoot more glamour as you seem to have an eye for it.</td>', 'I tonia, I just discovered this shot of yours and I must say, I find it quite appealing, especially as a self portrait.   Great  compo, color rendition and cool attitude...I really think you should shoot more glamour as you seem to have an eye for it.', '2005-05-16 22:20:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1396000, 146162, 31036, '<td valign="top">I know it''s been a while since this challenge ended, but I just stumbled across it after not checking up on the portfolio of one of my favorite photographers in a while.<br/> <br/>I strongly agree with your argument. The meaning of a work of art is what is conveyed through the piece, by the artist; The meaning isn''t the forced opinion of the viewer, which, sadly, crops up here a little too often. I guess the expansion of mind philosophy associated with art fell through the cracks in some generation.<br/> <br/>What''s truly sad about this case in particular is that the photo not only stands on its own merits, but it meets the challenge too an expansive extent. The superficiality in judging... amazing.<br/> <br/>What makes one''s self is their thoughts, their mind, their beliefs, and what they do; not their appearance.<br/> <br/>It''s a beautiful photo, Robert. You should be proud.</td>', 'I know it''s been a while since this challenge ended, but I just stumbled across it after not checking up on the portfolio of one of my favorite photographers in a while. I strongly agree with your argument. The meaning of a work of art is what is conveyed through the piece, by the artist; The meaning isn''t the forced opinion of the viewer, which, sadly, crops up here a little too often. I guess the expansion of mind philosophy associated with art fell through the cracks in some generation. What''s truly sad about this case in particular is that the photo not only stands on its own merits, but it meets the challenge too an expansive extent. The superficiality in judging... amazing. What makes one''s self is their thoughts, their mind, their beliefs, and what they do; not their appearance. It''s a beautiful photo, Robert. You should be proud.', '2005-05-18 18:33:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1421658, 146848, 37719, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Very creative and good use of effects.</td>', 'Nice shot!  Very creative and good use of effects.', '2005-05-30 19:48:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1437814, 146162, 32754, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you''ll see this comment, but I just read the above comment concerning your self portrait, and for some reason I read it today.. a heck of long time afterward..but your words moved me to say that I agree with you..because I have experimented a lot with photographs and also perhaps because I paint, the urge to try different types of photos appeals to me...a lot of diversity from the norm is difficult here...people do not seem to see photographs as art in many cases; I like to use soft photos many times but I have been marked down harshly for use of soft images or unusual images, but it doesn''t bother me, I pursue my own vision anyway..as you must pursue yours, but I am open minded about all forms of art...the photo you entered was indeed beautiful but perhaps people just aren''t ready to see our minds, only our faces.</td>', 'I don''t know if you''ll see this comment, but I just read the above comment concerning your self portrait, and for some reason I read it today.. a heck of long time afterward..but your words moved me to say that I agree with you..because I have experimented a lot with photographs and also perhaps because I paint, the urge to try different types of photos appeals to me...a lot of diversity from the norm is difficult here...people do not seem to see photographs as art in many cases; I like to use soft photos many times but I have been marked down harshly for use of soft images or unusual images, but it doesn''t bother me, I pursue my own vision anyway..as you must pursue yours, but I am open minded about all forms of art...the photo you entered was indeed beautiful but perhaps people just aren''t ready to see our minds, only our faces.', '2005-06-06 21:55:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1438398, 145611, 19708, '<td valign="top">Wonderous things happen going through someone''s portfolio.<br/>Clicked on this thumbnail and had no idea what I was in for.<br/> <br/>Not sure many portraits on this site, or anywhere else for that matter, have caused so many mixed emotions. Had chills for a second, then felt a warmth, followed by a trance of sorts. Then sat and stared.<br/>As read your comments section, I was deeply moved and can''t even begin to describe the overall experience.<br/> <br/>Amazing work Julia!<br/> <br/>An instant favorite and will be back to revist often!!</td>', 'Wonderous things happen going through someone''s portfolio.Clicked on this thumbnail and had no idea what I was in for. Not sure many portraits on this site, or anywhere else for that matter, have caused so many mixed emotions. Had chills for a second, then felt a warmth, followed by a trance of sorts. Then sat and stared.As read your comments section, I was deeply moved and can''t even begin to describe the overall experience. Amazing work Julia! An instant favorite and will be back to revist often!!', '2005-06-07 06:12:18.000000', NULL, 0),
