(1481862, 145601, 16488, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 6 but never left a comment...It''s really hard to make a self-portrait, isn''t it.<br/> <br/>The moment in this photo is good..."Contemplation" is a perfect title.  Not quite silhouette, the lack of detail on the near side of the profile makes the blocking-out of your head un-pleasing to me.  Had you been on "this side" of the camera, I''m sure you would have realized that.  It is the setting that is so appealing, here.  The perfect moment in the morning when it''s right to be alone....</td>', 'I gave you a 6 but never left a comment...It''s really hard to make a self-portrait, isn''t it. The moment in this photo is good..."Contemplation" is a perfect title.  Not quite silhouette, the lack of detail on the near side of the profile makes the blocking-out of your head un-pleasing to me.  Had you been on "this side" of the camera, I''m sure you would have realized that.  It is the setting that is so appealing, here.  The perfect moment in the morning when it''s right to be alone....', '2005-06-24 18:55:38.000000', NULL, 0),
