(2488876, 146420, 48560, '<td valign="top">This self portrait of yours has been my personal favourite for as far as I can remember - and I cant believe I have never left a comment on it! So here I am, though a little late, but better than never, to leave a comment on this wonderful, fascinating, photo.<br/> <br/>what do I like about this?<br/>- the model: inviting, warm, and looked like he has stories to tell.<br/>- the lighting: inclusive of the exposure, I''d say you''ve captured it well. Just look at the hair, and the face. Superb.<br/>- tilted: it must have been accidental? but it works great. it somwhow makes the window-frame (naturally framed) stronger.<br/>- editing: the desaturation is very very suitable, with a brownish hue. Love it.<br/> <br/>crayon</td>', 'This self portrait of yours has been my personal favourite for as far as I can remember - and I cant believe I have never left a comment on it! So here I am, though a little late, but better than never, to leave a comment on this wonderful, fascinating, photo. what do I like about this?- the model: inviting, warm, and looked like he has stories to tell.- the lighting: inclusive of the exposure, I''d say you''ve captured it well. Just look at the hair, and the face. Superb.- tilted: it must have been accidental? but it works great. it somwhow makes the window-frame (naturally framed) stronger.- editing: the desaturation is very very suitable, with a brownish hue. Love it. crayon', '2006-06-06 03:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
