(6070364, 146162, 68947, '<td valign="top">Robert, I came to this shot through a discussion thread on the Self-Portrait II challenge.  Just wanted to say that I find both the title and the shot to be BRILLIANT!  Love your notes on it.  It makes perfect sense and fits well with what needs to be said. :)  (Had I said it, I would have been slammed LOL)</td>', 'Robert, I came to this shot through a discussion thread on the Self-Portrait II challenge.  Just wanted to say that I find both the title and the shot to be BRILLIANT!  Love your notes on it.  It makes perfect sense and fits well with what needs to be said. :)  (Had I said it, I would have been slammed LOL)', '2010-06-26 12:20:33.000000', NULL, 0),
